<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Satawalese</book>
  <para style="h">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matthew</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fangkenio We Foatogiaen Matthew</para>
  <para style="mt">Fangkenio We Foatogiaen Matthew</para>
  <para style="rem">Book introduction has been temporarily moved to the XXA book. Later it can be placed back here. (Paulus Kieviet, January 2019)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Rhaepeto Kkewe Aaen Jesus Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luke 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Ikkaan tettaenin rhaepeton Jesus Kristus, iiy erhaep saengi David, iwe nge David erhaep saengi Abraham.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Nge Abraham semaen Isaac, nge Isaac semaen Jacob, nge Jacob semaen Judah me mwaaen kkewe pwiin. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Nge Judah semaen Peres me Zerah (itaen ineer nge Tamar), iwe nge Peres semaen Hezron, nge Hezron semaen Ram. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Nge Ram semaen Amminadab, nge Amminadab semaen Nahshon, nge Nahshon semaen Salmon. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Nge Salmon semaen Boaz (itaen inan nge Rahab), nge Boaz semaen Obed (itaen inan nge Ruth), nge Obed semaen Jesse, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>nge Jesse semaen <char style="tl">king</char> David.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Nge David semaen Solomon, iwe e naini me wooan niewe pwiuniuwaen Uriah, <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>nge Solomon semaen Rehoboam, nge Rehoboam semaen Abijah, nge Abijah semaen Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Nge Asa semaen Jehoshaphat, nge Jehoshaphat semaen Jehoram, nge Jehoram semaen Uzziah. <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Nge Uzziah semaen Jotham, nge Jotham semaen Ahaz, nge Ahaz semaen Hezekiah. <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Nge Hezekiah semaen Manasseh, nge Manasseh semaen Amon, nge Amon semaen Josiah. <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Nge Josiah semaen Jehoiachin me mwaaen kkewe pwiin ikkiwe re asiiur nong noan Babylon.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Mwirin aar asiiur noa Babylon: Jehoiachin semaen Shealtiel, nge Shealtiel semaen Zerubbabel. <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubbabel semaen Abiud, Abiud semaen Eliakim, nge Eliakim semaen Azor. <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azor semaen Zadok, Zadok semaen Achim, nge Achim semaen Eliud. <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliud semaen Eleazar, Eleazar semaen Matthan, nge Matthan semaen Jacob. <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Jacob semaen Joseph iwe pwiuniuwaen Maria, niewe a nainitiw Jesus iwe re faingi pwe Kristus.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Seig me faawu saeren aeremas saengi Abraham ngaeni David, pwan seig me faawu saeren aeremas saengi David ngaeni oaton aar asiiur noa noan Babylon, pwan seig me faawu saeren aeremas saengi oaton we re asiiur noa Babylon ngaeni wupwutiwen Kristus.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wupwutiwen Jesus Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luke 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Ieen wunuunun aaen Jesus Kristus wupwutiw. Maria we inan a kkefoat ngaeni Joseph, nge igiwe resaaen pwiuppwiuniuw mwo nge a pwae pwe niewe a pwoopwo reen kkemenaen Espritu Santus. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Nge Joseph erhai mwaaen wenewen, ese mwerhaen aessaewa Maria me weni mmweer aeremas, iwe a niunniuwaennei epwene siusaengi, nge epwe feeori rhag noan mwoanomwoan. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Igiwe e rhiuwen niunniuwaennei wunuunun, erhai naiun Soamwoon angkenus a pwae ngaeni noan aan ttan nge a aengaeni pwe, “Joseph we tettaenin David, wosoapw mesag oamw wopwe pwiuniuwaeni Maria, pwe iiy a pwoopwo reen kkemenaen Espritu Santus. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Epwene naini erhai aetemwaaen, iwe wopwe aeita ngaeni Jesus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jesus </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wewen nge </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Soamwoon aemenewa</char></note> pwe iga iiy epwe aemenewaar naiun aeremas saengi aar monofit.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>A wen oanongaen minikkeei pwe epwe pwaeritae meeta we profeta a aepesa pwe mwaeniaei Soamwoon:<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Erhai aeterhooapwut epwene pwoopwo nge a naini erhai aetemwaaen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:23">repwe aeitae ngaeni Immanuel”, (wewen nge “Deus eno reerh”).<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Iwe oatowe Joseph a mmasetae, a feeori wunuunun miniwe angkenus we naiun Soamwoon e aepesa ngaeni. Iwe a pwiuniuwaeni Maria. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Nge Joseph ese maiur ngaeni Maria toori aan nainitiw aetewe naiun. Iwe, Joseph a aeita aetewe pwe Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Emwaamw Saengi Faniuwaen Eotiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Iwe, Jesus a wupwutiw noan Bethlehem we aepinoamwon Judea wene mweoiun <char style="tl">king</char> Erotes. Ese ssiunaei mwo mwirin, nge aaemweoi mwaaen saengi faniuwaen eotiw re metefaaegini wunuunun fiiu ra itto Jerusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Ra aeiineo pwe, “Iya iga eno <char style="tl">king</char> we aar re Jews ee iwe a supw? Aeiweri taetaen fiiu we aeginnen aan ittae me eotiw. Iwe aeiya itto pwe aeipwe aesirowu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Oatowe <char style="tl">king</char> Erotes a rongorong iiy kkepas we, a toagun aenneew noa nee tipan, pwan oanongeer noa rhooan Jerusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>A faingiir oanongeer soamwooniir patere kkewe, me sinsein anniug kkewe nge a aeiineeor aere iya iga Kristus epwe wupwutiw ee.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Iwe nge ra iura pwe, “Epwe wupwutiw me noan Bethlehem noan Judea. Pwe ieei wunuunun miniwe profeta we e foatogi pwe:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘Een Bethlehem noan faniuwaen Judah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">wosoapw foakkon sessoan me neeiin taeninimwaei Judah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">pwe erhai soamwoon epwe toowow saengiug, epwe nemaeni naeyi re Israel.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Iwe Erotes a faingiir rhooan emwaamw kkewe re ittiw me eotiw pwe repwe sseoiu noan mwoanomwoan. Iwe Erotes a aeiineo firhiir oaton taetaen fiiu we. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Mwirin nge a aefengaar noa Bethlehem nge a aetiwenig ngaeniir pwe, “Oawpwe noa giutta firhiy iiy aetena. Nge aere oawwa weri, oawwa aengaeniaei, pwe ngaang ipwe pwan noa aesirowu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Mwirin aaen <char style="tl">king</char> we kkepas ngaeniir iwe nge ra noa. Iwe, oatowe re feffaaeraeg noa, ra pwan weri sefaaeniy fiiu we reweri mwo me eotiw, nge a gommw noa memmweer a noa iugiu noa me wooan iimw we aetewe eno ee. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Oatowe reweri fiiu we nge ra igin kker. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Iwe, ra toonong noan iimw we nge ra weri aetewe me Maria iwe inan, iwe ra foatotiw me mmwan nge ra aesirowu. Mwirin ra iseni tiw niffang kkewe aar: <char style="tl">gold</char>, <char style="tl">frankincense</char> me <char style="tl">myrrh</char> iwe ra fang ngaeni.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00295B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="2.11"/><verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Iwe, Deus a kkepas ngaeniir noan aar ttan, pwe resoapw sefaaeniti Erotes, ina minne ra sefaaeniti faniuweer wooan eew noa aan.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Kkewaeg Noa Egypt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Mwiriir rhooan emwaamw kkewe ra noa, nge erhai naiun Soamwoon angkenus a pwae ngaeni Joseph noan aan ttan nge a aengaeni pwe, “Erotes imwu e giutta aetena pwe epwe niiy noa. Rhimwitae wopwe pwigi aetena me niemwu inan nge oawwa kkewaeg noa Egypt. Oawpwe noa no iginaan toori oatona ipwe aengaeniug pwe oawpwene sefaaen.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Iwe, Joseph a rhimwitae noan rhag pwongin we iwe a pwigi aetewe me niewe inan nge ra kkewaeg noa Egypt. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Ra noa no Egypt toori aaen Erotes mae noa. A wen minneei pwe epwe nnet miniwe profeta a aepesa pwe mwaeniaen Soamwoon, “Iya faingiwow mwaaen na Naeyi saengi Egypt.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Erotes a Niir Noa Aeten Bethlehem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Oatowe Erotes enoa giuneei noa pwe rhooawe re ittiw me eotiw re oatupwu, nge a igin soong. Iwe, a akkiuneo pwe repwe niir noa oanongeer aetemwaaen kka a ruwowu raegiir aere wonigaet tiw me faar me noan Bethlehem me niugiun Bethlehem. A feeori minneei, pwe e ayiureoyiura ngaeni oaton taetaen fiiu we a giuneei saengiir rhooawe re ittiw me eotiw.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>A wen minneei pwe epwe pwaeritae miniwe profeta Jeremiah e aepesa pwe:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Aeremas ra rongorong</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">mweireirei saeng me noan Ramah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Rachel a saengitiir aetekkewe naiun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Iwe esa rhipino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">pwe naiun ra maenoa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sefaaen Toor me Egypt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Mwirin aaen Erotes maenoa, erhai naiun Soamwoon angkenus a pwae ngaeni Joseph noan aan ttan me Egypt <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>nge a aengaeni pwe, “Wopwe rhimwitae nge wa pwigi aetena me niemwu inan iwe, oawwa sefaaen noa wooan faniuwaen Israel, pwe rhooawe re niunniuwaennei repwe niiy noa aetena nge ra maenoa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Iwe Joseph a rhimwitae, a pwigi aetewe me niewe inan nge ra sefaaeniti Israel.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Nge oatowe Joseph a rongorong pwe Archelaus a ssiuweniy <char style="tl">king</char> Erotes we seman me noan Judea, iwe a mesag aan epwe noa igiwe. Noan aan ttan, Deus a pwan aetiwenig ngaeni iwe ina minne a noa wooan faniuwaen Galilee reen <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>nge a noa no noan aepinoamw we itan Nazareth. Iwe ieei minne epwe pwaeritae minikkiwe profeta kkewe re aepesa, “Epwe ffai pwe iiy re Nazareth.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Aaen John Baptist Fenai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mark 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luke 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">John 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Reen oaton naan nge John Baptist a noa noan eew <char style="tl">desert</char> me noan Judea iwe a rhaepiy tae aan fenai. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>Iwe, a iura pwe, “Oawpwe toagun saengi monofitimi, pwe Mweoiu Naaeng a arapeto.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Iiy John miniwe profeta Isaiah e aepesa kkepesan iwe e iura pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Erhai a iyaekkepwas me noan <char style="tl">desert</char>:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Oawpwe oamoannatae ennepaen Soamwoon;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">oawpwe awenecchera eew aan pwe epwe faaeraeg wooan.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>John e memmengaag mengaag effeeor saengi iunaen <char style="tl">camel</char>, nge pwaanto na aan effeeor saengi ginin maan, nge anan mwongo ina manni neeiin waniwan ina nirhiugiunpweon me <char style="tl">honey</char>. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Aeremas ra maegeto reen saengi Jerusalem me oanongaen pwiuneoi me noan Judea, pwan saengi oanongaen pwiuneoi me niugiun pwupwu we Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Ra pwuwafayiuw noa monofitiir, nge John a paptismusaar noan pwupwu we Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Igiwe John a weriir towunepeer Pharisees me Sadducees kkewe re itto reen pwe epwe paptismusaar, a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi sowufaeng! Iyo e aengaenigaemi pwe oawpwe mmwenen kkewaeg saengi aaen Deus aegaeregaer iga epwe aefengato? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Oaw ssiuweniy wegitaegimi pwe epwe pwaeri noa pwe oawwa toagun saengi monofitimi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Oawsoapw niunniuwaennei pwe oawwa taaw saengi aaen Deus aegaeregaer reen aaemi aepesa pwe Abraham minne rhaepetomi. Ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe Deus emmwenen feeori faai kaan pwe tettaenin Abraham! <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Eew soapaen a oamoannatae pwe epwe gopiy tiw waniwan saengi waeran. Oanongaen waniwan kka ese gacch uwaan nge epwe gopogop tiw nge e aekkaerh nong noan aengaet.<verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>“Ngaang iya paptismusaegaemi reen rhaan pwe pwaepwaenoan aaemi toagun saengi monofitimi. Iwe nge erhai ina epwe itto me mwiriy epwe paptismusaegaemi reen Espritu Santus me aengaet. Iiy ina e taegias saengiaei, nge ese fin mwo nge aaei ipwe pwigi nokkaan. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>A kkemwarh aan sepwin pwe epwe aeyimweoiuw fesaenngiy faiun saengi peeon. Iwe, epwe ioni fengaenniy faiun nge a iseni nong noan aan imwaen iseis, nge peeon epwe oatoranong noan aengaet we ese mmwenen gunnoa.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paptismusaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mark 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luke 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Noan oaton naan nge Jesus a itto me Galilee a itto reen pwupwu we Jordan, pwe John epwe paptismusa. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Nge John a menaen epwe ssiuweniy aan niunniuwaen. Iwe, a aengaeni pwe, “Iureoyiureon pwe een wopwe faer paptismusaeyaei, nge meeta een wa faer noa itto reei reen?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Nge, Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Wopwe nigiti noa mwo ina. Pwe igina nge sipwe tapweei mwo oanongaen meeta tipaen Deus.” Iwe John a tipieew ngaeni.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Igiwe rhag Jesus a moann me paptismus noa, a teeotae me noan rhaan we. Iwe naaeng a sugaeg ngaeni nge a weri Espritu Santus aan ittiw nge eweei rhag erhai <char style="tl">dove</char> a ittiw soatiw wooan. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Iwe nge eew mangiungiu a ittiw me noan naaeng a aepesa pwe, “Ieei naeyi mwaaen aerhaengerhaeng, iye efin tipaei reen.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Sessoaton Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mark 1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luke 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Iwe Espritu a paeninoa Jesus noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we pwe epwe noa sessoat me reen Saetan. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Nge mwirin aaen Jesus aecchigipin noan faaeig raaen me faaeig pwoong, iwe a meyaefi aan pecchai. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Iwe, Saetan we a itto reen nge a aengaeni pwe, “Aere een Naiun Deus, wopwe aengaeniir faai kaan pwe repwe ssiuwen ngaeni fenoawa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Nge Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Saapw fenoawa rhag minne aeremas repwe menaw reen, pwe re menaw reen oanongaen kkepas kka Deus a aepesa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Iwe Saetan we a paeninoa Jesus Jerusalem, aepinoamw we e santus, nge a noa aiuwtae pwiuneoi we oarosaen taegias me reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we. <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>Iwe, a aengaeni pwe, “Aere een Naiun Deus, wa oatoroagotiw me igeei, pwe Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Deus epwe akkiuneeor naiun angkenus repwe aemmwenoag.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Repwe ammwarhiug tae noan paiiur</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">pwe pirhemw mwo nge ete woas ngaeni faai.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Pwapwior we e Santus epwan aepesa pwe, ‘Wosoapw soatoni Deus na oamw Soamwoon.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Mwirin Saetan we a pwan paenitae Jesus wooan eew rhug igin taegias nge a pwaeri ngaeni mweoiun feoniufan me oanongaen minikkena nningen. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Iwe, a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Oanongaen minikkeei ipwe ngaenneog, aere wopwe foatotiw me weni mmwaei nge wa oassotupw ngaeniaei.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Siunoa Saetan! Pwe Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Wopwe oassotupw ngaeni Deus na oamw Soamwoon nge iiy rhag wopwe engaang ngaeni.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Iwe rhag nge Saetan we a siusaengi Jesus, iwe nge angkenus ra itto tipaengi.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Rhaepiy Tae Aan Engaang Noan Galilee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mark 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luke 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Igiwe Jesus a rongorong pwe ra iseni nong John noan kanepwus, iiy a noa Galilee. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Ese notiw noan Nazareth, pwe a noa no noan Capernaum, eew aepinoamw oaron meoneoiniuniun Galilee noan faniuwaen Zebulun me Naphtali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>A feeori minneen pwe epwe nnet miniwe profeta Isaiah e aepesa pwe,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Faniuwaen Zebulun me faniuwaen Naphtali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">wooan aanna enoa ngaeni eew meoneoiniun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">peiginoan pwupwu we Jordan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">me Galilee, faniuweer rhooawe re Gentiles!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Aeremas kkewe reno noan rorhappiung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">repwene weri eew seram faeregit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">nge rhooakkena reno noan rorhappiungiun faniuwaen mae</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">ina eew seram epwene ttinitiw wooar.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Saengi iiy oatowe nge Jesus a rhaepiy tae aan fenai, “Oawpwe toagun saengi monofitimi, pwe Mweoiu Naaeng a arapeto!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Faingiir Faaman Rhooan Fita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mark 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luke 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Nipwaen aaen Jesus a faaeraeg ngaerhei meoneoiniuniun Galilee, a weriir riiurhai rhooan fita nge re pwipwi, Simon (pwan itan Peter) me Andrew iwe pwiin, rewuug fetaen iig noan iiy meoneoiniun we. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw itto tapweaei pwe ipwe oasuguuna ngaenigaemi wunuunun aaemi oawpwe fita aeremas.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Oatowe rhag nge ra siusaengi wuug kkewe aar nge ra tapweei noa mwirin.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Jesus a pwan faaeraeg noa nge a pwan weriir riiurhai mwaaen pwipwi, James me John, ikkiwe naiun Zebedee. Reno wooan pwoot we waar reen mwaaen we semeer Zebedee, re aemmwena wow wuug kkewe aar. Iwe nge Jesus a faingiir. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Oatowe rhag nge ra siusaengi pwoot we waar me mwaaen we semeer nge re tapweei noa mwirin.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Fenai me Aecchipwaar Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luke 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Iwe, Jesus a mwet fetaen wooan oanongaen Galilee, nge e fenai me noan wutteer Jews we nge e fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we reen Mweoiu Naaeng, me pwan aecchipwaar aeremas kkewe eweriir mesemesaen semwaai. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Kkepesaen Jesus a rheeoi noa wooan oanongaen faniuwaen Syria, iwe aeremas ra pweipwog to oanongeer rhooa semwaai reen, rhooakka eweriir mesemesaen semwaai me metaeg, aeremas kka waen aniu, man ngong me aeremas kka re maemerhoar. Iwe, Jesus a aecchipwaar tae oanongeer. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Re towunap aeremas kka rettapw mwirin Jesus saengi Galilee me Decapolis, saengi Jerusalem me Judea me faniuw we eno epeig me reen pwupwu we Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Fenai me Weei Rhug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Igiwe Jesus a weri pwuwaen aeremas kkewe, iwe a ittae wooan eew rhug a ittae mooat tiw. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Iwe, Jesus a rhaepetae aan fenai ngaeniir:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oanongonniuwaen Wenepwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luke 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Ra wenepwu rhooan giuneei pwe ngeoniiur e affayeo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">pwe iir repwe mweoiuni Mweoiu Naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Ra wenepwu rhooa nee tip cchoaw nee tipeer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">pwe Deus epwe rhipeer.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Ra wenepwu rhooa mesoan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">pwe iir repwe faniuwaeni feoniufan.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Ra wenepwu rhooan mwerhaen feeori minne epwiung me faaen mesaen Deus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">pwe Deus epwe fang ngaeniir minikkena re tipaeni.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Ra wenepwu rhooa ffayeo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">pwe Deus epwe pwan ffayeo ngaeniir.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Ra wenepwu rhooa nimegacch nee tipeer,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">pwe iir repwe weri Deus.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Ra wenepwu rhooan engaengaen oapoas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">pwe Deus epwe faingiir pwe iir naiun.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Ra wenepwu rhooa aewwaeiraes reen aar feeori nee tipaen Deus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">pwe iir repwe mweoiuni Mweoiu Naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Oaw wenepwu aaemi rhooana re ffeeoretae kkepesaemi, nge re aewwaeiraesigaemi, me aepesa aenneewagaemi pwe aegin ngaang. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Oawkker nge a mwamwaai nee tipaemi, pwe a yor paniuwaemi ina e igin faeregit me naaeng. Pwe ieei wunuunun aar pwan aewwaeiraesiir profeta kkewe regommw me mmwaemi.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aesiig me Seram</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mark 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luke 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Aaemi oawwa taeppen rhag aesiig faaen iteer aeremesaen feoniufan. Pwe aere aesiig esa saaet no, esoapw mmwen sipwe aesaaeti sefaaeniy. Iwe esa yor no ipitan, epwe aekkaerh wow pwe aeremas repwe pwuri fetaeneei.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Aaemi seremaen feoniufan. Eew aepinoamw ne eno wooan eew rhug esoapw mmwenen mwoanonoa. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Esooar erhai aeremas ne epwe figi eew oappwun nge a iseni nong faaen eew saepiy, pwe epwe faer iseni tae wooan nenien, pwe epwe aesseremaar rhooan iimw we. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Epwe ieei wunuunun seremaemi aan epwe ttin memmweer aeremas, pwe repwe giuneei aaemi wegitaeg mwamwaai iwe nge re aepingepinga Semaemi me wooai naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Fenaiuw Wunuunun Anniug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Oawsoapw niunniuwaennei pwe iya itto pwe ipwe oamoai noa Anniug kkewe aaen Moses me aar profeta kkewe kkepesaen fenai. Ngaang ise itto pwe ipwe itto oamoai noa, pwe ifaer itto pwe ipwe pwaeritae minna wenewenen. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe epat mwo aere efai mwo iirh me reen anniug eei nge esoapw aekkaerh noa toori aan toarop noa naaeng me soanop pwan toori aan epwe moann oanongaen meeta. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Iwe, ngaere erhai ese tapweei mwo nge eew anniug mwittig kkeei nge e oasuguuna ngaeniir aaemweoi pwe repwe pwan taeppen iiy, iiy epwe igin sessoan me noan Mweoiu Naaeng. Ngaere erhai epwe tapweei iiy anniug kkeei nge e oasuguuna ngaeniir aaemweoi pwe repwe pwan taeppen iiy, iiy epwe taegias me noan Mweoiu Naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe aaemi oawpwe mmwenen toonong rhag noan Mweoiu Naaeng igine aaemi e mwamwaai wegitaegimi saengiir sinsein anniug me Pharisees kkewe.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Soong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Oawwa rongorong aar aengaeniir aeremesaen mweoiwe pwe, ‘Wosoapw nni menaw aeremas. Iyo enni menaw aeremas epwe toonong noan nenien apwiung.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Nge ngaang ipwene aengaenigaemi: iyo e esoong ngaeni pwiin nge epwe noa noan nenien apwiung, nge iyo e aengaeni pwiin pwe, ‘Een esooar ipitoamw,’ epwe noa noan nenien apwiung na e taegias, nge iyo e aengaeni pwiin pwe, ‘Een wopwurh,’ nge epwe noa noan aengaetaen nifierno. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Iwe aere wopwe pwigitae oamw oasoar ngaeni Deus wooan antar, nge a maeng ngaeniug pwe pwiimw ecchoaw tipan woamw, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>wa nigiti mwo oasoar we oamw weni mmwan antar nge wa sefaaen, pwe oawpwe oamwusomwus fengaen. Mwirin wa sefaaeneto pwigitae oasoar we oamw ngaeni Deus.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Aere erhai a mwerhaen pwigiug noa noan nenien apwiung, wopwe mwetekkaein saeneti ffin nipwaen iga e rhiuwen yor oaton, weni mmwaen iga wopwe toori nenien apwiung. Pwe oatona wopwe toori rhag nenien apwiung, ina nge een wopwene noa reen soaw apwiung we, nge iiy epwene aefengoag noa nee paiiur police, nge iir repwene iseniug nong noan kanepwus. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe iginaan iga wopwe noa no e toori oamw wopwe piungiutiw oanongaen paniuwaen monofitimw.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiun Oamonofitin Maiur Ngaeniir Maan Pwiuppwiuniuw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Oawwa rongorong pwe re aepesa pwe, ‘Wosoapw maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe: aere erhai mwaaen a pipiiy erhai rhooapwut nge a rig nee tipan ngaeni, iiy a fasiun monofit reen aan maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai me noan nee tipan. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Iwe, aere ifirhin mesoamw e paeniug nong noan monofit, oannusuwow wa oatoranoa. Efaer gacch igine egiufet ireiren oanongoamw epwe ppiungiunoa, mmwaen igine wunusaen oanongoamw epwe aekkaerhnong noan nifierno. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Ngaere ifirhin poawumw e paeniug nong noan monofit, gopiy noa wa oatoranoa. Efaer gacch igine egiufet ireiren oanongoamw epwe ppiungiunoa, mmwaen igine wunusaen oanongoamw epwe toonong noan nifierno.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Mweoinoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mark 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luke 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Epwan aepesa pwe, ‘Erhai ne e asiuw noa pwiuniuwan nge epwe ngaenneei niewe erheo pwapwioron mweoinoa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi: aere erhai mwaaen a mweoi saengi pwiuniuwan reen ese tiwegin meeta ppweoniun, nge soapw reen aaen niewe maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai, iwe wonowe minne a monofit pwe a feeori niewe epwe oamonofit reen aan pwiuppwiuniuw sefaaen, nge iiy mwaaen na a pwiuniuwaeni, ina iiy a pwan feeori monofit.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Aekkepan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Oawwa pwan rongorong aar aengaeniir aeremesaen mweoiwe pwe, ‘Wosoapw misimis oamw aekkepan, nge wopwe faer feeori meeta e oamw aekkepan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aekkepan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ppwon faaen mesaen Deus ngaere aeremas</char></note> ngaeni Deus.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi: wosoapw aekkepan rhag. Wosoapw aekkepan faaen itaen naaeng, pwe ina nenien Deus, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>nge soapw pwan faaen itaen soanop, pwe ina aaen Deus nenien aseoseon pirheen, nge soapw pwan faaen itaen Jerusalem, pwe ina aepinoamwon <char style="tl">King</char> we egin taegias. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Wosoapw pwan aekkepan mwo nge faaen itaen rhimwemw, pwe wosoapw mmwenen aepwerhepwerha aere oarhonaanoa eyaen aennirhimwemw. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Wopwe aepesa, ‘Ewaer,’ aere ‘Aapw,’ pwe ese tiwegin minne wonaaen aepesa nge e itto saengi Man Aenneew we.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Appaniuwaenin Aenneew</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luke 6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Oawwa rongorong pwe re aepesa pwe, ‘Aere erhai e aettiwow efai mesoamw nge paniuwaenin wa pwan aettiwow efai mesan, nge aere erhai e aettiwow efoarh ngiimw, nge paniuwaenin wa pwan aettiwow efoarh ngiin.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi: oawsoapw paniuwaeni aaen aeremas aenneew ngaenigaemi. Aere erhai e ppeosepa ne oawusupoamw me wooan peig mwaaenemw, pwan wegeti ngaeni ne oawusupoamw me wooan peig rhooapwutomw. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Aere erhai e pwigiug noa noan nenien apwiung pwe epwe pwigi mengaagiumw mengaag, faer pwan nigiti ngaeni siketa na pwe pwan mengaagiun. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Aere erhai sonotaw e akkiuneog pwe wopwe pwigi ngaeni pisaegin noan eew <char style="tl">mile</char>, faer pwigi ngaeni noan ruwowu <char style="tl">miles</char>. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Aere erhai a tingoareog meeta oamw, ngaenneei, ngaere erhai a mwerhaen aeyae mwo meeta pisaegimw, fang ngaeni.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Aarh Sipwe Aerhaengiir Rhooan Oapwutaegirh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luke 6.27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Oawwa rongorong pwe re aepesa pwe, ‘Oaw aerhaengiir rhooan weni oaromi, nge oaw oapwutaar rhooan oapwutaegaemi.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi: oawpwe aerhaengiir rhooan oapwutaegaemi nge oawwa maeipin faaen iteer rhooakkena re aewwaeiraesigaemi, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>pwe oawpwe no pwe naiun minna Semaemi wooai naaeng. Pwe iya aettina feeorian aenet wooar aeremas aenneew me aeremas gacch, nge a apiungiutiw worhow wooar rhooakkena reffeeor mwamwaai me rhooakkena reffeeor aenneew. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Meeta faan Deus epwe fang niffengaemi aere oaw aerhaengiir rhag rhooa na re aerhaengigaemi? Pwan rhooan iyoiyon mwo <char style="tl">tax</char> nge refeeori minna. <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Aere weni maereyaeremi rhag minne wogaen kekkepas ngaeniir, ina nge minna wofeeori nge ese pwan wen saengiir aaemweoi. Pwan re Gentiles mwo nge refeeori taeppen minna. <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Iwe aaemi oawpwe igin menaw gacch pwe oawpwe taeppen rhag gacchiun minna Semaemi wooai naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Ammwen Ngaeniir Rhooa Affayeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Oawpwe aefaenniy pwe oawsoapw feeori feoffeeoriun aaemi tiwegin faaen meseer aeremas pwe repwe weri meeta oawwa feeori. Pwe aere oawfeeori taeppen minneen nge oawsoapw pwigi paniuwaemi me reen minna Semaemi wooai naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Iwe aere oawfang ngaeni erhai man affayeo eew aegiaeg, oawsoapw aeni oangonongon minne oawwa feeori, oawte taeppeer rhooa oatupwutupw kka refeeori noan wutteer Jews me pwan wooan ennap. Refeeori minneen pwe aeremas repwe ngonotiir. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe ra moannon pwigi paniuweer. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Ngaere oawwa fang ngaeni erhai man affayeo eew meeta, oawpwe feeori noan mwoanomwoan, pwe rhooan oaromw mwo nge resoapw giuneei wunuunun. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Ina nge epwe mwoanomwoan meeta oawwa feeori. Nge Semaemi a weri minne oawwa feeori noan mwoanomwoan epwe aesefaaeni ngaenigaemi paniuwaenin.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Maeipin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luke 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Igine oawpwe maeipin, oawsoapw taeppeer rhooa oatupwutupw kkewe. Re tipaeni repwe gaen iutae nge ra maeipin me noan wutteer Jews me noan oapwugopwugon ennap, pwe aeremas repwe weriir. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe ra moann me pwigi paniuweer. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Ngaere aaemi oawpwe maeipin, oawpwe toonong noan aaemi sengkin, oawwa ttiy noa asam nge oawwa maeipin ngaeni Semaemi ina oawse weri. Iwe, Semaemi epwe weri minikka oawwa feeori noan mwoanomwoan epwe aesefaaeni ngaenigaemi paniuwaenin.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Ngaere oaw maeipin, oawsoapw aeyae towunepaen petenaen kkepas kka esooar faan, taeppeer re Gentiles regaen feeori minneei, pwe re maengiy pwe aar deus repwe aiussaening aar maeipin pwe iga e igin faeremworh.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="HK00272B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="6.7"/> <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Oawsoapw taeppeer, pwe Semaemi a fasiun giuneei meeta aaemi mwerhaen weni mmwaen iga aaemi oawpwe tingoar ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Iwe, epwe ieei wunuunun aaemi oawpwe maeipin:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Semmaem wooai naaeng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">aemwo epwe ssoar minna itoamw ina e santus,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>aemwo Mweoiumw epwe war,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">aemwo nee tipoamw epwe no</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">wooan feoniufan wunuunun rhag noan naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Ngaennegemaem mwongoi raaeneei aeipwe mwongo igina.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Wopwe saeneti noa aemaem monofit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">wunuunun pwan aemaem aeiya saenetiir noa rhooakkena re monofit ngaenigemaem.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Wosoapw oatonongegemaem noan sessoat,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">nge wopwe aengesagemaem saengi Man Aenneew we.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">[Pwe oamw rhag mweoi me manaman me nning esoapw iug. Amen.]’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Aere oawpwe saeneti noa aar aeremas monofit, ina nge Semaemi wooai naaeng epwe pwan saeneti noa aaemi monofit. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Nge aere oawsoapw saeneti noa aar aeremas monofit, Semaemi esoapw pwan saeneti noa aaemi monofit.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Aecchigipin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Ngaere oawpwe aecchigipin, oawsoapw mas affayeo taeppeer rhooa oatupwutupw kkewe regaen feeori. Ra mas affayeo noa, pwe aeremas repwe giuneei pwe ra aecchigipin. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe ra faer moannon pwigi paniuweer. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Ngaere aaemi oaw aecchigipin, oawpwe woraes me kkomwuuw rhimwemi, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>pwe aeremas resoapw giuneei pwe oawwa aecchigipin, pwe aaen manna rhag Semaemi ina oawse weri minne e giuneei. Nge Semaemi iwe e giuneei minne oawwa feeori noan mwoanomwoan epwe aesefaaeni ngaenigaemi paniuwaenin.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Wenepwuwarh me Wooai Naaeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luke 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Oawsoapw iseis wiinaemi wooai soanop, pwe manepwur me iyow repwe fereei noa, nge rhooa mwoarho repwe fereei nong nge ra pirifa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Nge oawpwe faer iseis wenepwuwaemi wooai naaeng, iga manepwur me iyow resoapw mmwenen fereei, nge rhooa mwoarho resoapw mmwenen fereei nong nge ra pirifa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Pwe pwunnomi epwe no rhag iga wenepwuwaemi eno ee.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Seremaen Oanong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luke 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Maas eweei rhag oappwunon oanong. Pwe aere mesoamw effat, oanongan noa oanongoamw epwe seram. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Ngaere mesoamw ese ffat, oanongan noa oanongoamw epwe rorhappiung. Pwe aere minna aesseremaen oanongoamw ese seram, nge epwe ifa mwo rorhappiungiun minna nee tipaemi!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiuw Wunuunun Deus me Minikka Pisaegirh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luke 16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Ese mmwen erhai epwe engaang ngaeniir riiurhai maasta. Ina epwe oapwuta erhai, nge aerhaengi iwe erhai, me ngaere epwe mwamwaai ngaeni erhai, nge a aenneew ngaeni erhai. Ese mmwen oawpwe engaangappag ngaeni Deus me senaapiy.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Ina minne ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe oawsoapw aiunaeng reen mwongo me rhaan pwe oawpwe menaw reen, ngaere mengaagiun oanongaemi. Pwe meeta, ese rhaeng rhag menaw me mmwaen mwongo? Nge ese rhaeng noa rhag oanong me mmwaen mengaag? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Oaw pipiir man aeniaen: Rese foat faiun waniwan, me giniiy uwaan, pwe repwe seoiyeoninong noan soko, nge Semaemi wooai naaeng efang rhag aeneer. Pwe meeta, ese temoag noa egius rhaengimi memmweer man aeniaen? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Eyor neeimi epwe mmwenen enaenaei noa egius menewan reen aan aiunaeng?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aere: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Eyor erhai me neeimi ne epwe mmwen aenaenaeinoa egius taegiasan oanongan reen aan aiunaeng? </char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Meeta oaw aiunaeng reen mengaag reen? Oawfan ngaeni peeon waniwan wunuunun aar menawtae: rese engaang, nge rese pwan ffeeor mengaagiiur. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe igiwe mwo <char style="tl">king</char> Solomon e menaw iwe erhai man ssow wiinan nge esooar mengaagiun ne enning noa me mmwaen peeon waniwan kaan. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Pwe Deus minne aememmengaagiur fetinen neeiin waniwan — fetin kka eyor igina, nge resoapw nonoa naiu, pwe ra figaeg noa newumw. Pwe meeta, Deus esoapw mmwenen aememmengaagiugaemi? Me gaen mwittiginen aaemi niugiuniug!<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Ieei minne oawsoapw aiunaeng nge aepesa pwe, ‘Meeta sipwe mwongo?’ aere ‘Meeta sipwe iuniumi?’ aere ‘Meeta sipwe memmengaag?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>(Pwe ikkaan minikka re Gentiles retip mwaramwar reen.) Semaemi wooai naaeng e giuneei pwe oawpwe ammweneni oanongaen minikkeei. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Nge oawpwe gommwaen giutta minna Mweoiun Deus me minikkena e mwerhaen pwe oawpwe feeori, iwe, iiy epwe ngaennegaemi oanongaen minikkeei. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Ieei minne oawsoapw aiunaengiy naiu reen, pwe naiu epwe sipegin feeori aiunaengin. Esooar ipitan sipwe oatomoga noa aiunaengiy noan eraaen me eraaen.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Wunuunun Apwiungiun Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luke 6.37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Oawsoapw apwiungiu aeremas, pwe Deus ete pwan apwiungiugaemi. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Pwe Deus ina epwe pwan apwiungiugaemi taeppen rhag aaemi apwiungiiur aaemweoi, epwe pwan aeyae ngaenigaemi anniug kena oawpwan aeyae ngaeniir aaemweoi. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Meeta wa weri peipei na noan mesaen pwiimw, nge wose weri soapwon irae mwu noan mesoamw? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Epwe ifa wusun oamw wopwe aengaeni pwiimw pwe, ‘Itto ipwe tipwei wow peipei mwu noan mesoamw,’ iga een nge eno eew soapwon irae noan mesoamw? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Een erhai man oatupwutupw! Wopwe mmwaen tipwei wow soapwon irae mwu noan mesoamw, nge wopwe naaen weri gacchiuw oamw tipwei wow peipei na noan mesaen pwiimw.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Oawsoapw ngaenneei gonaag minne essoar, pwe rete pwan toagun nge re giugaemi. Oawsaapw oatora ngaeniir sino aaemi faiun usowus eyor ipitan, pwe iir repwe pwuritiw faaen pirheer.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tingoar, Giutta me Apiungiupiung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luke 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Oawpwe tittingoar, ina nge epwe yo ngaenigaemi; oawpwe giutta, ina nge oawpwe weri; oawpwe apiungiupiung wooan asam, ina nge epwe sugaeg ngaenigaemi. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Pwe iyo a tittingoar nge epwe yo ngaeni, nge iyo a giutta epwe weri, nge asam epwe sugaeg ngaeni iyo na e apiungiupiung. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Iyo neeimi saam epwe ngaenneei naiun efai faai igine e tingoar fenoawa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Ngaere epwe tingoar erhai iig, wopwe mmwenen ngaenneei erhai sowufaeng? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Iwe, inamwo aaemi aeremas aenneew, nge oawwa giuneei aaemi oawpwe fang ngaeniir naimi minikka e mwamwaai. Epwe pwan ifa mwo nepan aaen minna Semaemi wooai naaeng ngaenneer minikka e mwamwaai rhooakkena re tingoar ngaeni!<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Oawpwe feeori ngaeniir aeremas taeppen meeta na aaemi oaw mwerhaen pwe repwe feeori ngaenigaemi. Pwe ieei oawuton aaen Moses Anniug me aar profeta kkewe kkepesaen fenai.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asam we e Rheogit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luke 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Oawtonong noan asam na e rheogit! Pwe aesemaen nifierno ina e rheonap, nge aan na eyan ngaeni nge e mererhaeg, nge towunepaen aeremas retaeri. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Nge aesemaen menaw ina e rheogit, nge aan na eyan ngaeni nge e waeiraes, nge fitiman rhag aeremas kka re rhuungi.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efoarh Waniwan me Uwaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luke 6.43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Oawpwe aefaennigaemi reer profeta oatupwutupw kkewe, ra itto reemi taeppen rhag <char style="tl">sheep</char>, nge nee tipeer a aeffitaeg ngaeni rhag <char style="tl">wolves</char> kkewe re mwoarho. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Oawpwe giuneer reen meeta kka ra feeori. Aekkaew irae towfanfan resoapw uwaeni uwaen <char style="tl">grape</char>, nge fetin towfanfan resoapw uwaeni uwaen <char style="tl">fig</char>. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Efoarh waniwan gacch epwe uwa gacch, nge efoarh waniwan aenneew epwe uwa aenneew. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Efoarh waniwan gacch esoapw mmwenen uwa aenneew, nge efoarh waniwan aenneew esoapw mmwenen uwa gacch. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Nge oanongaen waniwan kka ese gacch uwaan repwe gopogop tiw pwe repwe aekkaerhnong noan aengaet. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Iwe ina aaemi oawpwene giuneer profeta oatupwutupw me reen minikka ra feeori.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngaang Ise Giunegaemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luke 13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Saapw oanongeer rhooakka re faingiaei pwe ‘Soamwoon, Soamwoon,’ nge repwe toonong noan Mweoiu Naaeng, pwe rhooawe rhag refeeori nee tipaen minna Semaei wooai naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Ngaere enoa tooto Raaenin Apwiung, repwe gin ssow rhooa kkomwu repwe aengaeniaei pwe ‘Soamwoon, Soamwoon! Faaen itoamw minne aeiya fenaiuw minna oanoon Deus, faaen itoamw minne aeiya asiiur wow towunepeer aniu aenneew, nge pwan faaen itoamw minne aeiya feeori towunepaen kkeman.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Iwe ngaang ipwene aengaeniir pwe, ‘Ngaang ise giunegaemi. Oawsiu noa me reei, aaemi man aenneew kena.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Riiurhai Rhooan Kaiu Iimw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Iwe iyo kka re rongorong minikka mwaeniaei nge re tapweei, ina nge re taeppen mwaaen reepiy we e aiuwtae imwan wooan porow. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Iwe, a piung worhow, nge a pwurutae rhaan nge a igin ngiung aaeng. Nge iiy iimw we ese toaroponoa, pwe iga e kaiutae wooan porow.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Iwe nge iyo kka re rongorong minikka mwaeniaei nge rese tapweei, ina nge ra taeppen erhai mwaaen tipoarorh, e aiuwtae imwan wooan ppiy. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Iwe, a piung worhow nge a pwurutae rhaan nge a igin ngiung aaeng. Nge enoa toarop iimw we, nge a ifa mwo nepaen aan ffeir noa!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minna Nemaeniaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Igiwe Jesus a moann aan aepesa minikkaan nge pwuwaen aeremas ra mwaar reen wunuunun aan fenai, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>pwe ese taeppen sinsein anniug kkewe, pwe iiy e fenai faaen minna nemaenian.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mark 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luke 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Igiwe Jesus a ittiw me wooan rhug we, re towunap aeremas kka re tapwetiw mwirin. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Iwe, erhai mwaaen eweri kaenepaai a itto reen Jesus, a foatotiw me mmwan nge a aengaeni pwe, “Menap, aere wo mwerhaen, wa aecchipwanoa aaei semwaai.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Jesus e angenoa nge a geotteopa mwaaen we, nge a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ngaang i mwerhaen, wone cchipw noa!” Reen rhag oatowe nge a cchipw noa miniwe semwaaiun mwaaen we. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Pipiiy, wosoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai minneei, nge wa faaeraeg uwen noa reen patere pwe epwe weriug. Iwe nge a feeori oasoar we Moses e akkiuneo, pwe epwe pwaeri ngaeniir aeremas pwe wa nimegacch noa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Rhooan Engaang Naiun Sonotaw we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luke 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Oatowe Jesus a toonong noan Capernaum, erhai soamwoonin sonotawaen Rome a itto nge a tingoar maaw ngaeni, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>iwe a iura pwe, “Soamwoon, naeyi rhooan engaang a no rhag nee iimw, ese mmwenen mwagiut, nge a pwan igin metaeg.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Ipwe noa pwe ipwe noa aecchipwa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Nge soamwoonin sonotaw we a aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, ngaang soapw erhai man yor ipitan reen oamw wopwe itto noan imwaei. Nge wopwe aepesa rhag epat kkepas, nge rhooan engaang we naeyi epwe mamaaw tae. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Ngaang mwo nge pwan ngaang erhai mwaaen ino faaen nemaeniaen erhai e soamwoon saengiaei, nge epwan yor sonotaw kka reno faaen nemaeniaei. Ipwe aengaeni inaan pwe, ‘Wopwe noa,’ iwe a noa; iya aengaeni inaan pwe, ‘Wopwe itto,’ iwe a itto; iwe iya aengaeni rhooan akkiuneo, ‘Feeori minneen,’ iwe a feeori.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Igiwe Jesus a rongorong kkepas kkeei, a riutae reen nge a aengaeniir aeremas kkewe rettapw noa mwirin pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, ise giuneei mwo nge erhai me noan Israel epwe ieei wusun aan niugiuniug. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe re towunap aeremas repwe itto saengi eotiw me netow nge repwe mooat oaron Abraham, Isaac me Jacob noan gupwunnap na noan Mweoiu Naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Nge rhooawe repwe no noan Mweoiu Naaeng repwe oatorawow noan rorhappiung, iga repwe sessaeng nge akkaarengi me ee.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni soamwoonin sonotaw we pwe, “Sefaaen noa noan imwoamw; meeta wa niugiuniug ngaeni, epwe pwan wen ngaeniug.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Iwe rhag nge rhooan engaang we naiun a mamaaw tae.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Towunepaen Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mark 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luke 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Iwe, Jesus a noa reen imwaen Peter. A noa giuneei niewe inaen pwiuniuwaen Peter ewon noan gien pwe a igin pwerhikkar ginin. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Jesus a geotteopa rhag paiun, nge esaer noa pwerhin niewe. Mwirin niewe a rhimwitae a ittae engaang ngaeni.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Igiwe a nee oatofaaef noa, aeremas ra pwigiir to reen Jesus pwuwaen aeremas kkewe eyor aniu aenneew wooar. Jesus a asiiur wow aniu aenneew reen petenaen mwaenian, nge a aemaemaewaar tae rhooawe re semwaai. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>A feeori minneen pwe epwe pwaeritae miniwe profeta we Isaiah a aepesa pwe, “Iiy e arhiuwa aarh semwaai nge aiuferanoa mesemesaen aarh semwaai.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Mwerhaen Tapweei Mwirin Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luke 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Igiwe Jesus a giuneei pwuwaen aeremas kkewe me oaron, a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe fatiun noa epeig meoneoiniun we. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Iwe, erhai sinsein anniug a itto reen nge a aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, ese tiwegin iga wopwe noa ee nge ngaang ipwe tapweog.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “<char style="tl">Fox</char> eyor ngeteer, man aeniaen eyor feseer, iwe nge mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas esooar eew pwiuneoi ne epwe noa wonotiw aseoseo ee.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Nge erhai mwaaen pwan iiy rhooan kkayeo a aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, mmwaen fang mwo ngaang ipwe sefaaen noa nipwaeni noa mwaaen na semaei.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Itto tapweaei nge wa nigitiir rhooa mae repwe sipegin nipwaeni aar mae.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Oapoassaetiw Eew Aaeng Cchoaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mark 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luke 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Jesus a teeotae wooan pwoot we nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra tapweei. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Ese mmwaei mwo nge eew mwoor enoa itto noan meoneoiniun we, nge pwoot we a arapakkaan aan epwene mweoiusiutiw. Nge Jesus e maiur. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa reen, nge ra faingitae. Ra aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, aemenewaegemaem pwe sipwene mae!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oawwa mesag reen? Me gaen mwittiginen aaemi niugiuniug!” Iwe a iutae nge a kkepas sseor ngaeni aaeng me noa pwe repwe poas noa, iwe rhag nge a niuwanoa wooai saaet.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Iwe, mwaaen kkewe ra riutae nge ra aepesa pwe, “Meeta taeppen aeremas een? Iye aaeng mwo me noa nge re tapweei mwaenian!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwaar Riiurhai Mwaaen Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mark 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luke 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Igiwe Jesus a toori faniuwaen Gadara eno epeig meoneoiniun we, a itto rhuungiir riiurhai mwaaen retowow me noan paeyi kkewe. Mwaaen kkeei nge ewartae aniu aenneew wooar, nge re igin aemmesag ina minne esooar ne e rhiuwen taeri aan een reen. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Reen rhag oaton een nge ra aekkepwastae pwe, “Naiun Deus, meeta minne wo tipaeni me remaem? Wa itto pwe wopwe itto aeppaetigimaem mmwaen oaton apwiung?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Eno eew cchon sino re mwommwongo fetaen me peiginoar. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Iwe aniu aenneew kkewe ra aeffaenipirhe ngaeni Jesus pwe, “Aere wopwe asiugemaem, fangenoa aemaem neeiir sino kenaan.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa!” Iwe ra toowow me wooar mwaaen kkewe nge ra noa wartae wooar sino kkewe. Iwe cchon sino kkewe ra fattapw tiw wenepeigin rhug we e ittiw noan meoneoiniun we ittiw moapw noa.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Mwaaen kkewe rhooan ffooanon sino ra fattapw noa ra ittiw nee aepinoamw, iwe ra ittiw fioangei oanongan meeta kkewe a wen ngaeniir mwaaen kkewe ewartae aniu aenneew wooar. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Iwe oanongeer rhooan aepinoamw we ra noa pwe repwe noa rhuungi Jesus. Nge igiwe ra weri, ra aeffaenipirhe ngaeni pwe epwe siusaengi miniwe faniuweer.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Maemerhoar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mark 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luke 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Jesus a teeotae wooan pwoot we nge a sefaaeniti miniwe aepinoamwon iwe eno epeig meoneoiniun we. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra pwigito reen erhai mwaaen e maemerhoar ewon noan epeo giegiy. Igiwe Jesus a weri nepaen aar niugiuniug rhooawe, a aengaeni mwaaen we e maemerhoar pwe, “Aetemaegin naeyi! Monofitimw a mwusunoa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Iwe aaemweoi sinsein anniug kkewe ra niuwaennei pwe, “Mwaaen een e aepesa aenneewa Deus!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Nge Jesus a giuneei niunniuwaen kkewe aar nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oaw niuwaennei minikkena e aenneew reen? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>E mererhaeg pwe sipwe aepesa pwe, ‘Monofitimw a mwusunoa,’ aere sipwe aepesa pwe, ‘Iutae wa faaeraeg noa’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Iwe, ngaang ipwe pwaeri ngaenigaemi pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas eyor maemaewan wooan soanop pwe epwe oamwusa noa monofit.” Iwe, a aengaeni mwaaen maemerhoar we pwe, “Iutae, pwigi giemw nge wa noa noan imwoamw.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Iwe mwaaen we a iutae nge a noa noan imwan. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Igiwe aeremas ra weri miniwe, ra mesag tae nge ra aepingepinga Deus reen aan ngaenneer aeremas taeppen mamaaw we.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Faingi Matthew</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mark 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luke 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Jesus a siusaengi igiwe nge a weri erhai rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> itan Matthew, emooat noan aan <char style="tl">office</char>. Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Itto tapweaei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Iwe Matthew a iutae nge a tapweei noa mwirin.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Igiwe Jesus a mwongo noan imwaen Matthew, nge re towunap rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit ra itto tapweei Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun reen <char style="tl">table</char> we. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Oatowe aaemweoi Pharisees kkewe ra giuneei miniwe, ra aeiyegiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Meeta faan naimi sinsei a mwongo ngaeniir rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit kena reen?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Jesus a rongorong aar kkepas nge a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Rhooakka rese semwaai rese noa reer toagota, pwe rhooakka refaer semwaai. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Oawnoa giutta faaen kkepas een me noan Pwapwior we e Santus: ‘Faayeow minne ngaang i tipaeni, nge saapw maan kkena aar oasoar ngaeniaei.’ Ngaang ise itto pwe ipwe faingiir rhooa mwamwaai, pwe faer rhooa monofit.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Aecchigipin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mark 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luke 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun John Baptist ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta faan aemaem me Pharisees aeisooaw aecchigipin, nge rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw rese aecchigipin reen?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oaw niuwaennei nge epwe aenneew tipeer rhooakkena re itto reen gupwunon appwiuniupai we igiwe <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we e rhiuwen no reer? Aapw! Nge epwe itto raaenin na repwe pwigi saengiir <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we, nge ina oatona repwene aecchigipin noa.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Esooar erhai epwe aeyae mengaag ffeo aan epwe pinisa tae wooan erheo mengaag maerhiy, pwe mengaag ffeo we epwe fereei noa mengaag maerhiy we, nge miniwe taeringen epwene faer gin temoag noa. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Esooar erhai epwe aenianong <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo noan nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> maerhiy, pwe ina epwe pwoanoa nge <char style="tl">wine</char> we e nipiwow nge nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> we epwe ffeir noa. Pwe faer <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo epwe itinong noan nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo, pwe ina nge oanongaen repwe gacch.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aemenewaetae Erhai Aeterhooapwut Nge e Aecchipwatae Erhai Rhooapwut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mark 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luke 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Igiwe Jesus e aepesa minneen, erhai soamwoonin Jews a itto reen, a foatotiw mmwan nge a aengaeni pwe, “Naeyi aeterhooapwut a maenoa igina, nge wopwe itto rhag iseni tae poawumw wooan, pwe epwe menaw.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Iwe, Jesus a iutae nge a tapweei noa, nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra pwan tapweei.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Eno erhai rhooapwut neeiir eseiug aan peitaeg noa noan seig me ruwowu raeg, a itto me niugiusagiuriun Jesus nge a geotteopa soapwon mengaagiun. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>A niuwaennei nong nee tipan, “Aere i geotteopa rhag mengaagiun nge ipwe mamaaw tae.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Iwe, Jesus a toagun, a weri niewe nge a aengaeni pwe, “Naeyi, wopwe aetemaegin, oamw niugiuniug minne a aecchipwoag tae.” Reen rhag oatowe nge rhooapwut we a mamaaw tae.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Mwirin Jesus a noa noan imwaen soamwoon we. Nge a weriir rhooan arhiuwerhiuw kkewe me pwuwa we ra igin saeng, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawtowow oanongaemi! Aeterhooapwut een nge ese mae, pwe aan rhag maiur!” Iwe ra kekkaei aegini. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Nge igiwe aeremas ra toowow niugiun, Jesus a toonong noan sengkin we aaen aeterhooapwut we nge a ammwarhiu tae paiun, iwe a rhimwitae. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Iwe, fioangon miniwe a rheeoi noa wooan oanongaen faniuw we.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwaar Riiurhai Mwaaen Masparh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Oatowe Jesus a siusaengi pwiuneoi we, riiurhai mwaaen masparh ra pwan tapweei noa mwirin. Ra aepwesaegini pwe, “Naiun David, wopwe faayeogemaem!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Iwe, igiwe Jesus a toonong noan iimw we, mwaaen masparh kkewe ra itto reen. Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Oaw niugiuniug pwe ngaang ipwe mmwenen aeffetanoa mesaemi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Iir ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Ooa, menap.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Iwe Jesus a geotteopa meseer nge aepesa pwe, “Meeta oaw niugiuniug ngaeni, epwe pwan wen ngaenigaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Iwe, a ffatenoa meseer. Nge Jesus a igin ammwir ngaeniir pwe resoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai miniwe a wen.<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Nge iir ra faer noa arheoiuwa noa wunuunun Jesus wooan oanongaen faniuw we.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Ese Mmwenen Kkepas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Igiwe mwaaen kkewe ra noa, aaemweoi aeremas ra pwigito reen Jesus erhai mwaaen ese mmwenen kkepas pwe ewartae aniu aenneew wooan. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Reen rhag oaton we Jesus a oatowowuw aniu aenneew we saengi mwaaen we, nge a mmwenen kkepas. Oanongeer aeremas kkewe ra mwaar reen nge ra aepesa pwe, “Esaaen yor mwo giuneyarh taeppen minneei me noan Israel.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Nge Pharisees kkewe ra aepesa pwe, “Soamwoonin aniu aenneew minne efang maemaewan pwe epwe asiiur noa aniu aenneew.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Faayeow Ngaeniir Aeremas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Jesus a faaeraeg fetaen wooan oanongaen aepinoamw me pwugos kkewe. E fenaiuw me noan wutteer Jews, e fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we reen Mweoiu Naaeng me pwan aecchipwaar aeremas kkewe eweriir mesemesaen semwaai. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Nge igiwe a weriir pwuwaen aeremas kkewe, nge a igin faayeeor, pwe ra no noan affayeo me waeiraes taeppen <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe esooar no rhooan neginegiir. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Iwe a aengaeniir naiun rhooan kkayeo pwe, “A towunap uwaen menaai, nge re fitiman rhag rhooan gin. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Oaw maeipin ngaeni soamwoonin maat we pwe epwe fangenoa rhooan engaang pwe repwe giniiy oanongaen uwaen maat we aan.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Oapostonus Kkewe Seig me Riiurhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mark 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luke 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Jesus a faingi fengaenniir rhooawe seig me riiurhai rhooan kkayeo nge a ngaenneer maemaeweer pwe repwe asiuw aniu aenneew me aecchipwaar tae aeremas kka eweriir mesemesaen semwaai. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Ikkaan iteer oapostonus kkewe seig me riiurhai: mmwan nge Simon (pwan itan Peter) me Andrew we pwiin; James we pwiin John, ikkiwe naiun Zebedee; <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Philip, Bartholomew, Thomas me Matthew iwe rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char>; James we naiun Alphaeus iwe me Thaddaeus; <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simon, iwe erhai man menat,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">man menat: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">erhai mwaaen e fiiow ngaeniir sonotawaen Rome faaen itaen faniuwan.</char></note> me Judas Iscariot, iwe e fangenoa tinnimaen Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar Engaang Rhooawe Seig me Riiurhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mark 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luke 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Jesus a fangenoa rhooawe seig me riiurhai nge a ammwir ngaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw noa noan faniuweer re Gentiles aere noan aepinoamwoor re Samaria. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Nge oawpwe faer noa reer aeremesaen Israel pwe iir minne ra weer <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe ra mwaenirh noa. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Oawnoa nge oawwa fenaiuw kkepas een, ‘Mweoiu Naaeng a arapeto!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Oaw aecchipwaar rhooa semwaai, oaw aemenewaar tae manimae, oaw aecchipwaar rhooa kaenepaai iwe me oatowowuur aniu aenneew. Oawwa pwigi minneei me reei nge esooar paniuwan, nge oawpwene noa fang nge esoapw pwan yor paniuwan. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Nge oawsoapw pweipwog eew taeppen senaapiy noan pwoarsaemi; <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>oawsoapw pwan pweipwog pwetoaw me ssiuwenin mengaagiumi me nokka me yomi. Pwe rhooan engaang ina epwe toowow paniuweer.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Ngaere oawwa toori eew aepinoamw aere pwugos, oawwa pipiiy iyo e tipaeni epwe aetiwaegaemi, iwe oawwa noa no reen toori aaemi oawpwene siusaengi pwiuneoi we. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Ngaere oawtonong noan eew iimw, oawwa aengaeniir pwe, ‘Oapoas epwe no reemi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Aere aeremesaen iimw we re aetiwaegaemi, nigititiw kkepesaen oapoas we aaemi reer. Nge aere rese aetiwaegaemi, nge oawwa pwigi sefaaeniy kkepesaen oapoas we aaemi. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Iwe, aere rhooan eew aepinoamw me aere eew iimw rese aetiwaegaemi aere aiussaening ngaenigaemi, oaw siusaengi pwiuneoi we nge oawwa iurhiugi noa ppweoniun me wooan pirhemi. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Deus epwe faayeow re Tyre me Sidon memmweer aeremesaen aepinoamw naan.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aewwaeiraes Kka Epwe Tooto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mark 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luke 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Aiussaening, ngaang ipwene aefengaegaemi wow taeppeer <char style="tl">sheep</char> reno neeiir cchon <char style="tl">wolves</char>. Nge oawpwe aetipaecchemegaemi taeppen sowufaeng nge oawpwan tipipoas taeppeer <char style="tl">doves</char>. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Oawpwan aefaennigaemi pwe imwu eyor aeremas kka repwe torofigaemi nge re paenigaemi nong noan nenien apwiung, nge repwe pwan wirhigaemi me noan wutteer Jews. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Pwe reen minne itaei, minne repwene paenigaemi noa mmweer soamwoon me <char style="tl">king</char>, pwe oawpwe aengaeniir me re Gentiles Kkepas Mwamwaai we. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Iwe aere ra isenigaemi nong noa nenien apwiung, oawsoapw pireiir reen meeta oawpwe aepesa me wunuunun aaemi aepesa, pwe petenaen kkepas kka oawpwe aepesa epwe toorigaemi noan oaton naan. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Pwe saapw aaemi minne oaw kkepas, pwe Ngeoniun minna Semaemi minne oawwa aepesa mwaenian.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Aeremas repwene afangmaei noa pwiir ngaeni maenoa, nge saam repwe pwan feeori taeppen minneen ngaeni naiiur; nge naiiur repwene pwan appaniuwaeni semeer me ineer nge re fangenoa iir pwe repwe noa niir noa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Oanongeer aeremas nge repwe oapwutaegaemi pwe faaen itaei. Nge iyo na e aetemaegin ngaeni minna oarosan nge epwe menaw. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Iwe, aere re aewwaeiraesigaemi me noan eew aepinoamw, siunoa noan ina eew. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe epwe itto mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas nge aaemi oaw sogoppaen moann reen aaemi engaang wooan oanongaen aepinoamwon Israel.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Esooar erhai aeteei suguun epwe taegias saengi aan sinsei, nge esooar erhai rhooan akkiuneo epwe taegias saengi aan maasta. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Ieei minne erhai aeteei suguun epwe kker tipan aan epwe aeffitaeg ngaeni aan sinsei, nge erhai rhooan akkiuneo epwe kker tipan aan epwe aeffitaeg ngaeni aan maasta. Aere ra aeita ngaeni soamwoonin aeinang we pwe Beelzebul, epwe ifa mwo aenneewan aar repwe faingi ngaeniir oanongeer rhooan aeinang we.<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo Sipwe Mesagiu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luke 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Iwe, oawsoapw mesagiiur aeremas. Pwe oanongaen meeta ewop epwene pwae noa, iwe me oanongaen kkepas mwoanomwoan repwene giuneei. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Meeta ngaang iya aengaenigaemi noan rorhappiung, oawpwe aepesatae noan seram. Nge meeta oaw rongorong noan saeningaemi oawpwe aekkepwas aegini noa me wooan wungaen iimw. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Oawsoapw mesagiiur rhooamwu regaen niiy noa oanongaemi, pwe ina resoapw mmwenen niiy noa ngeoniumi. Nge oawpwe faer mesagiu Deus, iwe emmwenen niiy noa oanongaemi me ngeoniumi noan nifierno. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Reen efai rhag checcha nge wa mmwenen chuwaiuw riiurhai nicchok, nge erhai mwo nge ese ppiungiutiw nee ppweon aere Semaemi ese iura. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Iwe nge aaemi, oanongaen aennirhimwemi mwo nge Deus e paengi. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Ina oawsoapw mesag, pwe aaemi ina eyor ipitaemi memmweer towunepeer nicchok!<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwuwafaai me Oasoarhoawuna Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luke 12.8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Rhooakka re aepesa pwe iir naeyi me neeiir aeremas, ngaang ipwe pwan feeori ngaeniir me weni mmwaen Semaei wooai naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Nge iyo kena resaep saengiaei me neeiir aeremas, ngaang ipwe pwan saep saengiir me weni mmwaen Semaei wooai naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saapw Oapoas pwe Efoarh Saeitan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luke 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Oawsoapw maengiy pwe iya itto pwe ipwe pwigito oapoas wooan soanop. Aapw, ise itto pwe ipwe pwigito oapoas, pwe faer efoarh saeitan. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Pwe ngaang itto ipwe feeoriir aetemwaaen repwe aengimaaw ngaeniir semeer, me aeterhooapwut repwe aengimaaw ngaeniir ineer, pwiuniuwaen naiiur repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir inaen pwiuniuweer; <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>nge rhooan oapwutoag repwe itto saengi rhag rhooan oamw famini.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Rhooakka e temoag aerhaengerhaengin semeer me ineer me mmwaei, ese fin repwe no pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo. Nge rhooakka e temoag aerhaengerhaengin naiiur me mmwaei, ese pwan fin repwe no pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Iwe, rhooakka rese aiufera aar kurus nge re tapweeito mwiriy, nge ese fin repwe no pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Nge rhooakkena re maengiy repwe kkemwarh wooan meneweer, epwe ppiung saengiir, nge rhooakkena eppiung saengiir meneweer pwe faaen itaei nge repwe weri sefaaeniy.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paniuwaenin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mark 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Iyo e aetiwaegaemi, e aetiwaeyaei, nge iyo a aetiwaeyaei, a pwan aetiwa iwe efangeto ngaang. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Iyo a aetiwa erhai profeta pwe iga iiy erhai profeta, epwe yor paniuwaenin me reen minna paniuwaen. Nge iyo a aetiwa erhai aeremas mwamwaai pwe iga iiy erhai aeremas mwamwaai, epwe yor paniuwaenin taeppen erhai aeremas mwamwaai. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Aere erhai a aiuniu ngaeni erhai man sessoan kka rhoaniuwaei eew kkepaen rhaan patapat pwe iga iiy erhai rhoaniuwaei, ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, iiy epwe yo ngaeni minna paniuwaenin.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Pweipwogin Kkepas Kkewe Naiun John</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luke 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Igiwe Jesus a moannon akkiuneeor rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun iwe seig me riiurhai, a noa saengi pwiuneoi we iwe a noa fenai me oaronga fetaeneei wooan oanongaen aepinoamw kkewe pwiuneoi we.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Nge oatowe John Baptist a rongorong me noan imwaen kanepwus wunuunun engaang kkewe Kristus a feeorin, a fangenoa aaemweoi rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun reen. <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>Iwe, ra aeiineow Jesus pwe, “Een miniwe re iura pwe epwe itto, aere aeipwe wewweti erhai?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Oaw sefaaen noa oawwa aengaeni John minne oawwa rongorong me weri: <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>rhooa masparh ra ffatenoa, rhooa pirhemae ra faaeraeg, rhooa kaenepaai ra gacch noa, rhooa saeningapiung ra rongorong, rhooa mae ra menawtae, nge Kkepas Mwamwaai we a fenai ngaeniir rhooa affayeo. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Ifa mwo wenepwuweer rhooa se tip mwaramwar reei!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Oatowe rhooawe naiun John ra noa, Jesus a kkepas ngaeniir aeremas kkewe reen wunuunun John: “Igiwe oawwa noa reen John noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we, meeta minne oaw niuwaennei pwe oawpwe noa weri? Efoarh fetin e mwoaroro reen aaeng? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Meeta minne oawnoa pwe oawpwe weri? Erhai mwaaen e memmengaag tae mengaag nning? Aeremas kka e ina wusun mengaagiiur nge reno noan imwaen <char style="tl">king</char>! <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Aengaeniaei, meeta rhag oawnoa pwe oawpwe weri? Erhai profeta? Ooa, ennetaen, oawwa weri erhai e taegias saengi erhai profeta. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Pwe John miniwe Pwapwior we e Santus e iura pwe, ‘Deus a kkepas, ngaang ipwene fangetiw naeyi rhooan pweipwogin kkepas me weni mmwoamw pwe epwe noa maeneti ennepoamw.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe John Baptist ina e taegias saengiir aeremas towunap kka reno wooan soanop. Iwe nge manna oarosaen git me noan Mweoiu Naaeng ina e taegias saengi John. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Saengi rhag oaton we John Baptist a rhaepetae aan fenai toorito igina nge miniwe Mweoiu Naaeng a toonong noan waeiraes pwe aeremas aenneew ra fiiow wooan pwe repwe nemaeni. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Toorito oatowe John a no, oanongeer profeta me Anniug kkewe aaen Moses ra aepesa wunuunun miniwe Mweoiu Naaeng; <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>nge aere oawwa niugiuw aar fenai, John nge iiy Elijah, iwe ra fasiun aepesa noa pwe epwe itto. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Iwe, meeta ipwe aweweei ngaeniir aeremesaen mweoi e igina? Ra aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhag wonigaet kkewe remooat noan nenien chuwaai. Eew mwiirh nge re iyaekkepwas ngaeniir aaemweoi, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Aemaem aeiya pwan kker ngaenigaemi, nge aaemi oawse maan! Aemaem aeiya arhiuwerhiuw, nge aaemi oawse saeng!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Igiwe John a itto, e aecchigipin nge ese pwan iun <char style="tl">wine</char>, nge aeremas ra aepesa pwe, ‘Iiy eyor aniu aenneew wooan!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Nge igiwe Naiun Aeremas e itto, a mwommwongo nge e iun, nge aeremas ra aepesa pwe, ‘Oaw pipiiy mwaaen een! Iiy erhai mwaaen mwongonap me iun <char style="tl">wine</char>, nge maereyaereer rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit.’ Iwe nge minna repiaen Deus reepiy a pwae noa pwe ennet reen meeta a feeori.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aepinoamw Kkewe Rese Niugiuniug</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luke 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Aeremesaen aepinoamw kkewe Jesus a feeori towunepaen kkeman kkewe aan me ee ina rese toagun saengi aar monofit, iwe Jesus a soong ngaeniir. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi rhooan Chorazin me Bethsaida! Aere kkeman kka refeeori me wooan igeei minne refeeori me wooan Tyre me Sidon, ina nge aeremesaen aepinoamw kenaan a ssiunaei rhag aar memmengaag tutu nge re oamworomwor tae fenang wooar, pwe epwe pwae noa aar toagun saengi monofit! <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Deus epwe faayeow re Tyre me Sidon me mmwaemi. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Nge een Capernaum! Wo tipaeni wopwe tooritae naaeng? Een wopwe ppiungiutiw noan nifierno! Aere kkeman kkewe effeeor me reemw epwan ffeeor me noan Sodom, epwe rhiuwen no rhag igina. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Deus epwe faayeow re Sodom me mmwoamw.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oaw Itto Aseoseo Reei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luke 10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Reen oatowe nge Jesus a aepesa pwe, “Semaei, Soamwoonin naaeng me soanop, iya ngaenneog oamw aerhigerhig, pwe wa oapanoa minikkeei saengiir rhooa reepiy me metefaaegini, nge wa pwaeri ngaeniir rhooa kkewe reweer wonigaet. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ennet, Semaei, pwe ina minna wo tipaeni epwe wen.”<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Semaei a ngaenneaei oanongaen meeta. Esooar erhai ne e giuneei minna Naiun, pwe aeggaen minna Seman rhag, nge esooar erhai e giuneei minna Seman, pwe iiy rhag minna Naiun, iwe me iyo kena minna Naiun a finiir tae pwe epwe pwaeri ngaeniir.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Oaw itto reei oanongaemi rhooakkena oawwa aerhig reen pweipwogin mini cchoaw, pwe ngaang ipwe asseoseogaemi. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Oaw pwigi <char style="tl">yoke</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yoke: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eew soapwon irae eno wooan iiuweer riiurhai wakke, pwe e ammwarhiu fengaenniir igine repwe feeori eew engaang cchoaw.</char></note> e aaei nge oawwa iseni tae woami, nge oawwa kapwiung saengiaei, pwe ngaang itip maniuweniuw nge i mesoanosoan; pwe ina nge aaemi oawpwe meyaefi aseoseo. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Pwe yoke e ngaang ipwene fang ngaenigaemi iye e mererhaeg, nge minne ipwe iseni tae woami oawpwe aiufera iye eppaen.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Sabbath</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mark 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luke 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Ese ssiunaei weni mwirin aaen Jesus faaeraeg nong noan aekkaew maetaen <char style="tl">wheat</char> wooan raaenin Sabbath. Nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra pecchai, iwe ra rhaepetae aar ferhiy iuwoapwon <char style="tl">wheat</char> kkewe nge ra angi minikkewe faiun. <figure style="fig" alt="stalks of wheat" file="HK00099B.TIF" size="col" loc="TEMPORARY" ref="12.1"/> <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Nge igiwe Pharisees kkewe ra weri miniwe, ra aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Pipiiy, ese gacch ngaeni aarh anniug pwe rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw repwe feeori minna wooan Sabbath!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oawse aeraegi mwo miniwe David efeeori noan oaton we iiy me rhooa kkewe naiun ra pecchai? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>A toonong noan imwaen Deus, nge iiy me mwaaen kkewe rhoaniuwan ra mwongo fenoawa kkewe ra aeni oasoar ngaeni Deus, inamwo igiwe e aenneew ngaeni anniug pwe repwe mwongo, pwe patere rhag minne emmwen pwe repwe mwongo fenoawa kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Aere oawse aeraegi miniwe effoat noan aaen Moses anniug pwe oanongaen raaenin Sabbath nge patere kkena noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we re fereei anniugiun Sabbath, nge rese monofit? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe erhai minne eno igeei e taegias saengi <char style="tl">Temple</char>. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Pwapwior we e Santus e iura pwe, ‘Faayeow minne ngaang i tipaeni, nge saapw maan kkena aar oasoar ngaeniaei.’ Aere aaemi oaw giuneei faaen kkepas een, ina nge oawsoapw oamonofitiir aeremas kena rese monofit. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas minne Soamwoonin Sabbath.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaaen we e Maemerhoar Paiun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mark 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luke 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Iwe, Jesus a noa saengi pwiuneoi we nge a toonong noan wutteer Jews we, <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>nge eno erhai mwaaen e maemerhoar paiun. Aaemweoi aeremas repwan no igiwe, ra giutta aekkaew rhaepin minikka repwe oaturu Jesus wooan. Iwe ra aeiineow Jesus pwe, “E mwamwaai ngaeni aarh anniug pwe repwe aecchipwa erhai wooan raaenin Sabbath?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Epwe ifa aere erhai naimi <char style="tl">sheep</char> a ppiungiunong noan eew niipw wooan raaenin Sabbath? Oawsoapw pwigi pwe oawpwe taiuwtae? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Pwe erhai aeremas nge eyor ipitan mmwaen erhai <char style="tl">sheep</char>! Iwe aarh anniug a saeneti aarh sipwe feeori minne e mwamwaai wooan raaenin Sabbath.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Mwirin Jesus a aengaeni mwaaen we e maemerhoar paiun pwe, “Aeitiwow poawumw.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Iwe, a aeitiwow paiun nge a mamaaw noa pwan taeppen rhag ina epai. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Iwe Pharisees kkewe ra siunoa pwiungiuw wunuunun aar repwe niiy noa Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deus a Fini Jesus pwe Naiun Rhooan Akkiuneo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Oatowe Jesus a rongorong pwiungiupwiung we aar, a noa saengi pwiuneoi we, nge pwuwaen aeremas ra ttapw noa mwirin. Iwe a aecchipwaar oanongeer rhooa semwaai <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe resoapw fioangei ngaeniir aeremas wunuunun iiy. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>A feeori minneen, pwe epwe pwaeritae miniwe Deus a aengaeni profeta Isaiah:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Ieen naeyi rhooan akkiuneo iya finitae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">iiy minne i aerhaengi, iya igin kker reen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ngaang ipwene fangetiw aaei Espritu wooan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">nge iiy epwe arheoiuwa noa wunuunun aaei apwiung ngaeniir oanongaen faniuw.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Esoapw aengimaw aere apwas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">aere kkepas temoag wooan aan.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Esoapw gopiy mwo nge efoarh fetin ppwoar,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">me pwan gunuw noa naam na e oamoaruporup.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Iiy epwe oarhorho ngaeni toori ssiaaen aan mmwen ngaeni oapoas na efin pwe epwe yo ngaeni oanongaen faeinaengiy.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Ina nge oanongaen faniuw repwene aeisetip wooan.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mark 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luke 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Iwe aaemweoi aeremas ra pwigito reen Jesus erhai mwaaen parh nge ese pwan mmwenen kkepas, pwe ewartae aniu aenneew wooan. Jesus a aecchipwa mwaaen we, iwe a mmwenen kkepas me fannoa. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Pwuwaen aeremas kkewe ra riutae reen miniwe Jesus a feeori nge ra aeiineo pwe, “Meeta, epwe ieei mwaaen we naiun David?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Igiwe Pharisees ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, ra aepesa pwe, “Emmwenen asiiur noa aniu aenneew pwe iga rhag Beelzebul we soamwoonin aniu aenneew minne efang maemaewan.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Jesus a giuneei aar niunniuwaen nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Aere eew faniuw a ginigin fesaeng me fiiow fengaen, faniuw een esoapw ssiunaei. Aere rhooan eew aepinoamw aere eew famini repwe ginigin fesaeng me fiiow fengaen, nge repwe mwetoar fesaeng. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Iwe aere rhooan mweoiun Saetan ra fiiow fengaen ina nge ra fasiun mwetoarotoar, nge minna mweoiun epwe iug noa! <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Ngaere igine e ieei wunuunun aaei asiiur noa, iwe nge e ifa wusun aar rhooa kkomwu rhoaniuwaemi asiiur noa aniu aenneew? Rhooa kkomwu rhoaniuwaemi ra pwaeritae pwe oaw mwaerhei! <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Aapw, pwe Ngeoniun Deus a ngaenneaei maemaewaei aaei ipwe asiiur noa aniu aenneew. Ieei minne a pwaeri noa pwe minna Mweoiun Deus a faer toorigaemi.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Esooar erhai epwe tongaeni toonong noan imwaen erhai mwaaen mamaaw pwe epwe pwigi noa pisaegin; aere epwe mmwaen geoni noa mwo mwaaen we, ina nge epwapw mmwenen piraf me noan iimw we.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Erhai ne ese tapweaei, nge iiy rhooa aenneew ngaeniaei, nge erhai ese tipaengiaei reen ioi, iiy erhai rhooan oammwoatoar. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Faaen minneei ipwe aengaenigaemi: aeremas repwe mmwenen oamwusa noa ese tiwegin monofitiir, me pwan kkepas aenneew kka re aepesa; nge aere erhai e kkepas aenneew ngaeni Espritu Santus nge esoapw mwusunoa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Iyo e kkepas aenneew ngaeni Naiun Aeremas epwe mmwenen mwusunoa. Nge iyo e kkepas aenneew ngaeni Espritu Santus esoapw mmwenen mwusunoa igina toori nee soapw noan.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efoarh Waniwan me Uwaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luke 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Aere eyor waniwan gacch, uwaan repwan gacch, nge aere a yor waniwan e aenneew, uwaan repwan aenneew. Pwe sigaen giuneei meeta taeppen waniwan we me reen rhag uwaan. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Aaemi sowufaeng! Epwe ifa wusun aaemi aepesa min mwamwaai nge aaemi aeremas aenneew. Pwe iga aaw e aepesa meeta kkena esseog noan pwunn. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Erhai aeremas gacch epwe oatowowuw mini gacch saengi gacchiun noan tipan, nge erhai aeremas aenneew epwe oatowowuw mini aenneew saengi aenneewaen noan tipan.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Nge ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe noan Raaenin Apwiung nge aeremas repwe aengaeni oanongaen kkepas kka esooar ipitan ikka re aepesa. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Pwe reen oamw kkepas minne Deus epwe apwiungiug reen, epwe pwaeritae aere een minne wo mwamwaai aere wo monofit.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tingoaron Kkeman</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mark 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luke 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Iwe aaemweoi sinsein anniug me rhooawe Pharisees ra aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, aemaem aei mwerhaen weri oamw feeori eew kkeman.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “A ifa mwo aenneewan me aar se niugiuniug aeremesaen mweoi e igina! Oawwa tingoar ngaeniaei pwe ipwe feeori eew kkeman? Nge esoapw yor eew kkeman epwe pwae ngaenigaemi me niugiunoan kkeman we aaen profeta Jonah. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Epwe wunuunun rhag aaen Jonah no aegini eoniuraen me eoniupwoong noan upwaen erhai iig faeregit we, ina minne Naiun Aeremas epwe no eoniuraen me eoniupwoong noan faeinaengiy. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Noan Raaenin Apwiung re Nineveh repwe iutae nge ra oamonofiti aeremesaen mweoi e igina, pwe iga iir re toagun saengi monofitiir oatowe re rongorong fenai kkewe aaen Jonah; nge ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe erhai e taegias saengi Jonah eno igeei! <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Queen reen Sheba epwe iutae nge a oamonofiti aeremesaen mweoi e igina; pwe iiy a itto saengi faniuwaen taaw noa, pwe epwe itto aiussaening ngaeni aaen <char style="tl">king</char> Solomon kkepesaen reepiy; nge ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe erhai e taegias saengi Solomon eno igeei!<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sefaaeneton Aniu Aenneew</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luke 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Igine erhai aniu aenneew a toowow me wooan erhai aeremas, nge ina epwene faaeraeg fetaen wooan faniuw paenekka pwe egiut nenien aan aseoseo. Aere esooar eew neniy e rhuungi, <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>nge ina epwene aengaeni oanongan pwe, ‘Ipwene sefaaen noa reen imwaei iwe i siusaengi.’ Iwe a sefaaen nge a noa rhuungi iimw we pwe a peo, nge a pwan nimegacch noa noan pwe oanongaen aegiaeg nge a wonopaeg noa nenien. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Iwe epwe noa nge a noa paeniir to fiusiuman aniu aenneew kena re igin kkaein aar aenneew saengi, nge ra itto no pwiuneoi we. Iwe igiwe a moann oanongan noa, nge wunuunun aeremas we a faer igin aenneew saengi mmwaen miniwe rhaepetaen. Ieei wunuunun minne epwe wen ngaeniir aeremas aenneewan mweoi e igina.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inaen Jesus me Pwiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mark 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luke 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Jesus e rhiuwen kekkepas ngaeniir aeremas kkewe, nge miniwe inan me rhooawe pwiin ra war. Ra iu niugiun iimw we nge ra tingoar pwe repwe kkepas ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Iwe erhai aeremas kkewe a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Pipiiy, inoamw me rhooawe pwiimw re iu niugiun nge re mwerhaen kkepas ngaeniug.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Iyo inaei me iyo pwiiy?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Iwe a aeitiiti ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a iura pwe, “Pipiiy! Ikkaan iir inaei me pwiiy! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Pwe iyo na a feeori nee tipaen Semaei wooai naaeng, iir pwiiy me mwengeaei me inaei.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewe Erhai Rhooan Aeperes Faiun Foat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mark 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luke 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Iwe noan rhag raaenin we Jesus a siusaengi iimw we a noa reen meoneoiniun we, iwe a noa mooat tiw wenepeigin. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Nge aeremas towunap kkewe ra itto reen, iwe a teeotae wooan efoarh pwoot a ittae mooat wooan. Nge rhooawe ra iu nee ppiy. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Jesus a fioang awewe ngaeniir towunepaen aegiaeg, iwe a aengaeniir pwe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Erhai mwaaen a noa pwe epwe noa aeperes faiun foat. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Igiwe e aeperes fetaen foat kkewe, nge aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw wenepeigin aan we, nge man aeniaen ra itto anginoa. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw wooan kaenefai, igiwe ese maniueon ppweon ee. Faiun kkewe ra mwetekkaein pwaechetae, pwe igiwe rese no ppweon ttonoa. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Nge igiwe aenet a ttinitae, nge a aeppwesa noa foat kkewe; pwe igiwe waeran foat kkewe ese nennoan noa, iwe a mwetekkaein mae noa. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw neeiin irae towfanfan. Iwe irae towfanfan kkewe ra menawtae nge ra fittitae wooar iwe ra maenoa. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Nge aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw noan ppweon mwamwaai, iwe ra uuwa: aekkaefai ra uwaeni epwiugiuw, aekkaefai woneig, nge aekkaefai eniig.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faaen Aaen Jesus Kkepesaen Fioangon Awewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mark 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luke 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta wo kkepas noan fioangon awewe iga wo kkepas ngaeniir reen?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Deus a fang ngaenigaemi pwe oawpwe giuneei kkepas mwoanomwoanon minna Mweoiu Naaeng, nge ikka aaemweoi ese ngaenneer. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Pwe iyo a yor meeta aan nge repwe pwan fang ngaeni iwe epwene igin ssow noa aan, nge iyo ese yor meeta aan nge repwe pwigi saengi mwo nge iwe egius iwe eyor reen. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Faaen aaei kkepas ngaeniir noan fioangon awewe, pwe iga re pipiiy noa nge rese weri, nge repwe aiussaening nge rese rongorong, nge rese pwan metaf reen. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Iwe a pwae pwe ennet minikkiwe mwaeniaen profeta Isaiah:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Oawpwe aiussaening me aiussaening nge oawsoapw metaf;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">oawpwe pipiiy me pipiiy nge oawsoapw weri.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Pwe aar niunniuwaen rhooakkeei nge a pwurh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nge ra pineyinoa saeningeer, nge ra ammaiur noa meseer.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ngaere ese ieei wusuur, ina nge meseer epwe weriwer</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nge saeningeer epwe rongorong,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">epwe metaf noan pwunnoor,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">iwe nge repwe toagun ngaeniaei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nge ngaang ipwe aemaemaewaar tae.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 13:15">Ieei minne mwaeniaen Deus.<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Nge aaemi oawwa wenepwu! Pwe mesaemi ra weriwer nge saeningaemi ra rongorong. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe towunap profeta me aeremas mwamwaai ra mwerhaen weri meeta kka aaemi oawwa weri, nge iir rese weri. Ra pwan mwerhaen rongorong meeta kka aaemi oawwa rongorong, nge iir rese rongorong.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aemmetefa Fioangon Awewen Rhooan Foat we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mark 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luke 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Iwe oaw aiussaening, pwe oawpwe metaf reen fioangon awewen rhooan foat we. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Rhooa kkewe re rongorong kkepesaen Mweoiu Naaeng, nge rese metefaaegini, ra taeppen rhag faiun foat kkewe re ppiungiutiw wenepeigin aan we. Iwe Man Aenneew we a itto pwigi saengiir minne a toonong nee tipeer. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Nge faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wooan kaenefai, ra aeffitaeg ngaeni rhooawe re aetiwa miniwe kkepesaen Deus noan kker reen rhag oaton we ra rongorong. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Nge kkepas we ese waaraar me nee tipeer, iwe ese ssiunaei wooar. Nge aere a yor fitigogo me waeiraes faaen itaen miniwe kkepesaen Deus, ra mwetekkaein fangetae. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Nge faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw neeiin irae towfanfan, ra aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhooawe re rongorong kkepesaen Deus, nge aiunaeng reen menaw e igina me mwecheniaen pisaegin feoniufan ra oamoapwu miniwe kkepesaen Deus, pwe esoapw mmwenen uuwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Nge faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wooan ppweon mwamwaai, ra aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhooawe re rongorong miniwe kkepesaen Deus nge ra metaf reen: iwe, ra uuwa, aaemweoi ra uwaeni epwiugiuw, aaemweoi woneig, nge pwan aaemweoi eniig.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Fetin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Jesus a pwan fioangei ngaeniir pwan eew fioangon awewe: “Mweoiu Naaeng a aeffitaeg ngaeni minneen. Erhai mwaaen a aeperes faiun foat gacch noan aan menaai. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Noan eew pwongin, igiwe aeremas ra maiur, erhai man aenneew a itto aeperes pwuger mwaaen neeiin maat we, iwe, a noa. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Oatowe faiun foat kkewe ra menawtae nge ra uuwa, iwe nge a noa pwae noa pwuger mwaaen kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Mwaaen kkewe naiun rhooan engaang ra itto reen nge ra aengaeni pwe, ‘Menap, saapw faiun foat gacch miniwe wofoat noan menaai we oamw?. Nge iya rhag pwuger mwaaen ra noa itto me ee?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>A paniuwaeniir pwe, ‘Erhai man aenneew a feeori minneei.’ Iwe, rhooawe rhooan engaang ra aeiineow pwe, ‘Wo mwerhaen aeipwe noa wiytae pwuger mwaaen kenaan?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Iwe a paniuwaeniir pwe, ‘Aapw, pwe aere oawpwe wiytae pwuger mwaaen kenaan nge emmwen pwe faiun foat kkewe repwe pwan wisaegtae. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Oaw nigitiir pwe repwe menaw ppagtae toori oaton ee sipwene gin. Iwe nge ngaang ipwe naaen aengaeni rhooan affeeoriun repwe mmwaen wiytae pwuger mwaaen kkewe, ra geoni fengaenniy nge ra figiir noa. Iwe ra ioni fengaenniy faiun foat kkewe nge ra iseniir nong noan aaei imwaen soko.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Faiun <char style="tl">Mustard</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mark 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luke 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Iwe, Jesus a fioangei ngaeniir pwan eew fioangon awewe: “Mweoiu Naaeng a aeffitaeg ngaeni minneen. Erhai mwaaen a pwigi efai faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char> a noa foatogi noan aan menaai. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Iiy minne oarosaen mwittigin me neeiir faiun irae, nge igine a menawtae nge iiy minne oarosaen temoag me neeiin irae me noan menaai we. A ssiuwen ngaeni efoarh irae faeregit, pwe man aeniaen repwe itto ffeeor feseer wooan raaen.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen <char style="tl">Yeast</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luke 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Iwe, Jesus a fioangei ngaeniir pwan eew fioangon awewe: “Mweoiu Naaeng a aeffitaeg ngaeni minneen. Erhai rhooapwut a pwigi egius <char style="tl">yeast</char> nge a nofiti fengaenniy me enuuw pwaecchin fenoawa emas toori aan pwo tae fenoawa we.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faaen Aaen Jesus Aeyae Fioangon Awewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mark 4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Jesus a aeyae fioangon awewe aan epwe aepesa ngaeniir pwuwaen aeremas oanongaen minikkeei; esoapw aepesa mwo nge epat aegiaeg ngaeniir igine ese aeyae fioangon awewe. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>A feeori minneei pwe epwe pwaeritae pwe ennet miniwe profeta a aepesa pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ngaang ipwe aeyae fioangon awewe iga ipwe kkepas ngaeniir.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Ngaang ipwe aepesa ngaeniir minikka rese giuneei saengi rhaepetaen feoniufan.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aemmetefa Fioangon Awewen Fetin we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Iwe igiwe Jesus a noa saengi pwuwaen aeremas kkewe nge a toonong noan eew iimw, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Wopwe aemmetefa ngaenigemaem meeta faaen fioangon awewen fetin we noan menaai we.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Mwaaen we aeperes faiun foat kkewe egacch nge ina iiy Naiun Aeremas; <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>menaai we ina feoniufan; faiun foat kkewe regacch ina aeremesaen Mweoiu Naaeng; nge pwuger mwaaen kkewe, ina iir naiun Man Aenneew we; <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>nge man aenneew we e foatogi pwuger mwaaen kkewe ina Saetan. Nge oaton gin nge ina nee soapwonoan feoniufan, nge rhooan affeeoriun gin we ina iir angkenus. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Wunuunun pwuger mwaaen kkewe ra ioni fengaenniy nge ra figiir tae wooan aengaet, nge ina wunuunun minne epwe wen nee soapwonoan feoniufan. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Miniwe Naiun Aeremas epwene fangenoa naiun angkenus pwe repwe ioniir iyo kkewe reno noan Mweoiun iwe re paeni ngaeniir monofit, pwan rhooawe refeeori wegitaeg aenneew, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>nge repwe oatoranong noan nenien aengaet, iga repwe sessaeng nge akkaarengi me ee. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Iwe rhooa mwamwaai repwene ttin taeppen aenet noan Mweoiun Semeer. Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Pisaeg Kooap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Mweoiu Naaeng a pwan weei minneen. Erhai mwaaen enoa rhuungi eew pisaeg kooap egin rhaeng me wooan eew maat. A pwaniuw sefaaen noa nge noan aan kker a noa ameow noa oanongaen minikkena pisaegin, nge a sefaaen noa nge a noa meoni maat we.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Faiun Usowus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Mweoiun Naaeng a pwan weei minneen. Erhai mwaaen rhooan chuwaai nge e kiukkiutta fetaen faiun usowus kka nning, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>nge igine a giuneei efai min igin yor ipitan, a noa ameow noa oanongaen pisaegin nge a meoni faiun usowus we.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Wuug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Mweoiun Naaeng a pwan weei minneen. Aaemweoi rhooan fita ra aekkaerh wow aar wuug noan meoneoiniun we nge ra niyap mesemesaen iig. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Oatowe wuug we a sseog reen iig, nge ra iuriunong nee ppiy, mwirin ra mooat tiw pwe repwe aemegena fesaenngiy iig kkewe: iig gacch ra iseni nong noan rhiug, nge iig kkewe re aenneew ra oatoranoa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Epwe ieei wunuunun nee soapwonoan feoniufan. Angkenus repwene noa aeyimweoiuw fesaenngiy aeremas aenneew saengiir aeremas mwamwaai. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Repwe oatoranong aeremas aenneew noan nenien aengaet, iya repwe sessaeng nge akkaarengi me ee.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minne Effeo me Maerhiy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Oaw metefaaegini oanongaen minikkaan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Ooa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Ina nge faaen minneei ina oanongeer sinsein anniug kka repwe no pwe rhooan kkayeo noan Mweoiun Naaeng ra taeppen rhag soaw iimw we e oatowowuw pisaeg mini ffeo me min maerhiy me noan soko we aan.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Nazareth Rese Aetiwa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mark 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luke 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Igiwe Jesus a moann aan fioangei fioangon awewe kkewe, a noa saengi pwiuneoi we <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>nge a noa nee pwugusan. A fenai noan wutteer Jews we, nge rhooawe re rongorong ngaeni ra riutae reen. Ra aeiineo, “Iya woneei a pwigi me ee aan tipaecchem me kkeman kka aan? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Ifa wusun, soapw woneei miniwe naiun taikusang we? Saapw Maria miniwe inan? Me saapw James, Joseph, Simon me Judas nge pwiin? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Soapw oanongeer mwengeyan nge reno igeei? Iya woneei a pwigi oanongaen minikkeei me ee?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Iwe resa aetiwa no iiy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Jesus a aengaeniir, “Erhai profeta eyor aesirowun me noan oanongaen pwiuneoi, nge ese yor aesirowun me noan sipegin taeninimwan aere noan imwan.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Pwe iga esooar aar niugiuniug, ina minne Jesus ese feeori towunepaen kkeman kkewe aan me igiwe reen.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Maenoan John Baptist</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mark 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luke 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Noan oatowe Erotes iwe soamwoonin Galilee a rongorong wunuunun Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>A aengaeniir rhooan engaang kkewe naiun pwe, “Ieei iiy John Baptist, nge a menaw sefaaen. Ina faaen minne eyor maemaewan pwe epwe feeori kkeman kkeei reen.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Pwe mmwan nge Erotes a akkiuneo pwe repwe torofi John nge ra geoni iwe ra oatoranong noan kanepwus. Erotes a feeori minneei faaen itaen Herodias iwe pwiuniuwaen Philip we pwiin. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Pwe John Baptist a fasiun aepini ngaeni Erotes pwe, “Ese fin ngaeniug oamw wopwe pwiuniuwaeni Herodias.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Erotes e mwerhaen pwe epwe niiy noa John, nge e mesagiiur Jews pwe iga re iseni John pwe erhai profeta.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Nge raaenin gupwunon wupwutiwen Erotes, nge niewe naiun Herodias epwaai me weni mmweer rhooawe. Nge Erotes igin kker, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>a ppwon ngaeni niewe pwe, “Iya aekkepan, pwe ngaang ipwe ngaenneog ese tiwegin meeta wo tingoar.”<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Miniwe inan a akkiuneow pwe epwe tingoareei Erotes pwe, “Igina rhag nge wopwe ngaenneaei rhimwen John Baptist noan eew saepiy!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Iwe rhag nge e aenneew noa tipaen <char style="tl">king</char> we, nge pwonno igiwe a aekkepan weni mmweer waseona kkewe, a aepesa pwe mwerhaen we aaen rhooapwut we naiun epwe mmwen. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Iwe a akkiuneo pwe repwe noa gopiy noa iiuwaen John me noan kanepwus. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Iwe, ra pwigito miniwe rhimwen John noan eew saepiy nge ra ngaenneei aeterhooapwut we, iwe niewe a pwigi noa reen niewe inan. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun John ra itto pwigi miniwe oanongan nge ra noa paeia noa. Iwe nge ra noa aengaeni Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Oamwongoor Nimingeras Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mark 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luke 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">John 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Igiwe Jesus a rongorong miniwe kkepesaen John, a tapweei efoarh pwoot saengi igiwe nge a noa ngaeni eew pwiuneoi ne iiy noa rhag. Nge igiwe aeremas ra rongorong miniwe, ra noa saengi aepinoamwoor nge ra tapweei noa mwirin me weni faniuw. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Jesus a teeotiw me wooan pwoot we, nge a giuneei pwuwaen aeremas kkewe, nge a igin faayeeor iwe a aecchipwaar tae rhooawe re semwaai me neeiir.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Noan faefin we nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge ra aengaeni pwe, “E igin anniug noa igeei, nge a pwan pwoong. Aefengaar noa aeremas kaan nee aepinoamw pwe repwe noa sipegin chuwaai aeneer mwongo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Inamwo me rese noa, aaemi oawpwe ngaenneer meeta repwe mwongo!”<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Nge iir ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Minne eyor remaem nge niffai rhag fenoawa me riiurhai iig.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Iwe, Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Iwe oaw pwigito reei.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Iwe nge a aepesa ngaeniir rhooawe pwe repwe mooat tiw wooan fetin kkewe. Iwe a pwigi fenoawa kkewe niffai me iig kkewe riiurhai, a fattae naaeng nge a fang aan maeipinen aerhigerhig Iwe a giniiy fenoawa kkewe nge a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun, nge iir ra inetiy ngaeniir aeremas kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Oanongeer nge ra maegin mwongo iwe ra faeyemwaai noa. Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra oawuta seig me ruwowu rhiug reen nuseg kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Iwe nepeer mwaaen kkewe re mwongo nge nimingeras, nge rese paaepae rhooapwut me wonigaet.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Faaeraeg Noa Weei Saaet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mark 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">John 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Iwe rhag nge Jesus a aepekkaar rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe repwe teeotae wooan pwoot we, nge ra gommwonoa epeig meoneoiniun we, nge iiy a aefengaar noa aeremas kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Mwirin aan aefengaar noa aeremas kkewe, Jesus a ittae wooan rhug we nge iiy rhag, pwe epwe noa maeipin. Igiwe a pwongonoa, a iiy noa rhag igiwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Reen oateen nge pwoot we a taaw saengi faniuw, a nuponup pwoot we reen tettemoagon noa, nge igiwe repwan maeyi ngaeni aaeng.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Enoa nepetaen enuuw me wonowu konook nee oatosor Jesus a itto reer rhooan kkayeo kkewe, enoa faaeraegto weei saaet. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Igiwe ra giuneei aan faaeraegto weei saaet, ra igin mesag. Ra aekkepwas pwe, “Erhai aniu!”<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Noan rhag oaton een nge Jesus a kkepas ngaeniir pwe, “Oaw aemenetaegaemi! Ngaang minneei, oawte mesag!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Iwe Peter a aepesa pwe, “Soamwoon, aere een minna, aengaeniaei pwe ipwe faaeraeg wow reemw wooan saaet.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Itto!” Iwe Peter a teeotiw me wooan pwoot we nge a faaeraeg noa reen Jesus weei saaet. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Nge igiwe a weri maemaewaen aaeng we, a mesag nge a rhaepetae aan mwotupwutiw. Iwe, a aekkepwas pwe, “Aemenewaeyaei Soamwoon!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Iwe rhag nge Jesus a aeiti noa paiun, a ammwarhiu Peter nge a aengaeni pwe, “Me gaen mwittiginen oamw niugiuniug! Meeta wotip mwaramwar reen?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Iwe ra teeotae wooan pwoot we, iwe nge aaeng we a maseoseotiw. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe reno wooan pwoot we ra aesirowu Jesus nge ra aepesa pwe, “Ennetaen pwe een Naiun Deus!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwaar Rhooa Semwaai Noan Gennesaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mark 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Iwe ra seraeg noa epeig meoneoiniun we nge ra noa itto noan me Gennesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Aeremesaen pwiuneoi we re aeginna Jesus iwe ra aepesa noa wooan oanongaen faniuw pwe Jesus a no. Iwe aeremas ra pwigiir to oanongeer rhooa semwaai reen Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Ra tingoar ngaeni pwe aere uwen aar mwo man semwaai geotteopa soapwon mengaagiun. Iwe oanongeer iyo kkewe re geotteopa ra mamaaw noa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Aar Fenai Rhaepeto Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mark 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Iwe aaemweoi Pharisees me sinsein anniug ra itto reen Jesus saengi Jerusalem nge ra aeiineow pwe, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Meeta rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw rese tapweei aar fenai rhaepeto kkewe aarh reen? Rese tapweei wunuunun toatoan pai mmwaen aar repwe mwongo!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Iwe ina meeta oawse tapweei aaen Deus anniug reen pwe oawwa tapweei ina kkomi? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Pwe Deus a aepesa pwe, ‘Wopwe aesirowuur semoamw me inoamw’ iwe me, ‘Iyo e oari seman aere inan nge repwe niiy noa.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Nge aaemi oawwa aengaeniir aeremas pwe aere eyor minne erhai epwe tipaengi ngaeni seman aere inan, nge a iura pwe, ‘Ieen aaen Deus,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>nge ese aenneew igine ese aesirowu no seman. Ieei minne oawwa oatoranoa aaen anniug Deus pwe aaemi oawpwe feeori minna kkomi. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! A gin weneeti minne we Isaiah e fenaiuw pwe wunuunumi!<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>‘Deus a aepesa pwe: Aeremas kkeei ra oassoamwooniaei rhag reen aar kkepas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">nge nee tipeer a igin taaw saengiaei.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Esooar ipitaen aar aesirowuwaei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">pwe re fenaiuw aar aeremas anniug,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">nge ra feeori pwe aetae gaen aaei anniug!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minikka e Aenimaenneewa Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mark 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Iwe Jesus a faingiir to pwuwaen aeremas kkewe nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aiussaening pwe oawpwe metaf! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Saapw meeta kka etonong noan ewaemi minne epwe aenimaenneewagaemi, pwe faer meeta kka etowow me noan minne a aenimaenneewagaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Wa giuneei pwe ra soong Pharisees kkewe reen meeta we wo aepesa?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oanongan waniwan kka miniwe Semaei noan naaeng ese foatogi epwe wiwiytae. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Oawsoapw niunniuwaenneer iir! Iir ikkomwu rhooa parh nge re paaepae rhooa parh. Ngaere erhai man parh e paeni pwan erhai man parh, nge iir me riiurhai repwe ppiungiunong nee niipw.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Peter a aengaeni pwe, “Wopwe aemmetefa ngaenigemaem meeta faaen kkepas eei.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsaaen metaf noa mwo? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Oawse metaf? Pwe meeta kka a toonong noan ewaemi pwan toonong noan upwaemi, mwirin a toowow me noan oanongaemi. <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Nge meeta kka retowow saengi ewaemi rhaep saengi pwunnomi, nge ikkaan minikka e aenimaenneewagaemi. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Pwe saengi noan pwunnomi a toowow niunniuwaen aenneew taeppen, nni menaw, maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai, ffeeor aenneew, mwoarho, oatupwutupw me aenneewa noa iteer aaemweoi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Ikkaan minikka e aenimaenneewagaemi. Iwe nge erhai e mwongo nge ese tapweei wunuunun toatoan pai, minneen esoapw aenimaenneewagaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Niugiuniug Erhai Rhooapwut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mark 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Jesus a noa saengi pwiuneoi we nge a noa noan faniuw kkewe oaron aepinoamwon Tyre me Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Erhai rhooapwuton Canaan e nonno pwiuneoi we a itto reen, nge a aepwesaegini pwe, “Soamwoon, Naiun David! Faayeowaei! Rhooapwut na naeyi a wartae aniu aenneew wooan nge a igin cchoaw noa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Nge Jesus ese aengaeni mwo eew petenaen kkepas. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge ra tingoar gacch ngaeni pwe, “Aefenganoa nieei! Ettapw fetaen rhag me mwirirh nge e igin soaw oacchorong!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Iwe Jesus a aepesa pwe, “Deus e aefengaeyaei to rhag pwe reer re Israel kkewe ra weer <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe re mwaenirh noa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Iwe rhag nge rhooapwut we a itto foatotiw weni mmwan nge a iura pwe, “Soamwoon, tipaengiaei!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ese mwamwaai pwe sipwe pwigi aeneer wonigaet mwongo nge sa oatora ngaeniir gonaag.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Iwe niewe a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ennet minna, Soamwoon, nge gonaag mwo nge re angi peipeyin mwongo ppiungiutiw saengi aar maasta <char style="tl">table</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Iwe Jesus a paniuwaeni niewe pwe, “Een erhai rhooapwut e igin faeregit oamw niugiuniug! Meeta na oamw mwerhaen nge epwe yo ngaeniug.” Iwe noan rhag oaton we nge rhooapwut we naiun a takketae.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwaar Rhooa Towunap Kkewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Jesus a noa saengi pwiuneoi we nge a noa faaeraeg ngaerhen meoneoiniuniun Galilee. A ittae wooan eew rhug a ittae mooat tiw. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Towunepaen aeremas kkewe ra itto reen, pwigito rhooawe re pirhemae, rhooa parh, rhooa maemerhoar, rhooa se kkepas, me pwan towunepaen aeremas kka re semwaai ra itto iseniir tiw oaron pirheen Jesus; iwe a aecchipwaar tae oanongeer. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Aeremas ra mwaar reen meeta we ra weri pwe igiwe rhooawe rese kkepas ra kkepas, rhooawe re maemerhoar ra mamaaw noa, rhooawe re pirhemae ra faaeraeg, pwan rhooawe reparh ra weri mmweer. Iwe, ra aepingepinga Deus we naiiur re Israel.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Oamwongoor Faangeras Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mark 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Jesus a faingiir to rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Ngaang iya faayeeor aeremas kaan, pwe ra no reei noan eoniuraen nge esooar meeta minne repwe angi. Ngaang ise mwerhaen aefengaar noa noan aar pecchai, pwe repwe tongaeni niyoarorhrorh iga repwe faaeraeg ngaeni imweer.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra aeiineow pwe, “Iya me noan pwiuneoi anniug noa eei minne sipwe weriwer mwongo me ee pwe epwe nap ngaeniir towunepeer aeremas kaan?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Fitifai fenoawa eyor reemi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Fiusiufai fenoawa me fitiman iig mwittig.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Iwe Jesus a aepesa ngaeniir aeremas kkewe pwe repwe mooat tiw weni ppweon. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>A pwigi fenoawa kkewe fiusiufai me iig kkewe nge a fang ngaeni Deus aan aerhigerhig, a giniytiw nge a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe, nge rhooan kkayeo ra ngaeniir aeremas kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Oanongeer ra mwongo nge ra faeyemwaai. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra oawuta fisuuw rhiug reen nusegin mwongo kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Nneogeoiiur mwaaen kkewe re mwongo nge faangeras, nge rese paaepaenong rhooapwut me wonigaet.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Iwe Jesus a fangenoa aeremas kkewe, nge a teeotae wooan pwoot we nge a saei ngaeni miniwe faniuwaen Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Tingoaron Kkeman</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mark 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luke 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees me Sadducees ra itto reen Jesus pwe repwe aegina, iwe ra tingoareei pwe epwe feeori eew kkeman, pwe epwe pwae noa pwe Deus e tipieew ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Nge Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Iga aenet epwe tupwutiw oawwa aepesa, ‘Epwe igin gacch raaen naiu, pwe a ccha noa noan naaeng.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Nge nee oatosor moawugowug oawwa aepesa pwe, ‘Epwe igin piung worhow raaeneei, pwe a ccha me roorh noa noan mann.’ Oawwa mmwenen aepesa wunuunun raaen mwaai me raaen aenneew reen aaemi weri noan mann, nge oawsoapw mmwenen aweweei minikka aeginnen mweoi kkeei! <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>A ifa mwo aenneewan me aar se niugiuniug aeremesaen mweoi e igina! Oawwa tingoar ngaeniaei pwe ipwe feeori eew kkeman. Nge esoapw yor eew kkeman epwe pwae ngaenigaemi me niugiunoan kkeman we kkemenaen profeta Jonah.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Iwe nge Jesus a nigitiir a noa taaw noa.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar <char style="tl">Yeast</char> Pharisees me Sadducees</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mark 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Igiwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa epeig meoneoiniun we, ra maniuwegi noa pwe repwe pweipwog fenoawa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw atapeonneogiugaemi nge aefaennigaemi reen <char style="tl">yeast</char> we aar Pharisees me Sadducees.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra rhaepetae reen kkepas fengaen nee fineer, “A aepesa kkepas eei pwe iga sise pweipwog fenoawa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Jesus a giuneei meeta we ra aepesa, iwe a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta oawwa fioangei nee finaemi aan esooar fenoawa reemi reen? Me gaen mwittiginen aaemi niugiuniug! <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Meeta, oawsaaen metaf mwo? Oawse maengiy igiwe i giniiy niffai fenoawa wooar rhooawe nimingeras? Fitowu rhiug oawwa oawuta reen minikkewe nusegin mwongo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Nge oatowe i giniiy fenoawa kkewe fiusiufai wooar rhooawe faangeras, fitowu rhiug oaw oawuta reen minikkewe nusegin mwongo? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Ifa wusun imwu oawse metaf pwe ise kkepesaen fenoawa ngaenigaemi? Oawpwe aefaennigaemi reen aar <char style="tl">yeast</char> Pharisees me Sadducees!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra metefaaegini pwe Jesus ese kkepesaen pwe repwe aefaenniir reen <char style="tl">yeast</char> we eno noan fenoawa, pwe saengi aar Pharisees me Sadducees fenai.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter e Iura pwe Jesus Ina Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mark 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luke 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Jesus a noa ngaeni pwiuneoi we e arap ngaeni aepinoamwon Caesarea Philippi, igiwe a aeiineeor rhooan kkayeo kkewe me ee pwe, “Iyo ee aeremas ra aepesa pwe iiy Naiun Aeremas?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Aaemweoi re iura pwe John Baptist, nge aaemweoi re iura pwe Elijah, nge aaemweoi re iura pwe Jeremiah aere aaemweoi profeta.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Nge aaemi, oaw iura pwe ngaang iyo?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een Kristus iwe Naiun Deus iwe e menaw.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Wenepwu ngaeniug, Simon naiun John! Pwe kkepas eei ese itto reemw me reer aeremas, pwe Semaei noan naaeng minne e pwaeri ngaeniug. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Iwe ipwe aengaeniug pwe een Peter: een efai faai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wewen </char><char style="fq">Peter</char> me noan kkepesaen Greek nge <char style="fqa" closed="false">faai. </char></note> Nge wooan wungaen fai een ipwe aiuwtae aaei keneisia wooan, nge maenoa mwo nge esoapw tongaeni oatoaropa. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Ngaang ipwe ngaenneog kkiaen Mweoiun Naaeng; minne oawwa feoti me feoniufan epwe pwan feofeo me wooan naaeng, nge minne oawwa saeneti me wooan feoniufan epwe pwan saenetaeg me wooan naaeng.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Iwe Jesus a aetiwenig ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe pwe resoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai pwe iiy miniwe Kristus.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aepesa Waeiraesin me Maenoan</para>
  <para style="r">(Mark 8.31 — 9.1; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luke 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Saengi rhag oatowe nge Jesus a rhaepetae aan aemmetefa ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Ipwene noa Jerusalem, nge ipwene noa waeiraes me reer mwaaen kkewe aar, me soamwoonin patere kkewe me rhooawe sinsein anniug. Repwe niaei noa, nge mwirin enuuw raaen nge ipwe menaw sefaaen.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Iwe Peter a wummwuw noa egius nge a noa soong ngaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, esoapw ina minna! Esoapw mmwenen wen ngaeniug minna!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Nge Jesus a toagun ngaeni Peter nge a aengaeni pwe, “Rhiuw me oaroi, Saetan, een rhooan pineyiaei. Pwe oamw niunniuwaen ese itto me reen Deus, pwe e itto me reen aeremas.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Aere erhai a mwerhaen tapweaei, epwe aerheei noa niunniuwaennen wooan oanongan, a aiufera aan kurus nge tapweeito mwiriy. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Pwe iyo e mwerhaen ammwarhiu menewan, epwe ppiung saengi; nge iyo eppiung saengi menewan pwonno ngaang, epwe giuneei menaw. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Epwe meeta ipitan aaen yo faeinaengiy nniuw noa ngaeni erhai, nge ese yo ngaeni menewan? Esooar ngaere! Esoapw yor meeta erhai epwe tongaeni fangenoa pwe epwe pwigi sefaaeniy menewan. <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Pwe Naiun Aeremas epwe war noan nningen minna Seman me angkenus kkewe naiun. Enoa oatonaan nge a aesefaaeni ngaeni erhai me erhai aeremas wunuunun aan feoffeeor. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe eyor aaemweoi aeremas igeei resoapw mae, toori oatona repwe weri Naiun Aeremas epwe wareto pwe <char style="tl">King</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Nniuwen Noan Wunuunun Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mark 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luke 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Iwe mwirin wonowu raaen, Jesus a paenitae Peter me mwaaen pwipwi kkewe riiurhai James me John nge a wummwuur tae wooan eew rhug taegias, nge a iir noa rhag ee. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Igiwe re rhiuwen oawruru Jesus, nge a ssiuwen noa wunuunun: wooan mesan a weei seremaen ttinen aenet, nge mengaagiun a igin pwerheraeg noa. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Iwe nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe eoniurhai ra weri Moses me Elijah pwe re kekkepas fengaen me Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Iwe, Peter a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Soamwoon, a igin gacch pwe sino igeei. Aere wo tipaeni, ipwe aiuwtae enuuw iimw tampwoning igeei, eew imwoamw, eew imwaen Moses, me eew imwaen Elijah.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Igiwe Peter e rhiuwen kekkepas, eew toapw seram a itto pwaniiur noa, nge eew mangiungiu saengi toapw we a aepesa pwe, “Ieei Naeyi mwaaen aerhaengerhaeng, iye efin tipaei reen, oaw aiussaening ngaeni!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Igiwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, ra igin mesag, iwe ra tororhap tiw wooan ppweon. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Iwe Jesus a itto reer nge a geotteopaar nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawpwaetae, oawsoapw mesag!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Iwe renoa fattae nge esooar ne re rhiuwen weri pwe a Jesus noa rhag.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Igiwe ra ittiw me wooan rhug we, Jesus a aetiwenig ngaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai meeta oawwa weri, toori aaen mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe menaw sefaaen me reen maenoa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra aeiineow Jesus pwe, “Meeta sinsein anniug ra aepesa pwe Elijah epwe mmwaen itto reen?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Epwe fasiun gommwoto Elijah pwe epwe oamoannatae oanongaen aegiaeg. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe Elijah a fasiun itto, nge aeremas rese aeginna, pwe refeeori ngaeni minne re tipaeni. Epwan ina rhag aar aeppaeti mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra metaf pwe Jesus a kkepas ngaeniir reen wunuunun John Baptist.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwa Erhai Aetemwaaen Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mark 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luke 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Igiwe ra sefaaen ngaeniir pwuwaen aeremas kkewe, erhai mwaaen a itto reen Jesus, a foato pwiugiuwtiw me mmwan <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>nge a aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, faayeow aetemwaaen e naeyi! Egaen ngong nge a igin waeiraes nge a faaen ssow aan ppiungiunong noan aengaet me ne rhaan. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Iya pwigito reer rhooan kkayeo kkewe noawumw, nge iir rese mmwenen aecchipwatae.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Iwe Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ifa mwo aaemi se niugiuniug me ruguppin faaen oateei! Epwe ifa ssiunaein aaei ipwe no reemi? Epwe ifa wusun aaei noaneenaei reemi? Oaw pwigito aetena reei!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Jesus a aerh ngaeni aniu aenneew we, iwe a toowow me reen aet we, nge noan rhag oatowe nge aet we a cchipw tae.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra itto reen Jesus igiwe a iir noa rhag nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta aemaem aeise mmwenen oatowowuw aniu aenneew we reen?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Pwonno iga e mwittig aaemi niugiuniug. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe aere aaemi niugiuniug eweei nepaen faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char> een, emmwen oawpwe aengaeni rhug een pwe, ‘Wopwe mwagiut saengi igeei nge wa noa iginaan!’ nge epwe mwagiut. Emmwen oawpwe feeori ese tiwegin meeta.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>[Nge maeipin me aecchigipin rhag minne emmwen epwe asiuw wow taeppen een; esooar pwan eew meeta ne emmwen.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwan Aepesa Wunuunun Aan Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mark 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luke 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Oatowe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra rhu fengaen me noan Galilee, Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwene yonong nee paiiur aeremas, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>repwe niiy noa, nge mwirin enuuw raaen epwe menaw sefaaen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">A igin aenneew noa noan tipeer rhooan kkayeo kkewe.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Tax</char> Reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Igiwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra toori Capernaum, rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we ra itto reen Peter nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Ifa wusun, sinsei mwu naimi esoapw fang <char style="tl">tax</char> reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Peter a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Ewaer, epwe fang.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Oatowe Peter a toonong noan iimw we, Jesus a mmwaen kkepas, “Simon, meeta oamw niunniuwaen? Iyo epwe pey aegini ngaeniir <char style="tl">king</char>aaen faniuw <char style="tl">tax</char>? Naiiur aeremas aere waseona?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Waseona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Iwe Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Aere ina, nge aeremesaen faniuw resoapw fang aar <char style="tl">tax</char>. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Nge sise mwerhaen sipwe aenneewa nee tipeer aeremas kaan. Iwe wonoa noan meoneoiniun we wa noa aerheei nong oamw ooa noan. Iwe nge mmwaen iig na wopwe nipaeni, wopwe sugi noa ewan, nge wa pwigi faiun senaapiy ina eno noan e nnaaf ngaeniaei <char style="tl">tax</char> reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> me oamw. Pwigi nge wa fang ngaeniir pwe aarh <char style="tl">tax</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Iyo e Oarosaen Taegias?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mark 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luke 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Noan oatowe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Iyo e oarosaen taegias me noan minna Mweoiu Naaeng?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Iwe Jesus a faingito erhai wonigaet nge aiuwtae me weni mmweer. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Nge a aepesa pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, aere oawse ssiuwen pwe oawpwe weer rhag wonigaet, oawsoapw mmwenen toonong noan minna Mweoiu Naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Iyo na oarosaen taegias me noan minna Mweoiu Naaeng, nge iiy minne e oasossonaetiw pwe epwe aeffitaeg ngaeni wonigaet een. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Nge iyo e aetiwa erhai wonigaet faaen itaei, iiy epwan aetiwaeyaei.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Meeta Kka e Oamonofitiir Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mark 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luke 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Aere erhai efeeori pwe erhai maan mwittig kaan epwe ppiung noa aan niugiuniug reei, nge efaer gacch pwe epwe geeogeeotae efai fai temoag faaen iiuwan nge ra noa oamoapwu noa nee metaw. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Ifa mwo aenneewaen faeinaengiy iga eyor rhag minikka e affeeori pwe epwe ppiung noa aar aeremas niugiuniug! Taeppen minikkaan nge repwe fasiun wen, nge ifa mwo aenneewan aeremas na erhaepiy tae minikkeei!<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Aere poawumw aere pirhemw re affeeori pwe epwe ppiung noa oamw niugiuniug, wa gopiy noa wa oatoranoa! Egacch oamw wopwe toonong noan menaw na esooar iyaenin wooan oamw pai efoarh me pirhe efoarh, mmwaen oamw wopwe pai riiufoarh aere pirhe riiufoarh nge ra aerheog nong noan aengaet we esooar iaenin. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Me ngaere mesoamw a affeeori pwe epwe ppiung noa oamw niugiuniug, wopwe oannusuwow wa oatoranoa! Efaer gacch oamw wopwe toonong noan menaw na esooar iyaenin reen oamw maseyefai, mmwaen oamw wopwe maseriufai nge ra aerheog nong noan aengaetaen nifierno.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon <char style="tl">Sheep</char> we e Mwaenirh Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luke 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Oaw aefaenniy pwe oawsoapw aeffaeioapwut mwo nge erhai me neeiir aet mwittig kaan. Pwe ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe angkenusuur aetekkaan repwe wewweri rhag mesaen minna Semaei noan naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>[Pwe Naiun Aeremas a itto, pwe epwe aemenewaar rhooawe re mwaenirh noa.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Meeta aaemi niunniuwaen? Aere erhai mwaaen eyor epwiugiuw naiun <char style="tl">sheep</char>, nge erhai neeiir a mwaenirh noa, iiy epwe nigititiw ikkiwe tiweig me tiweman wooan rhug we pwe epwe noa giutta iwe erhai e mwaenirh noa. <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Ngaere a weri iwe erhai, ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, iiy epwe igin kker reen iwe erhai mmwaen ikkiwe tiweig me tiweman rese mwaenirh noa. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>E aeffitaeg ngaeni rhag iga Semaemi noan naaeng ese mwerhaen pwe erhai mwo me neeiir man mwittig kaan repwe mwaenirh noa.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iga Erhai Epwe Monofit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Aere pwiimw a monofit ngaeniug, wopwe noa reen pwe wopwe noa pwaeri ngaeni meeta na teren, nge noan mwoanomwoan nepetaemi rhag riiurhai. Ngaere e aiussaening ngaeniug, een wa pwini sefaaeniy pwiimw. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Ngaere ese aiussaening ngaeniug, wopwe paeni erhai aere riiurhai rhinoamw, ‘pwe oanongaen kkepas nge rhooa na riiurhai aere eoniurhai repwe aenneta aere ennet,’ taeppen miniwe effoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Iwe, aere ese mwerhaen aiussaening ngaeniir, wopwe pwaeri ngaeni rhooan keneisia. Aere keneisia mwo nge ese aiussaening ngaeni, iwe ina nge wopwe feeori ngaeni wunuunun minna wopwe feeori ngaeni erhai mane ese niugiuw Deus aere erhai rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char>.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feoti me Saeneti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi: minne oawwa feoti me feoniufan epwe pwan feofeo me wooan naaeng, nge minne oawwa saeneti me wooan feoniufan epwe pwan saenetaeg me wooan naaeng.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>“Iwe, ipwe pwan aengaenigaemi pwe: aere riiurhai neeimi wooan feoniufan ra tipieew fengaen wooan aekkaew minne repwe maeipin wooan, epwe toorigaemi mmwenen me reen Semaei wooai naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Pwe iga riiurhai aere eoniurhai ra rhu fengaen pwe faaen itaei, ngaang ipwan no reer.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Engaang we Ese Faayeow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Iwe Peter a itto reen Jesus nge aeiineow pwe, “Soamwoon, aere pwiiy a gaen monofit ngaeniaei, faaen fitowu ngaang ipwe saeneti noa aan monofit? Epwe faaen fisuuw?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Nge Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Aapw, saapw faaen fisuuw rhag, pwe faaen fisiig me fisuuw. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Ieei minne Mweoiu Naaeng a aeffitaeg ngaeni. Erhai <char style="tl">king</char> a mwerhaen pwe naiun rhooan engaang repwene itto aera monofitiir ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Oatowe ennaen rhaepetae ne feeori iiy miniwe, nge ra pwigito erhai nge e monofitini fitasenn mwo senaapiy. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Iwe iga rhooan engaang we ese mmwenen aera miniwe monofitin, iwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a aepesa pwe repwe ameow noa fengaen me pwiuniuwan me naiun me oanongaen meeta pisaegiir pwe epwe mmwenen aera minikkewe monofitin. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Iwe rhooan engaang we a foato pwiugiuwtiw me mmwaen <char style="tl">king</char> we nge aeffaenipirhe ngaeni pwe, ‘Faayeowaei, pwe wopwe tipenaei ngaeniaei. Ngaang ipwe aera sefaaeniy oanongaen monofitiy ngaeniug.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Iwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a igin faayeow rhooan engaang we, iwe a saeneti noa aan monofit nge a fang pwe epwene noa.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Mwirin rhooan engaang we a noa weri erhai rhinan rhooan engaang e monofit ngaeni fitowu rhag senaapiy. Iwe a torofi mwaaen we, a fiengi worongan nge a aengaeni pwe, ‘Wopwe aera sefaaen monofitimw ngaeniaei.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Iwe rhooan engaang we a aesirowu tiw nge tingoar maaw ngaeni, ‘Wose mwerhaen wopwe faayeow ngaeniaei, ngaang ipwapw pey monofitiy ngaeniug!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Nge mwaaen we ese mwerhaen. A aepesa pwe repwe oatoranong noan imwaen kanepwus toori aan epwe pey aegini monofitin. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Igiwe rhooan engaang kkewe rhinan ra giuneei meeta we a wen, ra igin soong iwe ra noa reen <char style="tl">king</char> we ra noa aengaeni oanongaen meeta we a wen. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Iwe<char style="tl">king</char> we a faingito rhooan engaang we nge a aengaeni pwe, ‘Een erhai rhooan engaang kkewe re aenneew! Ngaang iya saeneti noa oanongaen oamw monofit ngaeniaei faaen itaen oamw tingoar ngaeniaei. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Meeta wose faayeow ngaeni rhinoamw rhooan engaang reen, taeppen rhag meeta ngaang iya feeori ngaeniug?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Noan aaen <char style="tl">king</char> we igin soong, a fangenoa rhooan engaang we noan kanepwus toori aan epwe pey aegini oanongaen monofit kkewe aan ngaeni.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>“Epwe ieen taeppen minne Semaei noan naaeng epwe feeori ngaeni erhai me erhai neeimi, aere oawsoapw saeneti noa monofitin pwiimi me noan tipaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Fenaiuw Wunuunun Mweoinoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mark 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Igiwe Jesus a moann aan aepesa oanongaen minikkeei, nge a siusaengi Galilee pwe noa ngaeni faniuwaen Judea me wenepeiginoan pwupwu we Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Pwuwaen aeremas kkewe rettapw noa mwirin, a aecchipwa tae me pwiuneoi we.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees ra itto reen pwe repwe soatoni, nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Egacch me noan aarh anniug pwe erhai mwaaen epwe mweoi saengi pwiuniuwan reen minne rhag e tipaeni?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oawse aeraegi miniwe effoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus, pwe saengi rhaepetaen nge Deus a feeoriir aeremas pwe mwaaen me rhooapwut? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Nge Deus a aepesa pwe, ‘Ieei minne erhai mwaaen epwe nigiti seman me inan nge a noa rhuu ngaeni pwiuniuwan, pwe repwene eew rhag.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Ina minne iir resoapw rhiuwen riiurhai no, pwe ra erhai rhag. Esooar erhai aeremas ne epwe mweoiti fesaenngiy meeta e Deus a oarhuw fengaenniy.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Iwe, rhooawe Pharisees ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta rhag Moses a feeori anniug we pwe erhai mwaaen epwe mmwenen ngaenneei pwiuniuwan pwapwioron mweoinoa reen?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Moses a saeneti pwe aaemi mwaaen oawpwe mweoi saengi pwiuniuwaemi faaen itaen aaemi se rongorong ngaeni aan fenai. Nge ese ina wusun saengi rhaepetaen igiwe Deus efeeori feoniufan. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi: aere erhai mwaaen a mweoi saengi pwiuniuwan faaen itaen aekkaew aegiaeg, nge soapw reen aaen niewe maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai, iiy mwaaen we epwan feeori monofit aere a pwiuniuwaeni pwan erhai rhooapwut.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra aengaeni pwe, “Aere epwe ieei wusun nepetaen erhai mwaaen me pwiuniuwan, epwe faer gacch aarh sisoapw pwiuppwiuniuw.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Fenai eei nge ese noa ngaeniir oanongeer aeremas, pwe rhooawe rhag Deus a ngaenneer. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Pwe e towunap faan minne mwaaen rese gaen pwiuppwiuniuw reen: aaemweoi re wupwutiw pwe epwe ina wusuur, aaemweoi nge aeremas minne refeeoriir pwe resoapw pwiuppwiuniuw, nge pwan aaemweoi rese mwerhaen pwiuppwiuniuw pwonno faaen itaen minna Mweoiu Naaeng. Iyo e metefaaegini fenai een ina epwe metaf reen.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Maeipinaar Wonigaet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mark 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luke 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra pwigiir to wonigaet reen Jesus, pwe epwe iseni tae paiun wooar nge a maeipinaar, nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra soong ngaeniir. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Nge Jesus a iura pwe, “Fangeto aetekkena reei, nge oawsoapw aiugiiur, pwe minna Mweoiu Naaeng ina aar aeremas kka reweer wonigaet.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Iwe a iseni tae paiun wooar, iwe a mwet saengiir.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Erhai Anian Naiwiis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mark 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luke 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Eew oaton nge erhai mwaaen a itto reen Jesus nge a aeiineow pwe, “Sinsei, meeta min mwamwaai ipwe feeori pwe epwe yo ngaeniaei menaw na esooar iaenin?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Meeta wa faer aeiineowaei minne e mwamwaai reen? Erhai rhag minne e mwamwaai. Aere wo mwerhaen weri menaw, tapweei oasoapwosoapw kkeei.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>A aeiineo pwe, “Oasoapwosoapw kkefa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Wosoapw nni aeremas, wosoapw ffeeor manetemwaai, wosoapw mwoarho, wosoapw oatupwutupw tae kkepas wooan erhai. <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>Wopwe aesirowu semoamw me inoamw, wopwe aerhaengi rhooan weni oaromw taeppen rhag oamw sipegin aerhaengi oanongoamw.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Iwe anian we a aengaeni pwe, “Ngaang iya fasiun tapweei oanongaen oasoapwosoapw kkeei. E rhiuwen pwan yor meeta isaaen feeori mwo?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Aere wa mwerhaen wopwe oanongonniuwaen gin gacch, wa noa ameow noa oanongaen pisaegimw, nge wa fang senaapian ngaeniir rhooa affayeo, ina nge epwe yor wiinoamw me wooai naaeng. Iwe nge wa itto tapweaei.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Igiwe anian we a rongorong miniwe, a siunoa noan aan tip aenneew, pwe igiwe iiy erhai man naiwiis.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi: epwe waeiraes pwe aeremas kka re pisaegisaeg repwe toonong noan minna Mweoiu Naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Ipwe aepini sefaaeniy ngaenigaemi, egin mererhaeg aaen erhai <char style="tl">camel</char> epwe toonong noan ngetaen efoarh oaguwa, me mmwaen aaen erhai mwaaen pisaegisaeg epwe toonong noan minna Mweoiun Deus.”<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="HK00041B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="19.24"/><verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Igiwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra rongorong kkepas we, ra igin riutae reen nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Iwe, iyo rhag epwe mmwenen menaw?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Nge Jesus a fan wenewen ngaeniir nge a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Minneei ese mmwen ngaeni aeremas, nge oanongaen meeta nge emmwen ngaeni Deus.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Iwe Peter a iura, “Pipiiy, aemaem aeiya siusaengi oanongaen aegiaeg nge aeiya itto tapweog. Iwe meeta aeipwe aeni?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Jesus a aengaeniir, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe oatona mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe mooat wooan nenien mooat na aan ina enning noan mweoi ffeo eei, nge aaemi rhoaniuwaei oawpwe pwan mooat wooan seig me ruwowu nenien mooat pwe oawpwe nemaeniir aeinang kkewe seig me ruwowu ikkiwe aaen Israel. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Nge iyo e siusaengi imwan, aere pwiin, aere mwengeyan, aere seman, aere inan, aere naiun, aere faniuwan, faaen itaei, epwe pwigi meoniun epwe temoag saengi epwiugiuw, nge epwe pwan pwigi menaw na esooar iaenin. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Pwe towunepeer rhooawe re amwirimwir repwene gommw, nge towunepeer rhooawe regommw repwene amwirimwir.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Engaang Wooan Maetaen <char style="tl">Grape</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Minna Mweoiu Naaeng eweei minneen. Eno erhai mwaaen a wugusoronoa epwe noa giut rhooan engaang pwe repwe engaang wooan aan maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char>. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>A tipieew ngaeniir rhooan engaang kkewe pwe paniuweer nge epwe efai faiun <char style="tl">silver</char> noan eew raaen, iwe a fangenoa pwe repwe noa engaang wooan maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char> we aan. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Enoa tiwowu konook a sefaaen noa reen nenien chuwaai we nge a noa weriir aaemweoi mwaaen re iu fetaen, nge esooar meeta refeeori, <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>iwe a aengaeniir pwe, ‘Oawpwe pwan noa engaang noan maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char> na aaei, pwe ipwe ngaennegaemi paniuwaemi iye egacch.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Iwe ra noa. Iwe nge enoa seig me ruwowu konook iwe pwan enuuw konook nge a pwan feeori taeppen rhag miniwe a feeori mmwan. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Enoa aerepa nimowu konook nee oanowas, a pwan noa noan nenien chuwaai we, nge a noa weriir aaemweoi mwaaen repwan iu fetaen igiwe. Iwe, a aeiineeor pwe, ‘Meeta oawwa iu fetaen rhag igeei, nge oawse engaang?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Esooar erhai ne e mwerhaen aengaengagemaem.’ Iwe, a aengaeniir pwe, ‘Oawnoa engaang noan maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char> na aaei.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Nge igiwe a pwoong noa, nge mwaaen we aan maat we a aengaeni soamwooniir rhooan engaang kkewe pwe, ‘Faingiir to rhooan engaang kkewe nge wa pey aeginiir, rhaepetae me reer rhooawe re amwirito toori rhooawe regommwoto.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Mwaaen kkewe re rhaepetaen aar engaang reen nimowu konook, ra pey aeginiir reen efai <char style="tl">silver</char> nge paniuwaen erhai. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Iwe nge igiwe mwaaen kkewe regommw ra war pwe repwe pwigi paniuweer, ra niuwaennei pwe epwe temoag paniuweer saengiir, nge repwan fang rhag efai <char style="tl">silver</char> ngaeni erhai me erhai iir. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Igiwe ra pwigi paniuweer nge ra rhaepetae aar ngiuniungiuniuw wonowe aan maat we. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>Ra aepesa pwe, ‘Mwaaen kkewe re amwirito, re engaang noan eew rhag awa, nge aemaem aeiya engaang waeiraes faaen aenet noan ffoarhon raaeneei, nge wa pwan aeffitaegiy rhag paniuweer ngaeni paniuwaemmaem!’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Iwe wonowe aan maat we a aengaeni erhai neeiir, ‘Maereyaerei, ngaang ise oatupwug. Een wo tipieew ngaeniaei pwe wopwe engaang noan eew raaen faaen itaen efai <char style="tl">silver</char>. <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Igina pwigi paniuwoamw nge wa noa reen imwoamw. Ngaang i tipaeni ipwe pey aegini mwaaen enaaen itto nepaen rhag miniwe ngaang i ngaenneog. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Meeta, esooar maemaewaei pwe ipwe feeori meeta tipaei ngaeni naeyi senaapiy? Ngaere wopwai iga ngaang igin mmwoon?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Iwe Jesus a soapwei noa nge a aepesa pwe, “Ina minne rhooawe re amwirimwir repwene gommw, nge rhooawe regommw repwene amwirimwir.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aeinuwaen Aaen Jesus Aepesa Aan Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mark 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luke 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Igiwe Jesus a ittae Jerusalem, a paeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai nge a kkepas ngaeniir igiwe a iir noa rhag reen aar faaeraeg. <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aiussaening. Sipwe ittae Jerusalem, nge aeremas repwene fangenoa miniwe Naiun Aeremas nee paiiur soamwoonin patere kkewe me sinsein anniug kkewe. Repwene apwiungiu pwe epwe maenoa, <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>nge ra fangenoa nee paiiur Gentiles, nge repwe aeni aegekkaei, repwe wirhiy nge re kurusuw noa; nge mwirin enuuw raaen epwe menaw sefaaen.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Erhai Iin Tingoar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mark 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Iwe niewe pwiuniuwaen Zebedee me mwaaen riiurhai kkewe naiun ra itto reen Jesus, rhooapwut we a foatotiw me mmwan nge a aengaeni tingoar we aan.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Jesus a aeiineow pwe, “Meeta wo tipaeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Rhooapwut we a iura pwe, “Wopwe ppwon ngaeniaei, pwe mwaaen riiurhai kka naeyi repwe mooat peig mwaaenemw me peig rhooapwutomw, iga aere wopwene no pwe een <char style="tl">king</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Jesus a aengaeniir rhooawe riiurhai pwe, “Aaemi oawse giuneei minne oawwa tingoar. Oawmmwenen iun me reen kkepaen aewwaeiraes e ngaang ipwe iuniumi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Ooa, emmwen ngaenigemaem.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ooa, oawpwe mmwenen iun me noan kkap e aaei, nge soapw ngaang minne ipwe finitae iyo epwe mooat peig mwaaeneei me peig rhooapwutoi. Neniy kkeei nge nenieer rhooakkena minna Semaei a fasiun feeori pwe nenieer.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Nge igiwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, ra igin soong wooar mwaaen pwipwi kkewe riiurhai. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Iwe Jesus a faingiir oanongeer nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi oaw giuneei pwe rhooakka re nemaeniir re Gentiles ina eyor maemaeweer wooar, nge soamwoon kena aar minne re nemaeni ppagiiur noa. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Nge esoapw ieei wunuunun nee finaemi. Pwe iyo a mwerhaen taegias me neeimi, iiy epwe no pwe naimi rhooan engaang ngaenigaemi oanongaemi, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>nge iyo a mwerhaen epwe gommw me neeimi, iiy epwe <char style="tl">slave</char> ngaenigaemi. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Epwe taeppen rhag Naiun Aeremas iye ese itto pwe aeremas repwe engaang ngaeni, pwe efaer itto pwe epwe engaang ngaeniir aeremas me fangenoa menewan faaen iteer towunepaen aeremas.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aeffetanoa Meseer Riiurhai Mwaaen Parh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mark 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luke 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Igiwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra mwet saengi Jericho, eew pwuwaen aeremas ra ttapw to mwiriir. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Iwe nge riiurhai mwaaen parh remooat wenepeigin aan we ra rongorong pwe Jesus a faaeraeg wooan aan we, iwe ra rhaepetae reen aar iyaekkepwas, “Naiun David, faayeogemaem menap!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Nge rhooa towunap we ra soong ngaeniir nge ra aengaeniir pwe repwe anniug noa. Nge iir ra faer egius mwo nge oatomoga noa aar iyaekkepwas, “Naiun David, faayeogemaem menap!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Jesus a iug noa nge a faingiir to. A aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta oawwa mwerhaen pwe ipwe feeori ngaenigaemi?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Menap, aei mwerhaen pwe wopwe aeffetanoa mesaemmaem!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Jesus a igin faayeeor iwe a geotteopa meseer; reen rhag oatowe nge a ffatenoa meseer, iwe ra tapweei noa mwirin Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Toonongon Jesus Noan Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mark 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luke 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">John 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Igiwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra arap ngaeni Jerusalem, ra itto reen Bethphage reen rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>. Iwe nge Jesus a fangenoa riiurhai rhooan kkayeo kkewe <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawpwe noa noan pwugos mwu mmwaemi, nge oawpwe noa weri erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char> e feotaeg iginaan fengaen me minna naiun eno oaron. Oawpwe pwaeisiir nge oawwa wummwuur to reei. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Nge aere erhai epwe aepesa eew meeta ngaenigaemi, oawpwe aengaeni pwe, ‘Soamwoon e mwerhaen waawa’; ina rhag nge epwe fangenoa iir.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>A wen minneen pwe epwe pwaeri noa miniwe profeta e aepesa:<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Aengaeni aepinoamwon Zion pwe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Emwaeri, a itto <char style="tl">king</char> we noawumw!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Etip sessoan nge e waawa erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char> mwittig, naiun erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra noa feeori meeta miniwe Jesus a aengaeniir. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Ra pwigito <char style="tl">donkey</char> we me miniwe naiun <char style="tl">donkey</char> we, ra iseni tae mengaagiiur wooar, nge Jesus a teeotae wooan. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Iwe rhooa towunap we ra mmeraeg noa mengaagiiur wooan aan we, nge aaemweoi ra gopogop tiw paeiniu pwe enenaen wooan aan we. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Towunepeer aeremas kkewe regommw me mmwaen Jesus, pwan rhooawe re tapweto mwirin ra aekkepwas pwe, “Sipwe aepingepinga Naiun David! Deus epwe aewenepwuwa aeremas na epwe itto faaen itaen Soamwoon! Aepingepinga Deus na oarosaen taegias!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Igiwe Jesus a toonong noan Jerusalem, oanongaen aepinoamw we ra riu pwurhopwurh fetaen reen. Ra aeiineo pwe, “Iyo mwaaeneei?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Aaemweoi aeremas ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Iiy profeta we Jesus saengi Nazareth noan Galilee.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Noa Noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mark 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luke 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">John 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Igiwe Jesus a toonong noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge a asiiur wow rhooawe re chuwaai me ameomeo pisaeg me igiwe. A aerheppa noa <char style="tl">table</char> kkewe aar rhooan ssiuwen senaapiy me nenien mooat kkewe aar rhooan chuwaai <char style="tl">pigeons</char>, <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe, “E foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus pwe Deus a aepesa pwe, ‘<char style="tl">Temple</char> e aaei epwe ffai pwe imwaen maeipin,’ nge aaemi oawwa ssiuweniy ngaeni eew nenien wopoor rhooa mwoarho.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Iwe rhooa kkewe re masparh me rhooa pirhemae ra itto reen Jesus noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge a aecchipwaar tae. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Nge soamwoonin patere kkewe me sinsein anniug kkewe ra igin soong reen min amwaraar kkewe Jesus a feeorin, me pwan aar wonigaet kkewe re iyaekkepwas me noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we pwe, “Sipwe aepingepinga Naiun David!”<verse eid="MAT 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Iwe ra aeiineow Jesus pwe, “Wo rongorong minikka wonigaet kaan ra aepesa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Ewaer, iya rongorong. Oawsaaen aeraegi mwo miniwe a foat noan Pwapwior we e Santus? ‘Aaemi oawwa oasuguunaar wonigaet me goagoa pwe repwe oassoara itoamw.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Iwe Jesus a nigitiir me Jerusalem, a noa ngaeni aepinoamwon Bethany. Iwe a noa no aegini epwoong igiwe.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Soong Ngaeni Waniwan we <char style="tl">Fig</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mark 11.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Igiwe a sefaaeniti aepinoamw we noan soran we, nge Jesus a pecchai. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>A weri waniwan we <char style="tl">fig</char> eno wenepeigin aan we iwe a faaeraeg ngaeni, nge a weri pwe esooar uwaan pwe rheon rhag. Iwe a aengaeni waniwan we pwe, “Esooar faaen eew ne wopwe rhiuwen uwa!” Noan rhag oaton we nge waniwan we a ppwass noa.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Igiwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra weri miniwe nge ra riutae nge ra iura pwe, “E ifa wusun rhag nge a noa mwetekkaein ppwass noa waniwan <char style="tl">fig </char> een?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe aere oaw niugiuniug, nge oawse tip mwaramwar, oawpwe mmwenen feeori meeta ngaang iya feeori ngaeni waniwan we <char style="tl">fig</char>. Nge saapw minneen rhag, pwe oawpwe pwan mmwenen aengaeni rhug een pwe, ‘Mwagiut saengi igeei nge wa noa oatoranoa oanongoamw nee metaw,’ nge epwe mmwen. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Aere oaw niugiuniug, nge oawpwe pwigi oanongaen meeta oaw tingoar noan aaemi maeipin.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Nemaeniaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mark 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luke 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Igiwe Jesus a sefaaen nong noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge a fenai, nge soamwooniir patere kkewe me mwaaen kkewe aar ra itto reen nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta nemaenioamw pwe wopwe feeori minikkeei? Iyo a ngaenneog oamw nemenem?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir, “Ngaang ipwe aeiineogaemi eew kkepas aeiineo, nge aere oaw paniuwaeni, ngaang ipwe pwan aengaenigaemi iya iga i pwigi aaei nemenem me ee pwe ipwe feeori minikkeei. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Iya e itto aaen John nemenem pwe epwe paptismus fetaen: saengi Deus aere saengi aeremas?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Iwe, ra rhaepetae aar aengimaw fengaen wooar, “Meeta sipwe iura? Aere sipwe iura pwe, ‘Saengi Deus,’ nge iiy epwe aeiineogirh pwe, ‘Meeta rhag oawse niugiuniug ngaeni John reen?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Nge aere sipwe iura pwe, ‘Saengi aeremas,’ si mesagiiur aeremas, pwe oanongeer re niugiuniug pwe John nge erhai profeta.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Iwe ra paniuwaeni Jesus pwe, “Aeise giuneei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Jesus a aengaeniir, “Iwe ngaang isoapw pwan aengaenigaemi iya iga i pwigi me ee nemaeniaei pwe ipwe feeori minikkeei.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangoor Riiurhai Pwipwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Igina meeta aaemi niunniuwaen? Eno erhai mwaaen eyor riiurhai naiun mwaaen. A noa reen mwaaen we e tugufaeyi nge a aengaeni pwe, ‘Naeyi, wonoa engaang noan maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char> igina.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Iwe nge iiy a paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Ngaang ise tipaeni ipwe noa.’ Nge mwirin a ssiuwen noa aan niunniuwaen nge a noa. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Iwe wonowe semeer a noa reen erhai naiun nge a noa aengaeni taeppen rhag iwe e aengaeni iwe erhai. Nge a paniuwaeni, ‘Ooa menap, ngaang ipwe noa,’ nge ese noa. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Iwe iyo neeiir rhooa ee riiurhai efeeori miniwe semeer e tipaeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Iwe, ra paniuwaeni, “Iwe e faeregit.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe rhooawe rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooapwutoi chuwaai kkewe nge repwe toonong noan Mweoiun Deus me mmwaemi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Pwe John Baptist a itto reemi nge a pwaeri ngaenigaemi aan na e mwamwaai, nge aaemi oawse niugiuniug reen. Nge rhooawe rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooapwutoi chuwaai kkewe ra niugiuniug reen. Inamwo iga oawwa weri minneen, nge aaemi oawse ssiuweniy aaemi niunniuwaen pwe oawpwe niugiuniug ngaeni.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Rhooan Aemmwenen Maat we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mark 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luke 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Iwe Jesus a iura pwe, “Oaw aiussaening ngaeni pwan eew fioangon awewe. A yor erhai mwaaen e foatogi eew maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char>, a feeori gurun niugiun, a genengi eew niipw pwe nenien wongowongin uwaen <char style="tl">grape</char> we nge a aiuwtae eew imwaen poos taegias me noan. Mwirin a ngaenneer aaemweoi rhooan maat pwe repwe aefaenniy. Iwe rhag nge a saei taaw noa. <figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00103B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="21.33"/> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Nge igiwe a toori oaton gin, a fangenoa naiun rhooan akkiuneo reer rhooan maat kkewe pwe repwe noa pwigito inetin me reen uwaen <char style="tl">grape</char> kkewe. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Iwe nge rhooan maat kkewe ra torofi rhooan akkiuneo kkewe nge ra wirhiy erhai, ra niiy noa erhai nge ra tera iwe erhai. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Mwirin nge mwaaen we a pwan fangenoa aaemweoi rhooan akkiuneo re towunap saengi rhooawe mmwan, nge rhooan maat kkewe ra pwan feeori ngaeniir wunuunun meeta kkewe ra feeori ngaeniir rhooawe regommw. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Oarosan nge a fangenoa mwaaen we naiun reer, nge a iura pwe, ‘I niugiuw nge repwe aesirowu mwaaen e naeyi.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Nge igiwe rhooan maat kkewe ra weri miniwe naiun, ra aepesa fengaenniy nee fineer pwe, ‘Ieen mwaaen we naiun mwaaen we aan maat eei iwe epwe pwugusaeni minneei. Oaw itto sipwe niiy noa, pwe sipwe pwigi minne pwugusaen pwe pwugusarh!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Iwe ra torofi, ra oatorawow me niugiun maat we nge ra niiy noa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Igina, ngaere mwaaen we aan maat we a war, meeta epwe feeori ngaeniir rhooan maat kkewe?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Epwe niir noa rhooawe re aenneew nge a ngaenneer aaemweoi maat we iyo kka repwe mmwenen fang inetin uwaen <char style="tl">grape</char> kkewe oaton gin.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Iwe, Jesus a aengaeniir, “Oawsaaen pwan aeraegi mwo meeta kkewe Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Fai we rhooan kaiu iimw re aerheei noa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nge faer ina fai we egin yor ipitan me mmwaen oanongan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Minneen nge feeoriaen Soamwoon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">a inamwo amwaraeran nningen!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>“Iwe, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe minna Mweoiun Deus nge repwe pwigi saengigaemi pwe repwe ngaenneer aeremas kka epwe mmwen epwe feeori uuwan. <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>[Iyo a ppiungiutiw wooan faai een nge epwe mwetoarotoar noa, nge aere faai een epwe ppiungiutiw wooan erhai, epwe aepettatiw.]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Igiwe soamwooniir patere kkewe me Pharisees ra rongorong fioangon awewe kkewe, nge re giuneei pwe e aepesaar, <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>iwe ra aegina pwe repwe torofi. Nge re mesagiu pwuwaen aeremas kkewe, pwe iir re iseni Jesus pwe erhai profeta.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Aeiineon Miniwe Gupwunon Appwiuniupai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luke 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Iwe, Jesus a pwan kkepas ngaeniir aeremas kkewe noan fioangon awewe. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Mweoiu Naaeng eweei minneen. Eno erhai <char style="tl">king</char> e oamoannatae aaen mwaaen we naiun gupwunon appwiuniupai. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>A fangenoa naiun rhooan engaang pwe repwe noa faingiir to waseona kkewe repwe itto tapweei gupwun we, nge rese mwerhaen itto. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Mwirin a pwan fangenoa aaemweoi rhooan engaang pwe repwe noa aengaeniir aeremas pwe: ‘Igina, aaei gupwun a moannotae; naeyi wakke me man pwetaei kkewe naiiur ra niir noa, iwe oanongan nge a moannotae. Oaw itto tapweei gupwuneen.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Nge rhooawe re faingiir rese tepa, iwe ra siunoa: erhai a noa ngaeni aan menaai, nge erhai a noa ngaeni aan nenien chuwaai, <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>nge pwan aaemweoi ra torofiir rhooan engaang kkewe, ra wirhiir nge ra niir noa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Iwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a igin soong, iwe a fangenoa sonotaw kkewe pwe repwe noa niir noa rhooawe renni menaw iwe me figinoa aepinoamwoor. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Iwe a faingiir to rhooan engaang kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, ‘Aaei gupwunon appwiuniupai a moannotae, nge waseona kkewe i faingiir pwe repwe itto tapweei gupwuneen nge ese fin pwe repwe itto. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Iwe oawnoa wooan ennap temoag kena pwe oawpwe faingiir to oanongeer aeremas kka oaw rhuungiir.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Iwe rhooan engaang kkewe ra faaeraeg wow wooan ennap kkewe nge ra faingiir oanongeer aeremas kka re rhuungiir, ese tiwegin aere aeremas gacch aere aeremas aenneew, iwe a sseog noa imwaen gupwun we reer waseona.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Igiwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a toonong noan iimw we pwe epwe pipiiy rhooan gupwun kkewe, a weri erhai mwaaen ese memmengaag min mwamwaai to reen appwiuniupai we. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Iwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a aeiineow pwe, ‘Maereyaerei, ifa wusun oamw toonong igeei, nge wose memmengaag min mwamwaai to reen appwiuniupai eei?’ Nge mwaaen we ese paniuwaeni. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Iwe <char style="tl">king</char> we a aengaeniir rhooan engaang kkewe pwe, ‘Oaw geoni paiun me pirheen nge oawwa oatorawow noan rorhappiung, iga epwe sessaeng nge akkaarengi me ee.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Nge Jesus a iura pwe, “Re towunap rhooawe re faingiir, nge fitiman rhag re finiir.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon <char style="tl">Tax</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mark 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luke 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Pharisees kkewe ra noa nge ra pwiungiuw fengaenniy pwe repwe aettefaeti reen aar kkepas aeiineo. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Ra fangenoa aaemweoi rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiiur reen Jesus me aaemweoi rhinaen Erotes. Nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, aemaem aei giuneei pwe een wo aepesa minikka ennet. Wa fenaiuw minikka ennet pwe wunuunun nee tipaen Deus ngaeniir aeremas, nge wose niuwaennei minikka aeremas ra aeni niunniuwaen, nge wose niuwaennei wunuunun erhai me erhai. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Iwe, aengaenigemaem meeta oamw niunniuwaen. E mwamwaai aarh sipwe fang <char style="tl">tax</char> ngaeni Soamwoonin Rome, aere aapw?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Nge Jesus e giuneei aar niunniuwaen aenneew, iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Meeta oaw mwerhaen pwe oawpwe soatoniaei reen? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Oaw pwaeri ngaeniaei senaapiy mwu oawpwe fang pwe <char style="tl">tax</char>!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Iwe, ra pwigito reen efai senaapiy. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Nge Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Mesaen iyo me itaen iyo een?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Soamwoonin Rome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Iwe, oawfang ngaeni Soamwoonin Rome meeta aaen Soamwoonin Rome, nge oawfang ngaeni Deus meeta aaen Deus.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Oatowe re rongorong kkepas we, ra mwaar noa reen, iwe ra siusaengi.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Menaw Sefaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mark 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luke 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Noan raaenin we rhag nge aaemweoi Sadducees ra itto reen Jesus ra iura pwe aeremas resoapw menaw sefaaen me reen mae. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Iwe, ra aepesa pwe, “Sinsei, Moses a iura pwe ngaere erhai mwaaen a maenoa nge esooar naiun, ina nge mwaaen we pwiin epwe pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we pwe epwe yor naiun pwe epwe ffai pwe naiun mwaaen we a mae. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Iwe, eyor fiusiuman pwipwi re fasiun nonno igeei. Iwe mwaaen we e tugufaeyi a pwiuniuwaeni erhai rhooapwut, nge a maenoa nge esooar naiun, iwe a nigiti niewe ngaeni wonowe pwiin. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Taeppen rhag meeta we ewen ngaeni iwe ariiurhaiun me iwe aeiniurhaiun toori oanongeer noa rhooawe fiusiuman. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Mwirin noan, nge rhooapwut we a maenoa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Iwe, noan raaenin na manimae repwene menaw sefaaen, iyo me neeiir rhooawe fiusiuman minne pwiuniuwaen rhooapwut we? Igiwe oanongeer nge re pwiuniuwaeni niewe.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Nge Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Aaemi oawwa mwaerhei, pwe iga aaemi oawse giuneei oawton Pwapwior we e Santus ngaere minikkena maemaewaen Deus. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Pwe oate rhooa mae repwe menaw sefaaen, repwene aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhag angkenusun naaeng nge resoapw pwiuppwiuniuw no. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Iwe nge reer manimae iga repwe menaw sefaaen tae: esaaen yor mwo aaemi aeraegi meeta we Deus e aengaenigaemi? Iwe e aepesa pwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Ngaang aaen Abraham Deus, aaen Isaac Deus me aaen Jacob Deus.’ Iiy aar Deus rhooakka re menaw, nge saapw aar Deus rhooakka remae.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Igiwe pwuwaen aeremas kkewe ra rongorong kkepas kkewe, ra mwaar noa reen aan fenai.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anniug we Oarosaen Taegias</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mark 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luke 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Oatowe Pharisees ra rongorong noa pwe Sadducees kkewe ra iugiu noa pwe resa giuneei no minne repwe paniuwaeni ngaeni Jesus, iir ra rhu fengaen, <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>nge erhai me neeiir, erhai sinsein anniug, a aegina ne soatoni Jesus reen aan kkepas aeiineo. <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>A aeiineow pwe, “Sinsei, ifa oasoapwosoapw e oarosaen taegias me neeiin oanongaen Anniug?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Wopwe aerhaengi Soamwoon na oamw Deus reen oanongaen nee tipoamw, reen oanongaen ngeoniumw pwan reen oanongaen oamw niunniuwaen. <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Ieei minne e oarosaen taegias me yor ipitan me neeiin oanongan oasoapwosoapw. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Nge oaruwowwaen oasoapwosoapw epwan taegias nge: ‘Wopwe aerhaengiir rhooan weni oaromw taeppen rhag oamw sipegin aerhaengi oanongoamw.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Oanongaen aaen Moses Anniug me aar profeta kkewe pwapwior nge re oanongonong rhag wooan oasoapwosoapw kka ruwowu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Iyo na Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mark 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luke 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Igiwe aaemweoi Pharisees ra rhu fengaen, Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Meeta oaw niuwaennei reen Kristus? Iiy teoteeon iyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Iiy teoteeon David.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta rhag nge Espritu Santus a aemeyaefi ngaeni David aan epwe faingi pwe ‘Soamwoon’? Iwe David a aepesa,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‘Soamwoon a aengaeniaei Soamwoon pwe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Mooat tiw peig mwaaeneei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">toori aaei ipwe iseniir tiw rhooan oapwutoag faaen pirhemw.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Iwe, ngaere David e faingi ngaeni pwe iiy ‘Soamwoon’, ifa wusun nge Kristus epwe no pwe teoteeon David?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Esooar erhai ne emmwenen paniuwaeni kkepas aeiyeg kkewe aaen Jesus, iwe saengi rhag noan raaenin we nge esooar no ne e rhiuwen mwerhaen pwe epwe aeiineow aekkaew kkepas aeiineo.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Atapeonneogiiur Reer Sinsein Anniug me Pharisees Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mark 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luke 11.43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir pwuwaen aeremas me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>“Sinsein anniug me Pharisees kkewe minne rhooan aweweei Anniug kkewe aaen Moses. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Iwe oawpwe tapweei nge oawfeeori oanongaen meeta ra aengaenigaemi; nge oawsoapw appiuriu aar wegitaeg, pwe rese pomwoni meeta ra aeni fenai. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Re geonitae wooan sagiuriiur aeremas minikka ecchoaw nge e waeiraes pwe repwe aiufera, nge rese mwerhaen mwo nge repwe saeregi egatt aiuttiun paiiur pwe repwe tipaengiir reen aiufar. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Refeeori oanongaen meeta pwe aeremas repwe weriir. Oaw pipiiy minikkena eno wegisin Pwapwior we e Santus wooan ina ra geonitae wooan rhimweer me paiiur, nge e igin tettemoagon! Oaw pipiiy enaeyin minikkena maetetteren weni ngaerhen mengaagiiur! <figure style="fig" file="HK00274B.tif" size="col" ref="23.5"/> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Re aerhaengi neniy kkena egacch noa me noan gupwun me pwan neniy kkena nenieer rhooa taegias me noan wutteer Jews, <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>repwan aerhaengi aar aeremas repwe aewenimmwaar me aesirowuur me noan imwaen chuwaai, me aar aeremas repwe faingiir pwe ‘Sinsei’. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Nge aaemi oawsoapw ffai pwe ‘Sinsei’, pwe erhai rhag aaemi Sinsei, nge oanongaemi nge oaw pwipwi. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Oawsoapw faingi mwo nge erhai me wooan soanopeei pwe ‘Saam’, pwe iga erhai rhag Semaemi eno wooai naaeng. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Oawsoapw pwan ffai pwe aaemi ‘Rhooan a Wen’, pwe iga pwan erhai rhag aaemi rhooan a wen imwu iiy Kristus. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Iyo e egin taegias noa me neeimi nge iiy epwe no pwe naimi rhooan akkiuneo. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Pwe iyo na e aetaegiasa tae epwe sessoanotiw, nge iyo na epwe oasossonaetiw epwe taegias tae.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Songetiir Rhooa Oatupwutupw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mark 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luke 11.39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Oawttiy noa aesemaen Mweoiu Naaeng saengiir aeremas. Nge aaemi oawse toonong noan, oawse pwan fang ngaeniir mwo nge rhooawe re tipaeni repwe toonong. <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>[Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Oaw oapwurhaar rhooapwut kka a mae pwiuniuweer, nge oawwa pwigi saengiir imweer, nge oawwa oangonongon ngaeniir aeremas aaemi maeipin enaei. Reen minneei minne Deus epwe fang ngaenigaemi aegaeregaer na oarosaen cchoaw.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Aaemi oawwa seraeg fetaen nee metaw pwan wooan oanongaen faniuw pwe minni oawpwe wegiti tipaen erhai aeremas ngaeni aaemi namanam; nge aere iga emmwen minneen, aaemi oawwa feeori pwe iiy epwe faer kkaein noa aaen aegaeregaer me mmwaemi me noan nifierno.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi rhooan afan parh! Oaw aepesa pwe, ‘Aere erhai a aekkepan faaen itaen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, miniwe nge esooar ipitan. Nge aere a aekkepan faaen itaen goon we noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, iiy epwene feeori meeta we a aeni ppwon.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Aaemi masepwurh masparh! Ifa minne e igin yor ipitan, goon aere <char style="tl">Temple</char> we efeeori goon we pwe epwe pin? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Aaemi oawpwan aepesa pwe, ‘Aere erhai a aekkepan faaen itaen antar we, miniwe nge esooar ipitan. Nge aere a aekkepan faaen itaen niffang kkewe wooan antar we, iiy epwene feeori meeta we a aeni ppwon.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Masperhaemi! Meeta e igin yor ipitan, niffang we aere antar we efeeori niffang we pwe epwe pin? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Iwe, ngaere erhai a aekkepan faaen itaen antar we, a aekkepan faaen itaen antar we me oanongaen niffang kena eno wooan. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Nge ngaere erhai a aekkepan faaen itaen <char style="tl">Temple</char>, a aekkepan faaen itaen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we nge a pwan aekkepan faaen itaen Deus iwe eno noan. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Nge ngaere erhai a aekkepan faaen itaen naaeng, ina a aekkepan faaen itaen nenien mooat we aaen Deus me pwan faaen itaen Deus iwe emooat wooan.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Oaw ngaenneei Deus eew ginigin me noan seig reen <char style="tl">mint</char> me <char style="tl">dill</char> me <char style="tl">cumin</char>. Iwe nge oaw aerheei noa Anniug kkewe eyor ipitan me reen oasoapwosoapw, taeppen awewe mwamwaai me faayeow me ennet. Ikkeei anniug kka oawpwe pomwoni, nge oawsoapw nigiti noa ikkina aekkaew. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Aaemi rhooan afan parh! Oaw tipwei wow erhai nnoang me noan minimwu iuniumaemi, nge oawwa faer woromi noa erhai <char style="tl">camel</char>!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Oaw toafi gacchiuw niugiun aaemi kkap me saepiy, nge noan a sseog noa reen fitigogo me tipinap. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Masperhaemi, aaemi Pharisees! Oawpwe mmwaen toafi gacchiuw noan kkap we pwe ina nge niugiun epwan nimegacch noa.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Oawweei rhag taeppen pwerheraegin paeyi kka enning niugiun, nge noan a sseog noa reen rhiun aeremas me pwotoron manimae. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Epwan taeppen rhag aaemi: me niugiun oawnning faaen meseer aeremas, nge noan nge a sseog noa reen oatupwutupw me monofit.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Aar Aegaeregaer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luke 11.47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi, aaemi sinsein anniug me Pharisees! Aaemi rhooa oatupwutupw! Oawfeeori paeyieer rhooawe profeta pwe epwe gacch, nge oawwa awweoniuwa faiun paeyieer rhooawe rhooa mwamwaai. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Oawwa aepesa pwe, ‘Aere aemaem aei menaw noan oaton we rhaepetomaem re rhiuwen menaw, aemaem aeisoapw tapweer reen niir noa profeta kkewe.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Iwe oawwa sipegin pwaeritae pwe aaemi teoteeor rhooawe reniir noa profeta kkewe! <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Iwe oawnoa pwan soapwei noa meeta minikkewe aaemi rhaepeto rerhaepiy tae! <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Aaemi sowufaeng me naiiur sowufaeng! Epwe ifa wusun aaemi kkewaeg saengi aaemi aegaeregaer noan nifierno? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Ieei minne ipwe fang wow reemi profeta me soaw tipaecchem me sinsei; aaemi oawpwe niir noa aaemweoi, oaw kurusuur noa aaemweoi, oawpwan wirhiy aaemweoi me noan wutteer Jews nge oaw fattapweer noa me reen eew me eew aepinoamw kkena. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Ieei minne epwe ittiw woami eew aegaeregaer faaen iteer rhooa kkewe mwamwaai iwe oawniir noa, saengi nni menaw noan mwaaen mwamwaai we Abel toori Zechariah iwe naiun Berechiah, mwaaen we oawniiy noa me nepetaen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we me antar we. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi: aegaeregaerin oanongaen nni menaw kkewe nge epwe tooriir aeremesaen mweoi e igina.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Aerhaengerhaeng Jesus Ngaeni Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luke 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Wa niir noa profeta kkewe nge wo teraar rhooan pweipwogin kkepas kkewe Deus efangeto reemw! A faaen fiteig aaei mwerhaen pwe ipwe ioni fengaenniy noawumw aeremas, taeppen maniug a ioni fengaenniy naiun faaen paiun, nge een wose mwerhaen pwe ipwe feeori! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Iwe <char style="tl">Temple</char> we aaemi ina aeremas repwe siusaengi iwe peonoa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Pwe ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe saengi igina oawsoapw rhiuwen weriaei no toori oawpwe iura pwe, ‘Deus epwe aewenepwuwa aeremas na epwe itto faaen itaen Soamwoon.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Toaroponoan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mark 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luke 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Igiwe Jesus a siusaengi <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge ra pwaeri ngaeni iimw kkewe noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ooa, oawwa weri oanongan minikkaan. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi: esooar efai faai kaan ne epwe notiw nenien; oanongan noa nge repwene toaropotiw.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Affayeo me Aewwaeiraes</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mark 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luke 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Igiwe Jesus a mooat wooan miniwe rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>, rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge iir noa rhag. Ra aeiyeg ngaeni pwe, “Aengaenigemaem ineeta minikkeei epwe wen, me meeta aegin epwe pwaeri noa oamw itto me soapwonoan feoniufan?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oaw aefaennigaemi, pwe esoapw yor erhai epwe oatupwugaemi. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Towunepeer aeremas repwe itto faaen itaei nge re aepesa pwe, ‘Ngaang Kristus!’ Iwe, repwe oatupwuur noa pwuwaen aeremas. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Oawpwe rongorong oacchorongon moawun arapeto me kkepesaen moawun taaw noa, nge oawsoapw mesag. Oatokkeei nge minikkeei nge repwe fasiun wen, nge saapw reen a arapeto ne soapwonoan. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Faniuw me faniuw repwe fiiow fengaen, nge mweoi me mweoi repwe pwan moawun fengaen. Epwe yor naengeta me fanemwar oanongaen pwiuneoi. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Oanongaen minikkaan nge eweei pweoneotaen metaegin erhai rhooapwut iga epwe nainai.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Iwe repwe torofigaemi nge refang noa aaemi repwe noa aewwaeiraesigaemi nge ra nigaemi noa. Oanongeer aeremas repwe oapwutaegaemi pwonno faaen itaei. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Reen oatona nge towunepeer repwene fangetae aar niugiuniug; nge re afangmaei erhai nge re kkoapwut fengaen nee fineer. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Iwe towunepeer profeta oatupwutupw repwe itto nge ra oatupwuur noa pwuwaen aeremas. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Pwonno iga a temoag noa feoffeeor aenneew, aerhaengerhaeng we nepetaen aeremas epwene mwittig noa. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Nge iyo e aetemaegin toori nee soapwonoan nge epwe menaw. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Nge Kkepas Mwamwaai we reen Mweoiu Naaeng repwe noa fenaiuw wooan oanongaen faniuw, pwe epwe pwae ngaeniir oanongaen aeremas, iwe mwirin epwapw itto nee soapwonoan.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Min Aemmesagsag</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mark 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luke 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Oawpwe weri eew Min Oarosaen Aemmesagsag, iwe profeta Daniel a kkepas faaen itan. Epwe no noan pwiuneoi we epin.” (Ngaeni rhooan aeraegraeg: metefaaegini minneen!) <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>“Iwe rhooawe reno Judea repwe fattapwetae weei rhug. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Erhai ne eno wooan wungaen iimw, esoapw teeotiw pweipwog pisaegin me nee iimw. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Nge erhai ne eno noan maat, esoapw sefaaen ngaeni imwan pwe epwe pweipwog mengaagiun. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Epwe ifa mwo aar affayeo rhooapwut pwoopwo me ikka re nayigit noan oaton naan! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Oawpwe maeipin ngaeni Deus pwe aaemi siunoa esoapw itto noan oaton patapat aere noan raaenin Sabbath! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Pwe waeiraesin oatonaan ina epwe faer igin kkaein saengi oanongaen waeiraes kka enoa itto reen oatowe supwuton faniuw toorito igina. Nge esoapw rhiuwen yor taeppen epwe rhiuwen itto. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Nge Deus a fasiun oamworhomworha nepaen raaen; ngaere ese feeori, nge esooar ne epwe menaw. Nge pwonno faaen iteer rhooawe a finiir tae, Deus a oamworhomworhanoa nepaen raaen.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Iwe, ngaere erhai e aepesa ngaenigaemi pwe, ‘Pipiiy, ieei iiy Kristus!’ aere ‘Inaan iiy!’ oawsoapw niugiuniug ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Pwe aaemweoi aeremas repwene oatupwutupw pwe iir Kristus, aere erhai profeta, nge repwene feeori min amwaraar me manaman tettemoag, pwe repwe oatupwu rhooawe Deus a finiir tae aere repwe mmwenen feeori. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Oaw rongorong! Ngaang iya fasiun pwaeri ngaenigaemi oanongaen minikkeei mmwaen aar repwe wen.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>“Iwe aere erhai epwe aengaenigaemi pwe, ‘Pipiiy, a no noan <char style="tl">desert</char>!’, oawsoapw noa iginaan. Ngaere re aepesa, ‘Pipiiy, iiy ewop igeei!’, oawsoapw niugiuniug ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe itto taeppen rhag weriwer iga e ffiunoa noan naaeng saengi rhag eotiw toori netow.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>“Ese tiwegin igine epwe yor erhai manimae ee, nge witiyas repwe mweoiuto reen.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Itton Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mark 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luke 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Mwirin rhag moanno noan aewwaeiraesin noan raaenin kkewe, aenet epwene rorhonoa, meram esoapw rhiuwen ttin, nge fiiu repwene ppiungiutiw me noan naaeng, nge minikkiwe maemaewaen noan naaeng repwene mwagiut saengi nenieer. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Iwe nge miniwe aeginnen Naiun Aeremas epwe pwae noa me noan naaeng; nge oanongeer aeremesaen faniuw repwe sessaeng aar repwe giuneei miniwe Naiun Aeremas aan itto wooan toapw noan minna maemaewan me nningen ina e temoag. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Nge epwe fangenoa naiun angkenus reen nngiun ttigin rappwa we, nge repwene ioni fengaenniy rhooawe Deus a finiir saengi faawu pwaeisiisin faeinaengiy, saengi esoapw naaeng toori esoapw.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiun Waniwan e <char style="tl">Fig</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mark 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luke 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Oawpwe kapwiung saengi waniwan e <char style="tl">fig</char>. Oate minikkena raaen ra arawaraw me mechecchoar noa nge a pwiugiuw wow rheon, oawwa giuneei pwe a arapeto neraeg. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Epwan taeppen rhag, igine oawweri minikkeei pwe a wen, oawpwene giuneei pwe oatowe ina a arapeto, oamoannatae pwe epwene rhaep. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe oanongaen minikkeei nge epwe wen weni mmwaen iga aeremesaen igina repwe maenoa. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Naaeng me soanop repwe soapwonoa, nge aaei kkepas esoapw soapwonoa.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esooar ne e Giuneei Raaenin Aere Awa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mark 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luke 17.26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Esooar erhai ne e giuneei raaenin aere awa aan epwe itto, angkenusun naaeng mwo nge resoapw giuneei, aere miniwe Naiun, pwe aaen Saam rhag. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Pwe itton mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe taeppen rhag meeta a wen noan oaton Noah. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Noan raaenin kkewe mmwaen noataer we, aeremas re mwommwongo nge kukkupwun, mwaaen me rhooapwut re pwiuppwiuniuw toori noan raaenin we Noah a teeotae wooan pwoot we. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Rese giuneei minne epwe wen toori aaen noataer we itto niir noa oanongeer. Ina wunuunun minne epwe wen oate Naiun Aeremas epwe war. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Iwe nge riiurhai mwaaen re engaang wooan maat: erhai repwe pwigi noa nge erhai epwe notiw. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Riiurhai rhooapwut repwe ammaat mwongo; erhai repwe pwigi noa nge erhai epwe notiw. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Ieei minne oawpwe aefaennigaemi reen, pwe oawsoapw giuneei noan raaen fa minne aaemi Soamwoon epwe wareto. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Nge oawpwe metaf pwe ngaere soaw iimw we e giuneei ineet rhooa mwoarho we epwe itto, pwe iiy epwe mmas noa rhag, nge esoapw fang ngaeni rhooa mwoarho we aan epwe fereeinong iimw we imwan. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Ieei minne pwan aaemi, oawpwe moannotae, pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe noa itto reen eew oat ina aaemi oawse tapeonneog reen.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Akkiuneo We e Wenewen me Iwe Ese Wenewen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luke 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>“Iwe, iyo rhag rhooan akkiuneo we e wenewen nge e reepiy? Iiy minne maasta we a fang ngaeni pwe epwe nemaeniir rhooan akkiuneo kkewe nge e ngaenneer mwongo noan oaton efin. <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Ifa mwo wenepwuwaen rhooan akkiuneo we, aere maasta we aan e itto giuneei aan feeori minikkeei igiwe ewar. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe maasta we epwe ngaenneei rhooan akkiuneo we pwe epwe nemaeni oanongaen minikkewe pisaegin. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Nge aere rhooan akkiuneo we e aenneew, epwe niuwaennei nong noan tipan, ‘Maasta we aaei epwe mmwaei aan sefaaeneto,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>nge epwene rhaepetae aan wirhiir rhooan akkiuneo kkewe rhinan, nge e mwongo me gupwun fengaen me aaemweoi man pwunaas. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Mwirin maasta we epwe sefaaeneto noan raaenin we rhooan akkiuneo we ese niuwaennei, me eew oaton esoapw giuneei. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Iwe maasta we epwene fena kititiw nge efang noa neeiir rhooawe rhooa oatupwutupw. Igiwe epwe sessaeng me akkaarengi me ee.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Fioangoor Seig Rhooapwut Anian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Reen oaton naan nge minna Mweoiu Naaeng epwe aeffitaeg ngaeni minneen. Eno seig rhooapwut anian re pwigi aar oappwun nge ra noa soawuni erhai <char style="tl">bridegroom</char>. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Nimman me neeiir re tipoarorh, nge nimman re tipaecchem. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Rhooawe re tipoarorh ra pwigi aar oappwun, nge rese pwigi oatoawun rhaniun oappwun kkewe aar, <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>nge ikkiwe re tipaecchem ra pwigi aar oappwun fengaen me neon rhaniun oappwun kkewe aar. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Iwe igiwe <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> e mmwaei aan itto, iwe ra cchoaw iwe ra maiur noa.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>“Igiwe a nugaenipwoong noa nge a yor eew aekkepwas, ‘Ieen iiy <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we! Oaw itto oawpwe rhuungi!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Iwe rhooapwut kkewe seig ra mmasetae nge ra oamoannatae oappwun kkewe aar. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Iwe, rhooawe re tipoarorh ra aengaeni rhooawe re tipaecchem pwe, ‘Oawfang ngaenigemaem egius rhaniun oappwun, pwe oappwun kka aemaem nge repwene gunnoa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Nge rhooawe re tipaecchem ra paniuwaeniir pwe, ‘Ese mmwen, pwe iye esoapw nnaaf aaemi me pwan aemaem. Oawnoa sitowa oawpwe noa chuwaai aaemi rhaniun oappwun.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Iwe rhooawe re tipoarorh ra noa pwe repwe noa chuwaai aar rhaniun oappwun. Nge igiwe ra noa, iwe nge <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we a war. Iwe, rhooawe nimman rhooapwut re moannotae ra tapweei nong noan imwaen gupwun we, iwe mwirin iwe a titti noa asam we.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Mwirin nge rhooapwut kkewe aaemweoi ra pwan war. Iwe, ra iyaekkepwas, ‘Soamwoon, soamwoon, sugi ngaenigemaem asam.’<verse eid="MAT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>“Iwe nge <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we a paniuwaeniir pwe, ‘Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, ise giunegaemi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Iwe Jesus a soapwei noa nge a iura pwe, “Oawpwe atapeonneogiugaemi, pwe oawse giuneei raaenin me awaan.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangoor Eoniurhai Rhooan Engaang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luke 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Noan oaton naan nge Mweoiu Naaeng epwe aeffitaeg ngaeni minneen. Eno erhai mwaaen epwene noa waeii; a faingiir rhooan engaang kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe repwe nemaeni oanongaen minikkewe pwugusan. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>A ngaenneei erhai me erhai iugiugiun minne epwe mmwen ngaeni: a ngaenneei erhai nimingeras faiun senaapiy, nge a ngaenneei pwan iwe erhai riiungeras, nge iwe erhai eew sengeras. Iwe a noa waeii noa. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Iwe rhag nge rhooan engaang we e pwigi nimingeras faiun senaapiy a mwetekkaein noa aengaenga iwe reen, iwe a pwan pwigi sefaaeniy pwan nimingeras menewan. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Epwan ina rhag wunuunun iwe e pwigi riiungeras pwe a pwan pwigi sefaaeniy pwan riiungeras menewan. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Nge rhooan engaang we e pwigi sengeras faiun senaapiy, a noa genengi eew niipw nge a nipwaeni noa faiun senaapiy we naiun maasta we aan noan.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“A ssiunaei noa mwirin nge maasta we a sefaaen to nge a aeiyegiir senaapiy kkewe naiun. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Iwe rhooan engaang we e pwigi nimingeras faiun senaapiy a itto nge a iseni tiw pwan nimingeras. A aepesa pwe, ‘Maasta, een wo ngaenneaei nimingeras faiun senaapiy. Pipiiy, a pwan yo ngaeniaei nimingeras faiun senaapiy pwe menewan.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Maasta we a aengaeni pwe, ‘Egacch, een erhai rhooan engaang mwamwaai me wenewen. Een wo menaw wenewen reen oamw nemaeni minikka e mwittig, ina minne ipwe faer ngaenneog minikka e tettemoag pwe wopwe nemaeni. Itto tapweaei reen apwapwa e aaei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Iwe rhooan engaang we e pwigi riiungeras faiun senaapiy a toonong nge aepesa pwe, ‘Maasta, een wa ngaenneaei riiungeras faiun senaapiy. Pipiiy, a pwan yo riiungeras faiun senaapiy pwe menewan.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Maasta we a aengaeni, ‘Egacch, een erhai rhooan engaang mwamwaai me wenewen. Een wo menaw wenewen reen oamw nemaeni minikka e mwittig, ina minne ipwe faer ngaenneog minikka e tettemoag pwe wopwe nemaeni. Itto tapweaei reen apwapwa e aaei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Iwe rhooan engaang we e pwigi sengeras faiun senaapiy a toonong nge aepesa pwe, ‘Maasta, i giuneei pwe een erhai mwaaen sosoong. Wo giniiy uwaen foat inamwo iga wose foat, wa ioni fengaenniy uwaen irae inamwo wose oamworomwor faiun. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Iya mesag, ina minne iya noa nipwaeni noa senaapiy we noawumw faaen ppweon reen. Pipiiy, ieen senaapiy we noawumw.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Iwe maasta we a paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Een erhai rhooan engaang aenneew me gagu! Wo giuneei pwe ngaang iya giniiy ikka ise foat, iya pwan ioni fengaenniy uwaan ikka ise oamworomwor faiun ee? <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Iwe, meeta wose faer iseni nong senaapiy mwu naeyi noan <char style="tl">bank</char> reen? Ina nge ipwe pwigi sefaaeniy fengaen me menewan igine iya sefaaen to. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Igina, oaw pwigi saengi senaapiy kkomwu reen nge oawwa ngaenneei imwu eyor seig sengeras faiun senaapiy reen. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Pwe iyo a yor meeta aan nge repwe pwan fang ngaeni, iwe epwene igin ssow noa aan; nge iyo ese yor meeta aan nge repwe pwigi saengi mwo nge iwe egius iwe eyor reen. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Nge reen rhooan engaang e esooar ipitan, oaw oatorawow niugiun noan rorhappiung, iga epwe sessaeng nge akkaarengi me ee.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amwiucchiun Apwiung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Ngaere igine mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwene war noan nningen pwe <char style="tl">king</char> nge oanongeer angkenus repwe tapweei, nge epwe mooat wooan minna nenien <char style="tl">king</char>, <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>iwe, nge oanongeer aeremesaen faeinaengiy nge repwe rhu fengaen me weni mmwan. Nge epwe aeyimweoiuw fesaenngiir noan ruwowu mwiirh, taeppen rhag erhai rhooan neginegin maan e aeyimweoiuw fesaenngiir <char style="tl">sheep</char> saengiir <char style="tl">goat</char>. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Epwe iseniir nong <char style="tl">sheep</char> peig mwaaenen, nge <char style="tl">goat</char> peig rhooapwuton. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Nge <char style="tl">king</char> we epwene aengaeniir rhooawe reno peig mwaaenen, ‘Oaw itto, aaemi rhooa wenepwu me reen Semaei! Oawpwe mweoiuni mweoi e oamoannatae faaen itaemi saengi rhaepetaen feoniufan. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Pwe ngaang iya pecchai nge aaemi oawwa oamwongowaei, iya moar nge aaemi oawwa aiuniuwaei, iya waseona nge aaemi oawwa aetiwaeyaei noan imwaemi. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Ise memmengaag nge aaemi oawwa fang mengaagiuy, iya semwaai nge aaemi oawwa aefaenniaei, iya no noan kanepwus nge aaemi oawwa itto rhuungiaei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Iwe rhooawe rhooa wenewen repwene paniuwaeni, ‘Soamwoon, ineet aeiya giuneei pwe wa pecchai nge aeiya oamwongog, ineet wa moar, nge aeiya aiuniug? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Ineet aeiya giuneei pwe wa waseona, nge aeiya aetiwoag nong noan imwaemmaem, aere ineet aeiya giuneei pwe esooar mengaagiumw, nge aeiya fang mengaagiumw? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Ineet aeiya giuneei pwe wo semwaai aere no noan kanepwus, nge aeiya itto rhuungiug?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Iwe, <char style="tl">king</char> we epwene paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, ese tiwegin minne oawwa feeori ngaeni erhai neeiir rhooakka rewen pwiiy ikka re igin sessoan, nge oawpwan feeori ngaeniaei.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Iwe epwan aengaeniir rhooawe reno peig rhooapwuton, ‘Oawpwe siu saengiaei, aaemi rhooawe Deus epwene fang aaemi aegaeregaer, oawpwe noa noan aengaet we esooar iaenin a faer oamoannatae faaen iteer Saetan me naiun angkenus! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Pwe iya pecchai, nge aaemi oawse oamwongowaei; iya moar, nge aaemi oawse ainiuwaei. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Iya waseona, nge aaemi oawse aetiwaeyaei noan imwaemi; ise memmengaag, nge aaemi oawse fang mengaagiuy; iya semwaai me no noan kanepwus, nge aaemi oawse aefaenniaei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Iwe repwene paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Soamwoon, ineet aemaem aeiya giuneei pwe wa pecchai aere moar, aere waseona, aere wose memmengaag, aere semwaai, aere no noan kanepwus, nge aeise aefaenniug?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Nge <char style="tl">king</char> we epwene paniuwaeniir pwe, ‘Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi: ese tiwegin minne oawse feeori ngaeni erhai neeiir rhooakka re rewen pwiiy ikka re igin sessoan, oawse pwan feeori ngaeniaei.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Iwe, rhooakkeei repwe noa ngaeni aegaeregaer we esooar iaenin, nge rhooawe rhooa wenewen repwe noa ngaeni menaw na esooar ssiaaenin.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Aar Rhiu Aenneewa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mark 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luke 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">John 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Oatowe Jesus a moann aan fenaiuw oanongaen minikkeei, a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Aaemi oaw giuneei pwe a faei riiuraaen nge epwene gona miniwe gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char>, nge miniwe Naiun Aeremas epwene toonong nee paiiur aeremas pwe repwene noa kurusuw noa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Iwe soamwooniir patere me mwaaen kkewe aar ra mwiirh fengaen noan imwaen Soamwoonin Patere we itan Caiaphas, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>nge ra pwiungiuw wunuunun aar repwe torofi Jesus noan mwoanomwoan pwe repwe noa niiy noa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Nge ra aepesa pwe, “Sisoapw feeori minneei oaton gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char>, pwe aeremas rete aefitigogo tae.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooapwut We e Aepiti Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mark 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">John 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Jesus a noa Bethany noan imwaen Simon, erhai mwaaen kaenepaai mwo igiwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Nge oaton we Jesus a mwongo, erhai rhooapwut a itto reen faaen eew neo effeeor saengi <char style="tl">alabaster</char> nge e oawut ngaeni neoningas e igin cchoaw paniuwan, a itto aeniatiw neo we wooan rhimwen Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra giuneei miniwe, nge ra soong. Ra aepesa pwe, “Meeta mwo oasonopaen neoningas eei? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Pwe neoningas een emmwen erhai epwe chuwaiuw ngaeni senaapiy temoag nge ra ngaenneer man affayeo!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Jesus e giuneei meeta kkewe ra aepesa, iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oaw amwagiutiu nieen reen? Egin mwamwaai minne a feeori ngaeniaei. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Pwe rhooa affayeo repwe fasiun yor reemi oanongaen oat, nge ngaang isoapw no rhag reemi oanongaen oat. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Minne efeeori iga e aeniatae neoningas wooan oanongaei, nge a faer oamoannayaei tae ngaeniaei nipwaenipw. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe ese tiwegin iga repwe fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai een me ee, nge minne nieei a feeori nge aeremas repwene fioangei pwe aemaengimaengin faaen itan.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas a Tipaeni Epwe Fangenoa Tinnimaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mark 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luke 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Iwe erhai me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai, iwe itan Judas Iscariot, a noa reen soamwoonin patere kkewe <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>nge a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta oawpwe ngaenneaei aere ipwe fangenoa tinnimaen Jesus?” Ra paengiwow eniig faiun senaapiy <char style="tl">silver</char> nge ra ngaenneei. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Saengi rhag oatowe nge Judas a giutta eew oaton ne egacch aan epwe fang ngaeniir Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Rhooawe Naiun ra Aeni Fengaenniy Eew Mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mark 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luke 22.7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">John 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Noan aeyewaen raaenin Gupwunon Fenoawa we esooar <char style="tl">Yeast</char> reen, rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra itto reen Jesus nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Iya iga wo mwerhaen pwe aeipwe oamoannatae mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me ee?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa noan aepinoamw na reen erhai mwaaen nge oawwa aengaeni, ‘Sinsei e iura pwe, A arapeto oatoi nge rhooan kkayeo kena naeyi me ngaang pwe feeori mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me noan imwoamw.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra feeori wunuunun meeta we Jesus a aengaeniir, nge ra oamoannatae mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> we.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Igiwe a nee oatofaaef noa, Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai ra mooat tiw reen <char style="tl">table</char> we. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Iga ra mwongo, nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe erhai me neeimi epwene fangenoa tinnimaei.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe a igin aenneew noa nee tipeer reen kkepas we nge ra rhaepetae ne kkepas aeiyeg ngaeni, erhai me erhai ra aepesa pwe, “Soamwoon, saapw ngaang?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Erhai ne e tapweaei reen rhirinong anan fenoawa noan saepiy een, ina iiy epwe fangenoa tinnimaei. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Minna Naiun Aeremas epwe maenoa taeppen rhag meeta we Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa, nge epwe ifa mwo aenneewaen mwaaen na iiy e afangmaei noa mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas! Egacch rhag igine rese nainitiw mwaaen een!”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Judas iwe e afangmaei noa Jesus a kepastae, “Sinsei, saapw ngaang?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een minimwu wo aepesa minna.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Soamwoon Mwongoon Faaef</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mark 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luke 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Igiwe ra mwongo, Jesus a pwigi eew fenoawa, a fang aan maeipinen aerhigerhig, iwe a giniiy nge a ngaenneer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aepesa pwe, “Oaw pwigi pwe oawpwe angi, pwe ieen minne oanongaei.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Mwirin a pwigi eew kkap, a fang aan maeipinen aerhigerhig, iwe, a ngaenneer nge a aepesa pwe, “Oaw iuniumi minneen oanongaemi, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>pwe ieen minne cchaei iye epwene no pwe tiweginin ppwon we aaen Deus ngaenigaemi, nge minne cchaei epwene nipiwow pwe arhiuwerhiuwen aar monofit aeremas. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe isoapw rhiuwen iuniumi <char style="tl">wine</char> een toori raaenin na ipwe iuniumi <char style="tl">wine</char> na effeo me noan minna Mweoiun Semaei.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Mwirin ra aeni erheo keoniun aerhigerhig, nge ra toowow ngaeni miniwe rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Aaen Peter Iura pwe Ese Giuneei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mark 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luke 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">John 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Nee pwongiy nge oanongaemi oawpwe nigitiaei noa, pwe iwe Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Deus epwe niiy noa rhooan neginegin <char style="tl">sheep</char> we, nge <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe repwene toaropas fetaen.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Nge mwirin aaei menaw sefaaen, ipwe gommwonoa Galilee me mmwaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Iwe, Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ngaang isoapw nigitiug noa, inamwo me oanongeer nge re nigitiug noa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Jesus a aengaeni Peter pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaeniug pwe mmwaen aaen maniug we epwe keokkeok nee pwongiy, nge epwe faaen enuuw oamw iura pwe wose giuneaei.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Esooar faaen eew ipwe aepesa minna, inamwo aere ipwe tapweog reen maenoa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">A pwan ina rhag meeta re iura rhooan kkayeo kkewe aekkaerhai.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Maeipin Noan Gethsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mark 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luke 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Iwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra noa noan eew neniy itan Gethsemane, iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawmooat tiw igeei, pwe ngaang ipwe noa maeipin iginaan.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>A paeninoa Peter me mwaaen riiurhai kkewe naiun Zebedee. Waeiraes me nee tip cchoaw a tooto reen, <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Waeiraesin noan minne nee tipaei egin temoag, arapakkaan rhag epwe niaei noa. Oawno igeei oawpwe tapweaei reen metenaeg.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Jesus a mwet noa egius mmwan, a won rhappetiw nee ppweon nge maeipin, “Semaei, aere emmwen, wopwe pwigi saengiaei kkepaen waeiraes een; nge saapw minne ngaang i tipaeni, pwe minne een wo tipaeni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Iwe a sefaaeneto reer rhooan kkayeo kkewe eoniurhai we naiun, nge a giuneer pwe ra maiur. Iwe a aengaeni Peter pwe, “Ifa wusun, aaemi mwo nge ese mmwen oawpwe mmas ngaeniaei noan eew rhag awa? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Oaw mmas nge oaw maeipin pwe oawte ppiungiunong noan sessoat. Ngeon a mwerhaen, nge oanong a apwangapwang.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Jesus a pwan sefaaen noa maeipin, “Semaei, aere wosoapw pwigi saengiaei kkepaen waeiraes een pwe ipwe iuniumi, nge minna tipoamw minne epwe mmwen.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Jesus epwan sefaaen nge a giuneer pwe ra pwan maiur, pwe ra igin cchoaw.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Iwe, Jesus a pwan mwet saengiir, a sefaaen noa maeipin reen aeinuwaen, nge epwan aeni rhag maeipin we e aeni me mmwan. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Iwe a sefaaeneto reer rhooan kkayeo kkewe nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw rhiuwen maiur me aseoseo rhag? Pipiiy, a toori oaton repwene fangenoa Naiun Aeremas nee paiiur rhooa monofit. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Oaw rhimwitae, oaw sia noa. Pipiiy, ieei iiy mwaaen we e fangenoa menewaei!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar Torofi Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mark 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luke 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">John 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Oatowe Jesus e rhiuwen kekkepas, Judas iwe erhai me neeiir rhooawe seig me riiurhai a war. Pwuwaen aeremas kkewe re tapweei faaen naiiur saeitan me soapwon irae, nge re itto faaen iteer soamwoonin patere me mwaaen kkewe aar. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Rhooan afangmaei noa we a fang aeginn ngaeniir pwuwa we: “Mwaaen na ipwe faeisongei ina mwaaen na oaw tipaeni. Oaw torofi!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Judas a faaeraeg wenewen ngaeni Jesus nge a aengaeni pwe, “Sirow woamw, Sinsei,” iwe a faeisongei.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Pwiiy, feeori meeta wo itto reen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Iwe ra mwet ngaeni, ra torofi Jesus nge ra ammwarhiu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Nge erhai me neeiir rhooawe rhoaniuwaen Jesus a waeitiwow naiun saeitan, nge a fena rhooan akkiuneo we naiun Soamwoonin Patere iwe gopiy noa eew saeningan. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Iwe, Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Wopwe aesefaaeninong saeitan mwu noawumw noan nenien. Pwe rhooakkena re pweipwog saeitan repwe maenoa wooan saeitan. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Oawse giuneei, pwe ngaang ina emmwen ipwe tingoar ngaeni Semaei pwe epwe tipaengiaei, pwe epwe mwetekkaein fang ngaeniaei seig me ruwowu mwirhaen sonotawaen angkenus? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Nge ngaere epwe wen minneei, epwe ifa wusun nge epwe nnet miniwe e foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus, iwe e iura pwe ieei meeta epwe fasiun wen?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir aeremas towunap kkewe pwe, “Meeta oawnoa itto faaen naimi saeitan me soapwon irae pwe oawpwe torofiaei, pwe iga aetae ngaang erhai man mwoarho? Raaen me raaen nge ngaang imooat reemi nge i fenai noan <char style="tl">Temple</char>, nge aaemi oawse torofiaei. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Nge ina oanongaen minikkeei nge epwe wen pwe epwe nnet ngaeni minikkiwe profeta ra foatogitiw noan Pwapwior we e Santus.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Iwe oanongeer rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra siusaengi Jesus nge ra fattapw noa.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Weni Mmweer Soaw Kapwiung Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mark 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luke 22.54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">John 18.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Rhooawe re torofi Jesus ra paeninoa reen Soamwoonin Patere itan Caiaphas, iwe me sinsein anniug kkewe me mwaaen kkewe aar ra mwiirh fengaen ee. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Nge Peter e tettapw to mwirin Jesus me itaaw toorito niugiun imwaen Soamwoonin Patere we. A toonong noan wororaen iimw we nge a mooat tiw reer rhooan poos kkewe pwe epwe giuneei meeta epwe wen. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Rhooawe soamwooniir patere me oanongeer rhooan <char style="tl">council</char> we ra giutta eew min oatupwutupw ne repwe tipi ngaeni Jesus pwe repwe niiy noa, <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>nge esooar meeta ne reweri, inamwo igiwe re towunap aeremas kka ra itto iutae nge re pwaeritae aar oatupwutupw reen. Mwirin riiurhai mwaaen ra iutae <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>nge ra aepesa pwe, “Mwaaen een aepesa pwe, ‘Ngaang immwenen fereeitiw aaen Deus <char style="tl">Temple</char>, nge noan enuuw raaen ipwe aiusefaaeniy tae.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Soamwoonin Patere a iutae nge a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Esooar minne wopwe paniuwaeni ngaeni kkepas kka mwaaen kaan ra tipi ngaeniug?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Nge Jesus a anniug noa rhag. Iwe Soamwoonin Patere a pwan aepesa ngaeni Jesus pwe, “Wopwe ppwon faaen itaen Deus na e menaw nge wa aengaenigemaem aere een Kristus, Naiun Deus.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een minne wo iura. Nge ipwe aengaenigaemi: saengi igina oawpwene giuneei Naiun Aeremas epwe mooat peig mwaaenen iwe e oarosaen Mamaaw, nge epwe ittiw me weei naaeng wooan toapw.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Iwe Soamwoonin Patere we a fereeitiw mengaagiun nge a iura pwe, “A aepesa aenneewa Deus! Meeta si rhiuwen pwigiir to rhooan oatuttur reen? Pipiiy, oawwa sipegin rongorong aan aepesa aenneewa Deus. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Meeta aaemi niunniuwaen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Iiy e monofit nge epwe mae.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Mwirin ra oattuffa mesan nge re wirhiy, nge ikkiwe re peosepa <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>ra aepesa pwe, “Aengaenigemaem, Kristus! Iyo we e wirhiug!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter a Aepesa pwe Ese Giuneei Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mark 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luke 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">John 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Igiwe Peter emooat noan wororaen iimw we imwaen Soamwoonin Patere, iwe erhai rhooapwut naiun rhooan engaang a itto reen nge a aengaeni pwe, “Een pwan erhai rhoaniuwaen Jesus saengi Galilee.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Peter a paniuwaeni memmweer oanongeer, nge a iura pwe, “Ngaang ise giuneei meeta mwu wo aepesa,” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>iwe a faaeraeg wow me noan asam we. Iwe erhai rhooapwut rhooan engaengaen igiwe a giuneei Peter nge a aengaeniir mwaaen kkewe igiwe pwe, “Mwaaen een eno reen Jesus re Nazareth we.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Iwe, Peter a pwan iura pwe ese giuneei nge a aepesa pwe, “Iya aekkepan pwe ise giuneei mwaaen naan!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Faeiyegius noa mwirin nge rhooawe re iu igiwe ra itto reen Peter nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Ennet, een pwan erhai rhoaniuwaen mwaaen naan, pwe aei giuneei rhag me reen ngingin oamw kkepas.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Iwe Peter a iura pwe, “Iya aekkepan pwe ngaang i aepesa minne ennet! Deus epwe apwiungiuwaei aere i oatupwutupw! Ngaang ise giuneei mwaaen naan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Iwe rhag nge e keokkeok noa maniug we, <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>iwe Peter a maengiy miniwe Jesus e aengaeni: “Weni mmwaen epwe keokkeok maniug, een wopwe aepesa faaen enuuw pwe wose giuneaei.” Iwe a toowow niugiun nge a igin noa saeng.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Paeninoa Jesus Reen Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mark 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luke 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">John 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Enoa nee oatosor moawugowug, oanongeer soamwoonin patere kkewe me mwaaen kkewe aar ra pwiungiuw wunuunun aar repwe niiy noa Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Ra geoni noa nge ra paeninoa reen Pilate, iwe iiy minne <char style="tl">governor</char>.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maenoan Judas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Feof 1.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Igiwe Judas, iwe efang noa menewaen Jesus, a giuneei pwe ra aettiweginiy pwe Jesus epwene mae, a ssiuwen aan niunniuwaen iwe a aesefaaeni ngaeniir soamwoonin patere me mwaaen kkewe aar faiun senaapiy we eniig. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Nge a aepesa pwe, “Ngaang iya monofit reen aaei fangenoa menewaen erhai mwaaen se monofit.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Iwe, ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Meeta faan ngaenigemaem? Feeori pwe oamw engaang.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Judas a oatoranong senaapiy kkewe noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we nge a noa, iwe a noa nnoma noa iiuwan.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Soamwoonin patere kkewe ra pwigi faiun senaapiy kkewe nge ra aepesa pwe, “Senaapiaen meoniun ccha minneen, nge e aenneew ngaeni aarh anniug pwe sipwe oarhuw nong noan senaapiaen <char style="tl">Temple</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Ra tipieew fengaen wooan senaapiy we, iwe ra meoni eew faniuw itan <char style="tl">Potter’s Field</char>, pwe eew nenien paeyieer waseona. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Ina minne ra aeita ngaeni pwe “Faniuwaen Ccha” toorito igina.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Iwe a pwae noa pwe ennet meeta we profeta Jeremiah e aepesa: “Ra pwigi eniig senaapiy <char style="tl">silver</char>, nepaen miniwe re Israel ra tipieew wooan pwe repwe pey aegini ngaeni mwaaen we, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>nge ra naini senaapiy een ne meoni ngaeni <char style="tl">Potter’s Field</char>, taeppen miniwe Soamwoon e anniugiu ngaeniaei.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilate e Kkepas Aeiyeg Ngaeni Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mark 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luke 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">John 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Iwe Jesus a iu me mmwaen <char style="tl">governor</char> we nge a aeiyegiy Jesus pwe, “Een minne aar <char style="tl">king</char> re Jews?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een minimwu wo aepesa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Iwe esa paniuwaeni no meeta kkewe soamwoonin patere me mwaaen kkewe aar ra aepesa pwe teren.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Iwe Pilate a aengaeni pwe, “Wose rongorong towunepaen kkepesaen oatuttur kkomwu ra oaturug rhag reen?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Nge Jesus ese paniuwaeni mwo nge eew, iwe <char style="tl">governor</char> we a igin mwaar noa reen.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Aettiweginiy Aaen Jesus Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mark 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luke 23.13-25</ref>; John 18.39 — 19.16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Reen oanongaen oaton gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char>, nge <char style="tl">governor</char> egaen saeneti noa erhai rhooan kanepwus ina aeremas towunap re tingoar. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Nge noan oaton naan nge eno erhai rhooan kanepwus itan nge Barabbas, nge oanongeer aeremas nge re giuneei. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Iwe igiwe rhooa towunap kkewe ra maegin rhu fengaen, nge Pilate a aeiineeor pwe, “Iyo e oaw tipaeni pwe ipwe saeneti ngaenigaemi, Barabbas aere Jesus we re faingi pwe Kristus?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>E fasiun giuneei pwe ra fang nong Jesus nee paiun faaen itaen aar noanowo ngaeni.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Iwe igiwe Pilate e rhiuwen mooat wooan nenien mooaton apwiung we aan, nge niewe pwiuniuwan a fangenoa reen eew kkepas: “Esooar meeta wopwe feeori ngaeni mwaaen mwamwaai na, pwe noan aaei ttan nee pwoong we nge iya igin waeiraes noa faaen itan.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Iwe soamwooniir patere kkewe me mwaaen kkewe aar ra igin aetemaeginiy ngaeniir aeremas pwe repwe tingoareei Pilate pwe epwe saeneti noa Barabbas, nge a niiy noa Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Nge <char style="tl">governor</char> we a aeiineeor aeremas pwe, “Iyo neeiir rhooa riiurhai een oaw tipaeni pwe ipwe saeneti ngaenigaemi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Barabbas!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilate a aeiineeor pwe, “Nge meeta ipwe feeori ngaeni Jesus, iwe itaen Kristus?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Oanongeer noa ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Kurusuw noa!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Nge Pilate a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta taeppen wegitaeg aenneew e a feeori?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Nge iir ra pwan oatomoga aar iyaekkepwas pwe, “Kurusuw noa!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Igiwe Pilate a giuneei pwe esooar ipitan aan epwe kkepas ngaeniir, pwe ina nge epwene rhaepetae eew fitigogo, a pwigi rhaan nge a toafi paiun memmweer aeremas kkewe nge a aepesa pwe, “Esooar monofitiy reen cchaaen mwaaen een aan mae. Pwe faer aaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Aeremas towunap kkewe ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Cchaan epwe itto woamaem me wooar naimaem!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Iwe Pilate a saeneti Barabbas ngaeniir, nge ra wirhiy Jesus nge a fangenoa pwe repwene noa kurusuw noa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sonotaw ra Aeni Aegekkaei Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mark 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">John 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Iwe sonotaw kkewe naiun Pilate ra paeni nong Jesus noan imwaen <char style="tl">governor</char>, nge ra faingiir oanongeer sonotaw kkewe nge ra itto roangei noa oaron. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Ra pwiniti saengi mengaagiun nge ra aememmengaagiu ngaeni erheo mengaag ccha. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Iwe ra fiti eew mwaer saengi irae towfanfan nge ra ngaettae wooan rhimwen, nge ra pwan iseni nong efoarh soapwon irae noan pai mwaaenen; nge ra foatotiw me mmwan nge ra aeni fetaeneei aegekkaei. Ra gaen aepesa pwe, “Sirow woamw, <char style="tl">Kingaen</char> Jews.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Ra oattuffa, ra pwigi irae we saengi nge ra wirhiy ngaeni rhimwen. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Nge igiwe ra moann me aeni aegekkaei, ra pwiniti saengi mengaag ccha we nge ra aememmengaagiu sefaaeniy ngaeni ikkiwe sipegin mengaagiun. Iwe ra paeninoa pwe repwene noa kurusuw noa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Kurusuw Noa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mark 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luke 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">John 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Igiwe ra nennoa, nge ra rhuungi erhai mwaaen itan Simon saengi Cyrene; nge sonotaw kkewe ra aengimaw ngaeni pwe epwe aiufera kurus we aaen Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Nge ra tooto reen eew pwiuneoi itan Golgotha, wewen nge “Nenien Peopeoi Rhimw”. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Igaan iga ra itto aiuniu ngaeni Jesus <char style="tl">wine</char> min nofit me meras. Nge mwirin aan nnaeri, nge ese mwerhaen iuniumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Mwirin aar kurusuw noa Jesus, nge ra itto aekkaerh <char style="tl">dice</char> pwe repwe inetiy minikkewe mengaagiun wooar. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Iwe ra mooat tiw igiwe nge ra pipiiy. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Wooan tae rhimwen ra aepperhatae aaemweoi foatofoat e pwaeritae meeta we ra tipi ngaeni, e iura pwe: “Ieei Jesus, <char style="tl">Kingaen</char> Jews.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Iwe ra pwan kurusuur noa riiurhai rhooa mwoarho oaron Jesus, erhai me peig rhooapwuton, nge erhai me peig mwaaenen.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00328B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="27.32-44"/><verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Aeremas kkewe re faaeraeg noa me oaron Jesus ra gaen aepesa aenneewa, nge re iurhiugi rhimweer <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>nge re aepesa pwe, “Een miniwe wo iura pwe wopwe fereeitiw <char style="tl">Temple</char> we nge wa aiusefaaeniy tae noan enuuw raaen! Aemenewoag aere een Naiun Deus, nge wa teeotiw me wooan kurus na!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Epwan ina rhag wunuunun soamwoonin patere kkewe me sinsein anniug me mwaaen kkewe aar re aeni aegekkaei Jesus nge re iura pwe, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“A aemenewaar aaemweoi, nge ese mmwenen aemenewa oanongan! Saapw i miniwe <char style="tl">king</char>aaen Israel? Aere epwe teeotiw saengi kurus naan igina, ina nge sipwe niugiuniug ngaeni. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>E niugiuniug ngaeni Deus, nge e aepesa pwe iiy Naiun Deus. Iwe, sipwe pipiiy aere Deus epwe mwerhaen aemenewa igina!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Pwan rhooa mwoarho kkewe mwo re tapweei reen kurus nge repwan aessaewa reen aar kkepas ngaeni.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maenoan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mark 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luke 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">John 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Saengi nugunupaen oanowas a noa, a rorhappiung noa wooan oanongaen faniuw we noan enuuw konook. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Enoa enuuw konook nge Jesus a aekkepwas temoag tae pwe, <char style="tl">“Eli, Eli, lama sabachthani?”</char> wewen, “Aaei Deus, aaei Deus, meeta wa nigitiaei noa reen?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Aaemweoi aeremas kkewe re iu igiwe ra rongorong miniwe nge ra iura pwe, “A faingi Elijah!” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Erhai me neeiir a mwetekkaein fattapweto reen, a pwigi eew faerewa nge a rhirinong noan eew <char style="tl">wine</char> emwaenn, a iseni tae nee soapwon efoarh irae nge a aiuniu ngaeni Jesus.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Nge aaemweoi re iura pwe, “Weti sipwe pipiiy aere Elijah epwe itto aemenewa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Nge Jesus a pwan aekkepwas temoag tae faaen eew, iwe a fangetae ngeoniun.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Iwe nge mengaag we e tteoraeg noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we mwo nge a taeringatiw faaen ruwowu, saengi wooan ittiw faan. A fanemwar faniuw, nge faai ra tiningaeg fesaeng, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>nge paeyi ra sugaeg, nge towunap rhooa maenoa kkewe naiun Deus ra menaw sefaaen. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Ra siusaengi paeyieer nge mwirin aaen Jesus menaw sefaaen nge ra noa noan aepinoamw we e santus, igiwe pwuwaen aeremas ra noa giuneer me ee.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Igiwe soamwoonin sonotaw we me sonotaw kkewe re pippipiiy Jesus ra giuneei fanemwar me oanongaen minikkiwe a wen, ra igin riutae iwe nge ra aepesa pwe, “Ennetaen pwe iiy Naiun Deus!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Epwan ssow rhooapwut ikkiwe re oawruruto me itaaw noa, ikkiwe re tapweeito mwirin Jesus saengi Galilee pwe repwe tipaengi. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Me neeiir rhooapwut kaan nge reno Maria Magdalene me Maria we ineer James me Joseph, me miniwe ineer mwaaen kkewe naiun Zebedee.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paeyinoan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mark 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luke 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">John 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Igiwe a nee oatofaaef noa, erhai mwaaen naiwiis saengi Arimathea a itto; itan nge Joseph, nge mwaaeneei nge pwan erhai rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun Jesus. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>A noa reen Pilate nge a noa tingoar miniwe oanongaen Jesus. Iwe, Pilate a aepesa pwe repwe ngaenneei oanong we. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Iwe Joseph a pwigi miniwe oanongan, a tiugiumi ngaeni eew mengaag pwerh ffeo, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>nge a iseni nong noan paeyi ffeo we aan, iwe ekken me neeiin faai. Iwe a oasoagopeniy to efai faai gin temoag reen aesemaen paeyi we, iwe a noa. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Maria Magdalene me pwan Maria we erhai ra mooat saep ngaeni paeyi we.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Poosun Paeyi we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Mmasetae noan raaenin we Sabbath, nge soamwoonin patere kkewe me Pharisees kkewe ra itto rhuungi Pilate <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>nge ra iura pwe, “Menap, aemaem aei maengiy rhag miniwe maan oatupwutupw naan igiwe e rhiuwen menaw e aepesa pwe, ‘Ipwe menaw sefaaen mwirin enuuw raaen.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Fang mwaenioamw pwe sonotaw repwe posuw gacchiuw paeyi naan toori miniwe aeinuwaen raaen, pwe minni rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun resoapw mmwenen noa reen paeyi naan nge renoa mwoarhow noa minna oanongan, nge ra noa aengaeniir aeremas pwe a menaw sefaaen saengi maenoa. Kkepas oatupwutupw een nge e igin oarosan aenneew saengi iwe mmwan.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilate a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw pwigiir sonotaw repwe noa posuw gacchiuw paeyi naan.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Iwe ra noa nge ra noa ammwarhiu gacchiuw noa fai we tittin paeyi we, nge ra siusaengi aaemweoi sonotaw pwe epwe posuw.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Aaen Jesus Menaw Sefaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mark 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luke 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">John 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Mwirin Sabbath, nee oatosoron raaenin Sunday, Maria Magdalene me pwan Maria we erhai ra noa pwe repwe noa pipiiy paeyi we. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Nge ese mmwaei mwo nge a fanemwar faniuw, pwe naiun Soamwoon angkenus a ittiw saengi naaeng, a ittiw peniy noa faai we saengi aesemaen paeyi we nge a mooat tiw wooan. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Wunuunun nge a weei rhag weriwer, nge mengaagiun a gin weei rhag pwerhepwerhen <char style="tl">snow</char>. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Iwe nge poos kkewe ra gin ngong reen aar mesag nge ra weer maani mae.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Iwe nge angkenus we a kkepas ngaeniir rhooapwut kkewe, nge a iura pwe, “Oawsoapw mesag. I giuneei pwe oaw giutta Jesus iwe re kurusuw noa. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Esa nono igeei, a menaw sefaaen, taeppen rhag miniwe e aepesa. Oaw itto iga, oawpwe weri igiwe ewon mwo ee. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Oaw mwetekkaei noa, pwe oawpwe noa aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, ‘A menaw sefaaen saengi maenoa, nge a gommw noa Galilee me mmwaemi, nge iginaan minne oawpwene noa weri me ee.’ Oaw maengiy meeta e i aengaenigaemi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Iwe ra mwetekkaein siusaengi paeyi we, ra mesag nge a pwan igin kker, ra fattapw pwe repwe noa aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Ese mmwaei mwo nge Jesus a rhuungiir nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Sirow woami.” Iwe ra itto reen, ra ammwarhiu pirheen nge ra aesirowu. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw mesag! Oawnoa aengaeniir rhooawe pwiiy pwe repwe noa Galilee, pwe repwe naaen noa weriaei me ee.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar Poos Kkewe Fioang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Igiwe rhooapwut kkewe ra feffaaeraeg noa, aaemweoi poosun paeyi we ra sefaaen noa noan aepinoamw we nge ra noa fioangei ngaeniir soamwoonin patere kkewe oanongaen meeta we a wen. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Soamwooniir patere me mwaaen kkewe aar ra rhu fengaen nge ra pwiungiuw meeta repwe feeori; iwe ra ngaenneer poos kkewe towunepaen senaapiy, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>nge ra aengaeniir pwe, “Oawpwe aengaeniir aeremas pwe, ‘Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun re itto nee pwoong we, nge ra itto mwoarhow noa miniwe oanongan oatowe aemaem aei maiur.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Nge aere <char style="tl">governor</char> e rongorong kkepas eei, aemaem aeipwe aeffeta ngaeni pwe soapw reen aaemi feoffeeor aenneew, nge aaemi esooar meeta minne oawpwe tip mwaramwar reen.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Iwe poos kkewe ra pwigi senaapiy we nge ra feeori meeta we re aengaeniir pwe repwe feeori. Iwe fioangei nge a rheeoi noa neeiir oanongeer Jews toorito igina.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwae Ngaeniir Rhooan Kkayeo Kkewe Naiun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mark 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luke 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">John 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Feof 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Mwirin rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me erhai ra noa wooan rhug we noan Galilee, igiwe Jesus e aengaeniir pwe repwe noa ee. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Igiwe ra weri, ra aesirowu, nge aaemweoi me neeiir retip mwaramwar. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Jesus a aerepaar to nge a iura pwe, “Semaei a ngaenneaei oanongaen nemenem wooai naaeng me feoniufan pwe nemaeniaei. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Iwe oawnoa ngaeniir aeremas noan oanongaen pwiuneoi, oawpwe noa feeoriir pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo, nge oawwa paptismusaar faaen itaen Saam, me Naiun me Espritu Santus. <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Nge oawwa oasuguunaar pwe repwe tapweei oanongaen minne iya aepesa ngaenigaemi oawpwe feeori. Nge ngaang ipwe nonno reemi toori nee soapwonoan feoniufan.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
